asr-000504
00:42:13.940 --> 00:42:15.940
Rep. Ernesto "Ernix" Dionisio Jr.: and Asec Ferdowsi Masnar.

asr-000505
00:42:15.940 --> 00:42:17.940
Deputy Speaker Vincent Franco "Duke" D. Frasco: We acknowledge the presence

asr-000506
00:42:17.940 --> 00:42:19.940
Deputy Speaker Vincent Franco "Duke" D. Frasco: of the heads and officials of the Department

asr-000507
00:42:19.940 --> 00:42:21.940
Deputy Speaker Vincent Franco "Duke" D. Frasco: of the Dangerous Drugs Board,

asr-000508
00:42:21.940 --> 00:42:23.940
Deputy Speaker Vincent Franco "Duke" D. Frasco: headed by Chairperson

asr-000509
00:42:23.940 --> 00:42:25.940
Deputy Speaker Vincent Franco "Duke" D. Frasco: Oscar Villanueva.

asr-000510
00:42:25.940 --> 00:42:27.940
Deputy Speaker Vincent Franco "Duke" D. Frasco: Welcome to the House of Representatives.

asr-000511
00:42:27.940 --> 00:42:29.940
Deputy Speaker Vincent Franco "Duke" D. Frasco: Majority Leader.

asr-000512
00:42:29.940 --> 00:42:31.940
Rep. Ernesto "Ernix" Dionisio Jr.: Mr. Speaker, I move to

asr-000513
00:42:31.940 --> 00:42:33.940
Rep. Ernesto "Ernix" Dionisio Jr.: recognize Representative

asr-000514
00:42:33.940 --> 00:42:35.940
Rep. Ernesto "Ernix" Dionisio Jr.: Marcelino Marci R. Teodoro,

asr-000515
00:42:35.940 --> 00:42:37.940
Rep. Ernesto "Ernix" Dionisio Jr.: Vice Chairperson of the Committee

asr-000516
00:42:37.940 --> 00:42:39.940
Rep. Ernesto "Ernix" Dionisio Jr.: on Appropriations, to answer

asr-000517
00:42:39.940 --> 00:42:41.940
Rep. Ernesto "Ernix" Dionisio Jr.: questions on the proposed budget

asr-000518
00:42:41.940 --> 00:42:43.940
Rep. Ernesto "Ernix" Dionisio Jr.: of the Department of Dangerous

asr-000519
00:42:43.940 --> 00:42:44.750
Rep. Ernesto "Ernix" Dionisio Jr.: Drugs Board.

asr-000519-split-2
00:42:44.750 --> 00:42:45.940
Deputy Speaker Vincent Franco "Duke" D. Frasco: Representative

asr-000520
00:42:45.940 --> 00:42:47.940
Deputy Speaker Vincent Franco "Duke" D. Frasco: Teodoro is recognized. Please proceed.

asr-000521
00:42:47.940 --> 00:42:49.940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Mr. Speaker,

asr-000522
00:42:49.940 --> 00:42:51.940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: my distinguished colleagues, a serious

asr-000523
00:42:51.940 --> 00:42:53.940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: anti-drug policy

asr-000524
00:42:53.940 --> 00:42:55.940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: cannot end with enforcement.

asr-000525
00:42:55.940 --> 00:42:57.940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: It must also ask what happens

asr-000526
00:42:57.940 --> 00:42:59.940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: before addiction takes hold,

asr-000527
00:42:59.940 --> 00:43:01.940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: what happens when a person

asr-000528
00:43:01.940 --> 00:43:03.940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: needs treatment, and what happens

asr-000529
00:43:03.940 --> 00:43:05.940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: after rehabilitation when that

asr-000530
00:43:05.940 --> 00:43:07.940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: person tries to return to family

asr-000531
00:43:07.940 --> 00:43:09.940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: and community.

asr-000532
00:43:09.940 --> 00:43:11.940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: That is where the Dangerous Drugs

asr-000533
00:43:11.940 --> 00:43:13.940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Board has an important role.

asr-000534
00:43:13.940 --> 00:43:15.940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: For many Filipino families,

asr-000535
00:43:15.940 --> 00:43:17.940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: this side of the drug problem is

asr-000536
00:43:17.940 --> 00:43:19.940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: very real. May magulang

asr-000537
00:43:19.940 --> 00:43:21.940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: na hindi naghahanap

asr-000538
00:43:21.940 --> 00:43:23.940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: ng huhulihin. Ang hinahanap

asr-000539
00:43:23.940 --> 00:43:25.940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: niya ay tulong para sa anak niya.

asr-000540
00:43:25.940 --> 00:43:27.940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: The drug problem

asr-000541
00:43:27.940 --> 00:43:29.940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: is not only about stopping

asr-000542
00:43:29.940 --> 00:43:31.940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: supply. It is also about

asr-000543
00:43:31.940 --> 00:43:33.940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: reducing demand,

asr-000544
00:43:33.940 --> 00:43:35.940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: preventing abuse, providing

asr-000545
00:43:35.940 --> 00:43:37.940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: treatment, and helping people

asr-000546
00:43:37.940 --> 00:43:39.940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: recover. DDB

asr-000547
00:43:39.940 --> 00:43:41.940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: is not primarily an arresting

asr-000548
00:43:41.940 --> 00:43:43.940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: agency, and it does

asr-000549
00:43:43.940 --> 00:43:45.940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: not operate the entire treatment

asr-000550
00:43:45.940 --> 00:43:47.940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: and rehabilitation system.

asr-000551
00:43:47.940 --> 00:43:49.940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Its role is to help government

asr-000552
00:43:49.940 --> 00:43:51.940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: build and coordinate one

asr-000553
00:43:51.940 --> 00:43:53.940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: national strategy,

asr-000554
00:43:53.940 --> 00:43:55.940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: linking enforcement,

asr-000555
00:43:55.940 --> 00:43:57.940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: prevention, treatment,

asr-000556
00:43:57.940 --> 00:43:59.940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: rehabilitation,

asr-000557
00:43:59.940 --> 00:44:01.940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: and reintegration.

asr-000558
00:44:03.940 --> 00:44:05.940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: That may not always be the most

asr-000559
00:44:05.940 --> 00:44:07.940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: visible part of the government's

asr-000560
00:44:07.940 --> 00:44:09.940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: anti-drug effort, but

asr-000561
00:44:09.940 --> 00:44:11.940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: it is essential.

asr-000562
00:44:11.940 --> 00:44:13.940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Because if enforcement is

asr-000563
00:44:13.940 --> 00:44:15.940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: working in one direction,

asr-000564
00:44:15.940 --> 00:44:17.940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: treatment in another,

asr-000565
00:44:17.940 --> 00:44:19.940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: and local programs somewhere else,

asr-000566
00:44:19.940 --> 00:44:21.940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: then we do not yet have

asr-000567
00:44:21.940 --> 00:44:23.940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: a national strategy.

asr-000568
00:44:23.940 --> 00:44:25.940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: We simply have

asr-000569
00:44:25.940 --> 00:44:27.940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: separate programs.

asr-000570
00:44:27.940 --> 00:44:29.940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: DDB exists to help bring those

asr-000571
00:44:29.940 --> 00:44:31.940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: parts together. The

asr-000572
00:44:31.940 --> 00:44:33.940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: available data show progress,

asr-000573
00:44:33.940 --> 00:44:35.940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: and they also show why sustained

asr-000574
00:44:35.940 --> 00:44:37.940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: policy coordination still

asr-000575
00:44:37.940 --> 00:44:39.940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: matters. The

asr-000576
00:44:39.940 --> 00:44:41.940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: 2023 National Household

asr-000577
00:44:41.940 --> 00:44:43.940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Survey reported

asr-000578
00:44:43.940 --> 00:44:45.940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: that current drug use prevalence

asr-000579
00:44:45.940 --> 00:44:47.940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: declined from

asr-000580
00:44:47.940 --> 00:44:49.940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: 2.05% in

asr-000581
00:44:49.940 --> 00:44:51.940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: 2019 to

asr-000582
00:44:51.940 --> 00:44:53.940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: 1.71%

asr-000583
00:44:53.940 --> 00:44:55.940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: in 2023.

asr-000584
00:44:55.940 --> 00:44:57.940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: That represents approximately

asr-000585
00:44:57.940 --> 00:44:59.940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: 1.4 million

asr-000586
00:44:59.940 --> 00:45:03.160
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: people in the country.

asr-000599
00:45:03.160 --> 00:45:11.120
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: That decline is encouraging. Pero hindi ibig sabihin na pwede na tayong maging kampante.

asr-000600
00:45:11.120 --> 00:45:14.540
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Mahigit isang milyong Pilipino pa rin yan.

asr-000601
00:45:14.540 --> 00:45:18.140
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: And not every person in that number needs the same intervention.

asr-000602
00:45:19.440 --> 00:45:21.520
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Some may require residential treatment.

asr-000603
00:45:22.760 --> 00:45:27.240
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Some may need outpatient services.

asr-000604
00:45:27.240 --> 00:45:31.860
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Others may be better served through community-based rehabilitation.

asr-000605
00:45:33.140 --> 00:45:38.360
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: May iba na ang kailangan ay continuing support para hindi bumalik sa dating sitwasyon.

asr-000606
00:45:39.320 --> 00:45:42.820
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: So the task is broader than simply counting facilities.

asr-000607
00:45:43.700 --> 00:45:51.420
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: The value of DDB's coordinating role is to help government understand what kind of help is needed,

asr-000608
00:45:51.880 --> 00:45:56.820
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: where it is needed, and how people can actually reach it.

asr-000609
00:45:57.240 --> 00:46:09.020
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: For Fiscal Year 2027, the Dangerous Drugs Board has a proposed total agency budget of P526.54 million.

asr-000610
00:46:09.940 --> 00:46:18.820
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: In Fiscal Year 2026, its total agency budget was P598.17 million.

asr-000611
00:46:20.060 --> 00:46:26.820
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: That is a reduction of P71.62 million, or approximately 12%.

asr-000612
00:46:27.240 --> 00:46:33.460
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Its new general appropriations amount to P418.14 million.

asr-000613
00:46:34.340 --> 00:46:38.780
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: So this is not an agency asking for a large expansion.

asr-000614
00:46:39.820 --> 00:46:45.740
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Sa totoo lang, mas maliit pa ang kabuang budget na hinihingi para sa susunod na taon.

asr-000615
00:46:45.940 --> 00:46:52.640
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: But DDB is still being asked to coordinate a broad national strategy.

asr-000616
00:46:53.480 --> 00:46:57.220
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: That is why the proposed amount is reasonable.

asr-000617
00:46:57.240 --> 00:47:09.740
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Within the Fiscal Year 2027 proposal, P169.18 million is allocated to the Drug Abuse Prevention and Control Program.

asr-000618
00:47:10.860 --> 00:47:20.060
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Of this amount, P111.69 million is for policy formulation, surveys, research, and studies.

asr-000619
00:47:21.060 --> 00:47:26.240
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Another P32.84 million is for advocacy and information programs.

asr-000620
00:47:27.240 --> 00:47:31.900
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: And P24.64 million is for capacity building.

asr-000621
00:47:33.100 --> 00:47:37.200
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: The size of the allocation for research and policy deserves context.

asr-000622
00:47:38.380 --> 00:47:45.660
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: This spending is justified when it gives government a clearer basis for where and how to intervene.

asr-000623
00:47:46.760 --> 00:47:48.080
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Simple lang ang punto.

asr-000624
00:47:48.080 --> 00:47:55.680
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Kung hindi natin alam kung nasaan ang problema, paano natin malalaman kung saan ilalagay ang pera.

asr-000625
00:47:55.680 --> 00:48:04.900
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Kung hindi natin alam kung aling programa ang gumagana, baka taon-taon lang tayong gumagastos dahil nakasanayan na.

asr-000626
00:48:05.960 --> 00:48:16.580
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: At kung hindi natin alam kung ano ang nangyayari pagkatapos ng treatment, paano natin malalaman kung talagang nagkaroon ng recovery.

asr-000627
00:48:17.500 --> 00:48:19.180
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: That is why data matters.

asr-000628
00:48:19.180 --> 00:48:28.660
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Because research has a value, or research has value when it guides actual decisions to guide us for future allocation of resources.

asr-000629
00:48:29.420 --> 00:48:32.520
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: It should help identify where more treatment is needed.

asr-000630
00:48:33.280 --> 00:48:36.880
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: It should show where community-based programs should be expanded.

asr-000631
00:48:37.660 --> 00:48:40.640
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: It should guide where prevention should be strengthened.

asr-000632
00:48:40.640 --> 00:48:49.160
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: And it should help Congress and the executive identify which interventions are producing the best results.

asr-000633
00:48:49.180 --> 00:48:56.080
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: That is where DDB adds value as a policy and coordinating institution.

asr-000634
00:48:57.080 --> 00:49:01.060
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: This becomes even more important when we talk about rehabilitation.

asr-000635
00:49:02.160 --> 00:49:09.440
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: The Department of Health is in the best position to tell Congress the actual treatment capacity of the country.

asr-000636
00:49:09.440 --> 00:49:18.940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Available beds, occupancy, waiting lists, outpatient services, personnel, equipment,

asr-000637
00:49:19.180 --> 00:49:21.120
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: and facility requirements.

asr-000638
00:49:22.260 --> 00:49:29.240
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: DDB should help bring all of that information together under one national strategy.

asr-000639
00:49:30.080 --> 00:49:32.400
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Kasi maraming ahensya ang gumagalaw.

asr-000640
00:49:33.240 --> 00:49:35.080
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: PIDEA handles enforcement.

asr-000641
00:49:36.060 --> 00:49:40.020
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: DOH handles much of the health and treatment side.

asr-000642
00:49:41.080 --> 00:49:44.840
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: LGUs handle many community-based programs.

asr-000643
00:49:45.600 --> 00:49:48.760
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Other agencies help with social support.

asr-000644
00:49:48.760 --> 00:49:49.860
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: And reintegration.

asr-000645
00:49:50.900 --> 00:49:57.300
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Kaya mahalaga na may isang malinaw na direksyon at isang national strategy.

asr-000646
00:49:58.280 --> 00:50:00.360
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Maraming ahensya ang may programa.

asr-000647
00:50:01.180 --> 00:50:03.360
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Maraming ahensya rin ang may pondo.

asr-000648
00:50:04.380 --> 00:50:08.140
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Ang tungkulin ng DDB ay tulungang pagdugtungin ang mga ito.

asr-000649
00:50:08.780 --> 00:50:13.660
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Para sa dulo, malinaw kung paano nagkakaugnay-ugnay ang mga programa

asr-000650
00:50:13.660 --> 00:50:18.660
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: at kung paano nito matutulungan o natutulungan ang Pilipinong nangayon.

asr-000651
00:50:18.760 --> 00:50:21.240
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: At kung paano nito nangangailangan ng servisyo.

asr-000652
00:50:22.040 --> 00:50:26.320
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: That is the value of a strong coordinating institution.

asr-000653
00:50:27.120 --> 00:50:32.220
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: And one reason DDB's capacity deserves continued support.

asr-000654
00:50:33.020 --> 00:50:39.700
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: The NEP also recognizes that rehabilitation funding extends beyond DDB's regular appropriation

asr-000655
00:50:39.700 --> 00:50:47.760
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: with statutory funding sources involving PCSO and Pagco revenues for rehabilitation activities

asr-000656
00:50:47.760 --> 00:50:48.700
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: and government services.

asr-000657
00:50:48.760 --> 00:50:59.660
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: The purpose of these funding streams is to translate appropriations into services that people can actually reach.

asr-000658
00:51:00.660 --> 00:51:05.760
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Doon dapat makita ang halaga ng pondo kung maaabot ang servisyo.

asr-000659
00:51:06.620 --> 00:51:13.080
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Kung may nanay sa probinsya na gustong ipagamot ang anak niya, dapat may malinaw siyang mapupuntahan.

asr-000660
00:51:14.080 --> 00:51:18.620
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Kung natapos ang rehab, dapat may support sa pagbalik sa komunidad.

asr-000661
00:51:18.760 --> 00:51:26.200
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: At kung may community-based program, alam natin dapat kung alin ang talagang efektibo.

asr-000662
00:51:27.020 --> 00:51:31.620
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Those are the outcomes this budget should help government deliver.

asr-000663
00:51:32.440 --> 00:51:40.280
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Mr. Speaker, a credible anti-drug policy has to know the difference between those who profit from illegal drugs

asr-000664
00:51:40.280 --> 00:51:44.300
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: and those who are trying to free themselves from dependence.

asr-000665
00:51:44.300 --> 00:51:46.980
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: The distinction should remain.

asr-000666
00:51:47.620 --> 00:51:48.700
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Sa sindikato, matatagal.

asr-000667
00:51:48.760 --> 00:51:49.740
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Sa tagang batas.

asr-000668
00:51:50.300 --> 00:51:54.820
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Sa taong gustong magbago, may tulong at may daan pabalik.

asr-000669
00:51:55.680 --> 00:52:04.160
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: And between those two responsibilities, enforcement on one side, recovery on the other,

asr-000670
00:52:04.720 --> 00:52:07.340
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: we need policy that connects the work of government.

asr-000671
00:52:08.000 --> 00:52:09.760
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: That is where DDB matters.

asr-000672
00:52:10.800 --> 00:52:14.260
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: So the purpose of this budget is not simply to maintain an office.

asr-000673
00:52:14.940 --> 00:52:17.580
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: It is to maintain the institution that helps government.

asr-000674
00:52:17.580 --> 00:52:18.580
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: See them.

asr-000675
00:52:18.760 --> 00:52:21.580
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: To prevent our problem and respond to it as one.

asr-000676
00:52:21.580 --> 00:52:23.580
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: And one clear objective.

asr-000677
00:52:23.580 --> 00:52:31.680
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Fewer Filipino harmed by illegal drugs and more Filipinos given a real chance to recover.

asr-000678
00:52:31.680 --> 00:52:34.680
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Yan ang mahalagang trabaho ng DDB.

asr-000679
00:52:34.680 --> 00:52:46.140
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: And for these reasons, I rise to sponsor and respectfully urge this House to approve the proposed fiscal year 2027 budget of the Dangerous Drugs Board.

asr-000680
00:52:46.140 --> 00:52:48.140
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Maraming salamat, Mr. Speaker.

asr-000681
00:52:48.760 --> 00:52:50.260
Deputy Speaker Vincent Franco "Duke" D. Frasco: Thank you very much.

asr-000682
00:52:50.360 --> 00:52:51.020
Deputy Speaker Vincent Franco "Duke" D. Frasco: Majority Leader.

asr-000683
00:52:51.720 --> 00:53:00.040
Rep. Ernesto "Ernix" Dionisio Jr.: Mr. Speaker, I move to recognize Representative Presley C. De Jesus of Partylist, Filireka,

asr-000684
00:53:00.620 --> 00:53:05.660
Rep. Ernesto "Ernix" Dionisio Jr.: to interpolate the sponsor on the proposed budget of the Dangerous Drugs Board.

asr-000685
00:53:06.060 --> 00:53:09.700
Deputy Speaker Vincent Franco "Duke" D. Frasco: Representative Presley De Jesus is recognized to interpolate the sponsor.

asr-000686
00:53:10.700 --> 00:53:12.240
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Thank you, Mr. Speaker.

asr-000687
00:53:12.240 --> 00:53:17.240
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: May the good sponsor yield some questions from this representation.

asr-000688
00:53:18.760 --> 00:53:24.700
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: May first question, para alam po ng ating mga kababayan na nakikinig.

asr-000689
00:53:24.700 --> 00:53:31.080
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: What is the primary function of DDB or Dangerous Drugs Board?

asr-000690
00:53:32.760 --> 00:53:40.200
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Basically, DDB is a coordinating agency involved in policy formulation.

asr-000691
00:53:40.200 --> 00:53:48.120
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: In order for us to adopt a national strategy,

asr-000692
00:53:48.760 --> 00:53:54.120
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: to have the national strategy against illegal drugs.

asr-000693
00:53:54.120 --> 00:54:00.400
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Ito ang nagpapatupad ng Philippine Anti-Illegal Drugs Strategy natin.

asr-000694
00:54:02.220 --> 00:54:04.560
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Mr. Speaker, this is my sponsor.

asr-000695
00:54:04.760 --> 00:54:07.980
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Does it include our local government units?

asr-000696
00:54:08.760 --> 00:54:16.040
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Sa community-based rehabilitation program ay kasama ang mga local government unit natin.

asr-000697
00:54:16.800 --> 00:54:18.320
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: At tulad ng ating nabanggit,

asr-000698
00:54:18.760 --> 00:54:24.180
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: ang ibang revenue stream na nakukuha ng DDB,

asr-000699
00:54:25.040 --> 00:54:29.440
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: lalo na yung mga itinakda ng batas,

asr-000700
00:54:29.940 --> 00:54:37.600
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: ang mga ahensya upang magbigay ng tulong tulad ng PagCorp or PCSO.

asr-000701
00:54:38.000 --> 00:54:45.600
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Ito ang ginagamit ng mga pondo o pantulong para sa mga pagbuo o pagtatatag

asr-000702
00:54:46.560 --> 00:54:48.680
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: ng mga community-based rehabilitation.

asr-000703
00:54:48.760 --> 00:54:58.240
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Ito ang ginagamit ng mga rehab treatment na pinamahalaan ng ating mga local government unit.

asr-000704
00:54:59.160 --> 00:55:00.060
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Thank you, Mr. Speaker.

asr-000705
00:55:00.260 --> 00:55:01.100
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: This is my sponsor.

asr-000706
00:55:02.120 --> 00:55:10.080
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Pwede nyo ba sabihin sa amin ilan ho ba ang member ng board and what's the composition of those members of the DDB?

asr-000707
00:55:10.840 --> 00:55:12.240
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Sino mo bang bumubuo rito?

asr-000708
00:55:12.240 --> 00:55:12.340
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Thank you.

asr-000709
00:55:16.640 --> 00:55:18.600
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Mr. Speaker,

asr-000710
00:55:18.760 --> 00:55:22.760
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: we have 12 line departments.

asr-000711
00:55:22.760 --> 00:55:39.840
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Thank you, Mr. Speaker.

asr-000712
00:55:39.840 --> 00:55:49.300
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: We have line agencies, Mr. Speaker.

asr-000713
00:55:49.300 --> 00:55:52.680
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: We have 12 here identified.

asr-000714
00:55:53.140 --> 00:55:57.540
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Coming from first on the enforcement side,

asr-000715
00:55:58.380 --> 00:56:00.300
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: for example, the Philippine National Police,

asr-000716
00:56:02.060 --> 00:56:07.300
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: the PIDEA, NBI, DILG,

asr-000717
00:56:07.300 --> 00:56:11.940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: for prosecution, we have the DOJ,

asr-000718
00:56:14.940 --> 00:56:18.020
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: for rehabilitation and reintegration,

asr-000719
00:56:18.160 --> 00:56:19.300
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: napakahalaga po nito.

asr-000720
00:56:20.080 --> 00:56:22.260
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Meron po tayong CHED kasama dito,

asr-000721
00:56:23.240 --> 00:56:24.760
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: DepEd kasama rin,

asr-000722
00:56:25.320 --> 00:56:32.240
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: ang DSWD para sa mga tulong na kailangan nilang matanggap,

asr-000723
00:56:32.860 --> 00:56:34.960
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: ang DOLI sa reintegration,

asr-000724
00:56:35.120 --> 00:56:37.280
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: lalo na yung katapos na ng mga,

asr-000725
00:56:37.300 --> 00:56:37.800
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: yung mga treatment.

asr-000726
00:56:40.080 --> 00:56:46.140
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Yung may mga international commitment din po tayo

asr-000727
00:56:46.140 --> 00:56:51.440
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: with regards to our anti-illegal drug program,

asr-000728
00:56:51.940 --> 00:56:55.720
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: kaya po pati ang DFA ay kasama rin po rito.

asr-000729
00:56:57.360 --> 00:57:01.300
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Of course, we have a permanent secretary

asr-000730
00:57:01.900 --> 00:57:04.780
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: appointed by the president

asr-000731
00:57:04.780 --> 00:57:05.780
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: who handles the,

asr-000732
00:57:07.300 --> 00:57:09.520
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: the affairs of the board.

asr-000733
00:57:10.220 --> 00:57:13.980
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Narito rin po yung National Youth Commission.

asr-000734
00:57:14.980 --> 00:57:15.980
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Ibat-ibang,

asr-000735
00:57:16.180 --> 00:57:18.600
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: ibat-ibang mga ahensya po,

asr-000736
00:57:18.740 --> 00:57:19.840
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: kaya napakahalaga po

asr-000737
00:57:19.840 --> 00:57:25.180
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: na maging effective po sa coordination ang DDB.

asr-000738
00:57:25.480 --> 00:57:27.260
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Kaya po sa pondo nila,

asr-000739
00:57:27.400 --> 00:57:29.180
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: mahalaga rin po yung mga data,

asr-000740
00:57:29.500 --> 00:57:30.160
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: yung research,

asr-000741
00:57:30.460 --> 00:57:31.620
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: yung mga pag-aaral.

asr-000742
00:57:32.160 --> 00:57:33.840
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: So when they formulate policies,

asr-000743
00:57:34.700 --> 00:57:36.840
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: it will be data driven,

asr-000744
00:57:37.300 --> 00:57:39.900
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: at batay din po ito

asr-000745
00:57:39.900 --> 00:57:43.660
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: sa isang research na grounded

asr-000746
00:57:43.660 --> 00:57:46.060
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: sa mga pangangailangan po talaga

asr-000747
00:57:46.060 --> 00:57:47.840
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: at naging problema.

asr-000748
00:57:49.080 --> 00:57:51.140
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Thank you, Mr. Speaker,

asr-000749
00:57:51.300 --> 00:57:52.180
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: the secret sponsor.

asr-000750
00:57:52.860 --> 00:57:54.760
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: So it's all started pala ito.

asr-000751
00:57:55.380 --> 00:57:57.140
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: So I agree with you

asr-000752
00:57:57.140 --> 00:58:00.420
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: with those interagency

asr-000753
00:58:00.420 --> 00:58:02.160
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: to the departments involved,

asr-000754
00:58:02.440 --> 00:58:04.160
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: especially the youth,

asr-000755
00:58:04.300 --> 00:58:05.320
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: the National Youth Commission.

asr-000756
00:58:05.320 --> 00:58:06.160
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: But,

asr-000757
00:58:06.160 --> 00:58:08.760
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: wala ho bang sa private sector,

asr-000758
00:58:09.580 --> 00:58:10.960
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: kahit na naupo,

asr-000759
00:58:11.380 --> 00:58:12.380
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: kahit na ano lang siya,

asr-000760
00:58:12.960 --> 00:58:13.720
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: ex-officio,

asr-000761
00:58:14.040 --> 00:58:15.780
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: wala ho tayong member ng private sector?

asr-000762
00:58:18.780 --> 00:58:20.080
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Sa ngayon po,

asr-000763
00:58:20.480 --> 00:58:23.300
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: aminado po tayo na

asr-000764
00:58:23.300 --> 00:58:27.760
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: meron po in-identify na NGO representative.

asr-000765
00:58:28.200 --> 00:58:28.500
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Dapat.

asr-000766
00:58:29.260 --> 00:58:30.080
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Pero sa ngayon po,

asr-000767
00:58:30.140 --> 00:58:31.300
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: aminado po tayo,

asr-000768
00:58:31.680 --> 00:58:33.420
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: and siguro on this aspect,

asr-000769
00:58:33.540 --> 00:58:34.600
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: we could improve on it,

asr-000770
00:58:34.600 --> 00:58:35.600
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: ay bakanti,

asr-000771
00:58:36.160 --> 00:58:39.820
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: meron po yung upuan na iyon

asr-000772
00:58:39.820 --> 00:58:41.760
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: para doon sa NGO representative.

asr-000773
00:58:42.200 --> 00:58:46.240
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Perhaps we could recalibrate

asr-000774
00:58:46.240 --> 00:58:49.360
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: our position on this matter.

asr-000775
00:58:52.100 --> 00:58:53.240
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Meron po rin tayo,

asr-000776
00:58:53.400 --> 00:58:55.700
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: mga nanggaling po

asr-000777
00:58:55.700 --> 00:58:57.960
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: sa Integrated Bar of the Philippines,

asr-000778
00:58:58.200 --> 00:58:59.300
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: sa IBP,

asr-000779
00:58:59.540 --> 00:59:01.880
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: na nakaupo

asr-000780
00:59:01.880 --> 00:59:06.140
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: ang pangulo po nito.

asr-000781
00:59:06.160 --> 00:59:09.440
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Ang nakaupo po sa board

asr-000782
00:59:09.440 --> 00:59:11.740
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: bilang ex-officio member po.

asr-000783
00:59:13.460 --> 00:59:14.300
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Thank you,

asr-000784
00:59:14.960 --> 00:59:15.500
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Mr. Speaker,

asr-000785
00:59:15.660 --> 00:59:16.920
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: distinguished sponsor.

asr-000786
00:59:17.420 --> 00:59:18.440
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Ako yung natutuwa,

asr-000787
00:59:18.520 --> 00:59:20.640
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: because it's an interagency,

asr-000788
00:59:21.480 --> 00:59:22.680
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: came from different

asr-000789
00:59:22.680 --> 00:59:25.780
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: branches of the government.

asr-000790
00:59:26.040 --> 00:59:26.460
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Okay lang ito.

asr-000791
00:59:26.540 --> 00:59:29.000
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: But please include the NGO.

asr-000792
00:59:29.860 --> 00:59:30.860
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Kailangan natin ito,

asr-000793
00:59:31.500 --> 00:59:33.780
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: at least for check and balance purposes.

asr-000794
00:59:34.000 --> 00:59:34.680
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Para wala sabi.

asr-000795
00:59:34.680 --> 00:59:36.120
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: But the composition itself,

asr-000796
00:59:36.160 --> 00:59:37.160
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Mr. Speaker.

asr-000797
00:59:37.620 --> 00:59:39.280
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Meron din pong nagtatanong,

asr-000798
00:59:39.480 --> 00:59:40.920
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Mr. Speaker,

asr-000799
00:59:41.880 --> 00:59:43.040
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: bakit wala ang

asr-000800
00:59:43.040 --> 00:59:44.800
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Commission on Human Rights

asr-000801
00:59:44.800 --> 00:59:47.160
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: sa board?

asr-000802
00:59:48.100 --> 00:59:49.180
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Napakahalaga po

asr-000803
00:59:49.180 --> 00:59:51.160
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: ng papel ngayon

asr-000804
00:59:51.160 --> 00:59:52.940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: dahil ang strategy po nga natin

asr-000805
00:59:52.940 --> 00:59:55.200
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: ay balansi po yung ating pagpapatupad.

asr-000806
00:59:55.660 --> 00:59:57.280
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Dapat rights-based

asr-000807
00:59:57.280 --> 00:59:59.320
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: at health-based po yung

asr-000808
00:59:59.320 --> 00:59:59.520
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: ano.

asr-000809
01:00:00.000 --> 01:00:10.300
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Dahil ang CHR po ay isang constitutional body, kaya independent po siya, kaya po parang nangyayari.

asr-000809-split-2
01:00:10.300 --> 01:00:33.420
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: In Section 87 of Republic Act No. 9165, the Special Account in the General Fund, or SAGF, supports government treatment and rehabilitation facilities. How much has the DDB collected and obligated from the SAGF in fiscal year 2026?

asr-000810
01:00:33.500 --> 01:00:42.960
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Nung 2026 po, Mr. Speaker, ay meron pong P175 million na nakuha po.

asr-000811
01:00:42.960 --> 01:00:47.500
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: P175 million po.

asr-000812
01:00:50.260 --> 01:00:58.060
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Ang budget po kasi ng DDB ay maliit lang po, hindi po katulad ng ibang ahensya po na tinatalakay po natin ngayon.

asr-000813
01:00:58.660 --> 01:00:59.980
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Ang P60 million.

asr-000814
01:01:00.000 --> 01:01:02.780
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Ang P60 million po ay nanggaling po ito sa Pagcor.

asr-000815
01:01:03.680 --> 01:01:10.460
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Ito po yung buwan-buwan ay meron statutorily nilalaan na 5 million.

asr-000816
01:01:11.200 --> 01:01:24.200
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: At ito naman po yung pinamamahagi sa mga community-based rehab program natin, yung mga treatment facilities na pinamamahalaan ng mga LGU.

asr-000817
01:01:24.560 --> 01:01:29.100
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Isang halimbawa po, kanina nakita ko po si Congressman Dumogan dito.

asr-000818
01:01:29.580 --> 01:01:29.980
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Ang bagyo.

asr-000819
01:01:30.000 --> 01:01:34.100
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Ang bagyo po ay meron pong gano'ng allocation po.

asr-000820
01:01:35.120 --> 01:01:39.000
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Ang PCS po ay nakapagbigay po ng 81 million po.

asr-000821
01:01:40.120 --> 01:01:50.540
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Ang MM Metro Manilo Terp Corporation ay 3 million po.

asr-000822
01:01:51.080 --> 01:01:59.040
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: At yung iba pong mga licenses na nakukulekta po natin ay may 29 million po.

asr-000823
01:01:59.040 --> 01:01:59.980
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Sa kabuhan po.

asr-000824
01:02:00.000 --> 01:02:04.760
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Ang PCS po ay 175 million, 15,272 pesos po.

asr-000825
01:02:05.200 --> 01:02:07.640
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Thank you, Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Sponsor.

asr-000826
01:02:08.480 --> 01:02:18.900
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Board Resolution No. 12, Series of 2026, approved 15 million for Bakon, Ibungan, and Lupon.

asr-000827
01:02:19.460 --> 01:02:27.320
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: While Board Resolution No. 15, Series of 2026, approved 10 million for Lawag City and Marilao.

asr-000828
01:02:27.320 --> 01:02:29.360
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: So, what criteria?

asr-000829
01:02:30.000 --> 01:02:33.780
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Does the DDB use in selecting LGUs for these grants?

asr-000830
01:02:34.320 --> 01:02:39.000
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: And how does it determine the 5 million allocation per LGU?

asr-000831
01:02:41.080 --> 01:02:49.380
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Ang unang criteria po, ito naman po lahat halos ng lugar ay maaring sabihin.

asr-000832
01:02:50.080 --> 01:02:54.840
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Pero meron po silang extensive drug problem na na-identify.

asr-000833
01:02:54.980 --> 01:02:55.600
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Una yun po.

asr-000834
01:02:55.760 --> 01:02:57.160
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Yung sa pangangailangan.

asr-000835
01:02:57.980 --> 01:02:59.000
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: So, yun ang unahong criteria.

asr-000836
01:03:00.000 --> 01:03:07.500
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Ang criteria yung ginagamit po ng DDB, pagpili po ng mga LGU na bibigyan ng grants po nila.

asr-000837
01:03:08.300 --> 01:03:19.880
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Tapos, meron dapat silang mga komunidad na classified as affected by the Barangay Drug Clearing Program na pinatutupad po ng PIDEA.

asr-000838
01:03:20.880 --> 01:03:26.880
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Meron po ako ditong listahan po para sa taong 2026.

asr-000839
01:03:28.380 --> 01:03:29.880
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Labing apat po sila.

asr-000840
01:03:30.000 --> 01:03:37.960
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Na narito, pwede ko pong ibigay sa kagalang-galang po.

asr-000841
01:03:41.760 --> 01:03:46.000
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Bakon, tipungan, kapangan po.

asr-000842
01:03:48.120 --> 01:03:48.740
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: And lupon.

asr-000843
01:03:49.580 --> 01:03:50.020
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Lubok.

asr-000844
01:03:52.960 --> 01:03:54.380
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Ano po yan eh.

asr-000845
01:03:54.380 --> 01:03:59.720
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: So, special o particular po yung focus natin ginagawa.

asr-000846
01:04:00.000 --> 01:04:06.700
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Meron dahil nga po doon sa mariwan na cultivation.

asr-000847
01:04:09.880 --> 01:04:27.520
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Si lupo naman po ay dahil coastline po siya, kaya particular po tayo sa pagbabantay sa lugar na yun dahil doon sa shipment po na dumadaan o nakakapasok po doon sa lugar na yun po.

asr-000848
01:04:28.760 --> 01:04:29.680
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Mr. Speaker.

asr-000849
01:04:30.000 --> 01:04:30.640
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: So, ito ang lupon.

asr-000850
01:04:30.680 --> 01:04:31.220
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Provide perhaps.

asr-000851
01:04:32.380 --> 01:04:35.920
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Where this lupon located, Mr. Speaker, District Sponsor?

asr-000852
01:04:36.300 --> 01:04:39.820
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Sa Dabao Oriental po ito, nakalocated po.

asr-000853
01:04:40.680 --> 01:04:47.940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Ang kaharap po niya ay yung malaking dagat po ng Pacifico, yung Pacific Ocean po.

asr-000854
01:04:47.940 --> 01:04:58.240
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Kaya po, ang problema po natin ng drugs ay hindi ito parang street level lamang na ating tinutugunan.

asr-000855
01:04:58.240 --> 01:05:04.220
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Kundi, pati yung pagbabantay ng mga borders ay napakahalaga po.

asr-000856
01:05:04.460 --> 01:05:08.240
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Pati po yung paggamit ng mga mail parcels.

asr-000857
01:05:09.820 --> 01:05:13.640
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Dahil marami po ngayon, ngayong taon, tayo po.

asr-000858
01:05:14.100 --> 01:05:25.240
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Isa po yung sa Subico, yung 1,000.4 kilos.

asr-000859
01:05:25.240 --> 01:05:26.040
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: 1,000.4 kilos.

asr-000860
01:05:26.620 --> 01:05:27.280
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: O.

asr-000861
01:05:27.520 --> 01:05:28.220
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: 1,000.4 kilos.

asr-000862
01:05:28.240 --> 01:05:31.900
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Yung 1,000.4 kilos po ng shabu na nakuha natin.

asr-000863
01:05:32.360 --> 01:05:36.380
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Tapos yung mga concealment na ginagawa po sa mga parcela.

asr-000864
01:05:37.040 --> 01:05:49.000
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Meron po tayong misang operation ng pideya na iniligay sa kahon na parang pangrigalong ikakasal yung galing Korea.

asr-000865
01:05:50.380 --> 01:05:54.920
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: So, it's transnational yung problema po, Mr. Speaker.

asr-000866
01:05:55.720 --> 01:05:57.180
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Mr. Speaker, no.

asr-000867
01:05:57.180 --> 01:06:01.800
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Because here, it says Resolution No. 12, Series of 2026, approved 50 million.

asr-000868
01:06:02.160 --> 01:06:03.160
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Ito bang 50 million?

asr-000869
01:06:03.300 --> 01:06:06.120
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Hati-hati pa si Bakun, Kibungan, and Lupon.

asr-000870
01:06:06.920 --> 01:06:08.500
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: So, tagpa 5 million lang sila.

asr-000871
01:06:08.660 --> 01:06:09.940
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Parang masyadong mali ito.

asr-000872
01:06:10.260 --> 01:06:16.440
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Especially in area of Lupon, wherein we're guarding the bus.

asr-000873
01:06:18.580 --> 01:06:20.060
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Kumbaga, ito malaki masyado ito.

asr-000874
01:06:20.160 --> 01:06:22.100
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: So, would that be suffice enough?

asr-000875
01:06:22.300 --> 01:06:23.000
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Yung 5 million?

asr-000876
01:06:23.000 --> 01:06:26.840
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Yung mga 5 million po na nakikita at sinasabi.

asr-000877
01:06:27.180 --> 01:06:31.300
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Binibigay natin po na tulong sa mga munisipalidad na ito.

asr-000878
01:06:31.820 --> 01:06:35.460
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Ang totoo ay para sa infrastructure development.

asr-000879
01:06:36.100 --> 01:06:40.060
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Lalo na nung kanilang mga treatment and rehab facility.

asr-000880
01:06:40.660 --> 01:06:43.080
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Ibang bagay yung operations po.

asr-000881
01:06:43.580 --> 01:06:54.320
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: At iba rin pong bagay yung personal complement, other resource, yung sustainability po.

asr-000882
01:06:55.060 --> 01:06:56.320
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Madalas po ay yung mga...

asr-000883
01:06:57.180 --> 01:07:02.000
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Local government units po natin ay nagbibigay din ang tulong.

asr-000884
01:07:02.680 --> 01:07:09.800
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: At dahil devolved po yung services natin po.

asr-000885
01:07:10.100 --> 01:07:15.880
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: At yung pati po ang PNP ay may resource din po dito na ibinibigay po.

asr-000886
01:07:16.100 --> 01:07:17.040
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Thank you, Mr. Speaker.

asr-000887
01:07:17.180 --> 01:07:17.940
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Distinguished sponsor.

asr-000888
01:07:17.940 --> 01:07:19.040
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: My follow-up question.

asr-000889
01:07:19.820 --> 01:07:23.300
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Following the SAGF system provided to LGUs,

asr-000890
01:07:23.900 --> 01:07:25.940
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: what monitoring mechanism does...

asr-000891
01:07:27.180 --> 01:07:32.660
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: may be used to ensure that these funded facilities are completed,

asr-000892
01:07:33.460 --> 01:07:34.280
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: become operational,

asr-000893
01:07:34.960 --> 01:07:38.320
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: and are able to sustain the rehabilitation services

asr-000894
01:07:38.320 --> 01:07:40.900
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: via an initial SAGF grant?

asr-000895
01:07:41.640 --> 01:07:46.260
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: So ano bang mechanism nyo sa pagmamonitor that this has been completed, no?

asr-000896
01:07:46.820 --> 01:07:47.900
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: And it will be in use?

asr-000897
01:07:50.580 --> 01:07:55.380
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Ito po ay dinadownload sa mga local government unit.

asr-000898
01:07:55.580 --> 01:07:56.900
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Pag dinownload po ito,

asr-000899
01:07:57.180 --> 01:08:01.020
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: at kung halimbawa ibibid nila,

asr-000900
01:08:01.720 --> 01:08:03.220
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: so dapat po ay ano,

asr-000901
01:08:04.960 --> 01:08:09.560
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: they would follow all the COA regulations,

asr-000902
01:08:10.140 --> 01:08:11.180
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: procurement process,

asr-000903
01:08:12.700 --> 01:08:21.100
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: at ang COA po ang nag-oobserba sa disbursement po ng pondo nito.

asr-000904
01:08:21.100 --> 01:08:26.100
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Kaya yung obligasyon na yun ay sinisiguro

asr-000905
01:08:27.180 --> 01:08:32.520
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: na matutupad sa pamamagitan ng ating Commission on Audit po.

asr-000906
01:08:33.700 --> 01:08:40.160
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: At meron din po tayong inter-agency monitoring body

asr-000907
01:08:40.160 --> 01:08:44.320
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: na binubuo po ng apat na ahensya.

asr-000908
01:08:45.500 --> 01:08:51.500
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Dahil ang rehab at treatment ay nasa ilalim po ng pamamahala ng Department of Health.

asr-000909
01:08:51.920 --> 01:08:54.180
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Kasama po sila ang DOH.

asr-000910
01:08:54.180 --> 01:08:55.720
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Ang DILG po.

asr-000911
01:08:55.720 --> 01:08:58.760
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Naroon din po ang DDB.

asr-000912
01:08:59.600 --> 01:09:03.540
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: At ang panghuli po ay yung Commission on Audit.

asr-000913
01:09:04.820 --> 01:09:07.880
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Talagang limang minyon lang po ang na-allocate.

asr-000914
01:09:08.060 --> 01:09:09.400
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Talagang maliit po.

asr-000915
01:09:10.120 --> 01:09:13.960
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Dahil po, iyon lamang po yung remittance

asr-000916
01:09:13.960 --> 01:09:20.040
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: o nakukuha po nating pondo from PagCorp.

asr-000917
01:09:20.040 --> 01:09:24.400
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: At ito po yung ginagamit natin ng DDB.

asr-000918
01:09:24.400 --> 01:09:26.700
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Thank you, Mr. Sponsor.

asr-000919
01:09:26.880 --> 01:09:30.440
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Mr. Speaker, katapos nyo po magbigay ng 5 million,

asr-000920
01:09:31.620 --> 01:09:35.560
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: who will be responsible for funding the recurring personal, medical,

asr-000921
01:09:36.240 --> 01:09:38.380
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: and operating costs of those facilities?

asr-000922
01:09:38.600 --> 01:09:40.940
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Once na nag-download po kayo, nagawa na po yun.

asr-000923
01:09:41.140 --> 01:09:44.940
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Of course, may recurring na gastusin yan.

asr-000924
01:09:45.120 --> 01:09:46.700
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Yung mga tauhan po.

asr-000925
01:09:46.980 --> 01:09:47.700
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Tama po yun.

asr-000926
01:09:48.000 --> 01:09:49.260
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: So, saan ho mang gagaling yan?

asr-000927
01:09:49.340 --> 01:09:50.640
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Sino? LGU na ho ba?

asr-000928
01:09:50.640 --> 01:09:51.980
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Anong nangyayari po?

asr-000929
01:09:52.080 --> 01:09:53.900
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Dahil devolved service na po,

asr-000930
01:09:53.900 --> 01:09:56.900
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: ang LGU na po ang namamahala po rito.

asr-000931
01:09:57.480 --> 01:10:00.900
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Pero gusto rin po natin bigyang diin sa pagkakataong ito,

asr-000932
01:10:01.880 --> 01:10:10.780
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: ang DOH po ang pangunahing ahensya na mayroon hong obligasyon para panatilihin

asr-000933
01:10:10.780 --> 01:10:16.020
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: dahil ang accreditation po ng mga rehab at treatment facilities

asr-000934
01:10:16.020 --> 01:10:17.760
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: ay nanggagaling po sa DOH.

asr-000935
01:10:17.960 --> 01:10:21.700
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: At ayon na rin po doon sa guidelines na meron tayo.

asr-000936
01:10:21.700 --> 01:10:23.700
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: So, DOH po talaga ang namamahala.

asr-000937
01:10:23.900 --> 01:10:29.900
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Ang namamahala po doon sa mga rehab at treatment po.

asr-000938
01:10:29.900 --> 01:10:36.900
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Dahil nga po health-based na po tayo ayon dito sa ating ship-in policy na nangyayari ho.

asr-000939
01:10:36.900 --> 01:10:48.900
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Dahil tinuturing natin po yung mga drug user na hindi offender, hindi ho kriminal, kundi biktima na kailangang tulungan.

asr-000940
01:10:48.900 --> 01:10:52.900
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Tinignan ko po yung ating budget sa DOH.

asr-000941
01:10:52.900 --> 01:10:58.900
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Kung napondohan itong mga drug rehab at treatment facilities natin,

asr-000942
01:10:58.900 --> 01:11:07.900
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: ang totoo po ay sa ngayon po ay hindi ito naging priority at walang pondong nakalaan po para sa taong ito.

asr-000943
01:11:08.900 --> 01:11:11.900
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Thank you, Mr. Speaker and Distinguished Sponsor.

asr-000944
01:11:11.900 --> 01:11:21.900
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Orders Resolution No. 14, Series of 2026 supports the institutionalization of CHED Memorandum Order No. 5, Series of 2026.

asr-000945
01:11:22.900 --> 01:11:30.900
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Which includes substance use prevention and early intervention in higher education.

asr-000946
01:11:30.900 --> 01:11:40.900
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Meanwhile, funding for development and implementation of the VOCACYs, information programs and production of IEC materials is reduced from

asr-000947
01:11:40.900 --> 01:11:51.900
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: 27.7 million in 2026 to 32.85 million in 2027.

asr-000948
01:11:51.900 --> 01:12:01.760
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: With this reduction, what is the DDB's Fiscal Year 2027 target for the number of higher education,

asr-000949
01:12:02.180 --> 01:12:07.840
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: SUCs, LUCs to be reached by its prevention and advocacy program?

asr-000950
01:12:08.520 --> 01:12:11.380
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: And how does it compare with Fiscal Year 2026?

asr-000951
01:12:11.380 --> 01:12:12.660
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Bakit ako ba bumaba?

asr-000952
01:12:15.040 --> 01:12:16.000
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Bumaba po.

asr-000953
01:12:16.340 --> 01:12:18.520
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Oo. Bakit po? Anong reason bakit?

asr-000954
01:12:18.520 --> 01:12:22.740
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Bakit? Ano ba yung utilization rate nyo? Hindi ho ganun kataas?

asr-000955
01:12:23.220 --> 01:12:29.420
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Kasi usually, the DBM will give you more funding kung na-utilize nyo ang inyong pondo.

asr-000956
01:12:30.100 --> 01:12:31.420
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Kasi nakakabahala po ito.

asr-000957
01:12:31.920 --> 01:12:35.480
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Actually, ma'am, sir, Mr. Speaker, I support your advocacy, no?

asr-000958
01:12:35.660 --> 01:12:45.120
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: I'm one for putting more money sa DDB because if you want to eradicate or obliterate the drugs,

asr-000959
01:12:45.660 --> 01:12:47.020
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: kayo po ang na-support fraud.

asr-000960
01:12:47.120 --> 01:12:48.240
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: So bakit po bumaba?

asr-000961
01:12:48.520 --> 01:12:50.800
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: So something is wrong here, Mr. Speaker.

asr-000962
01:12:56.040 --> 01:13:03.840
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Dahil ang DDB po sa kanyang katayuan ngayon bilang coordinating agency,

asr-000963
01:13:04.700 --> 01:13:13.820
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: ay hindi po siya katulad ng mga SUC or local university and colleges natin

asr-000964
01:13:13.820 --> 01:13:18.000
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: at yung for higher education institution natin.

asr-000965
01:13:18.520 --> 01:13:20.940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Kapag implement po, ano?

asr-000966
01:13:24.280 --> 01:13:29.180
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Basically, the budget of DDB is for support to operations.

asr-000967
01:13:30.000 --> 01:13:32.940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Hindi ho siya isang lead implementing agency.

asr-000968
01:13:33.280 --> 01:13:34.660
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: So in short, okay lang po kayo dyan?

asr-000969
01:13:35.080 --> 01:13:39.960
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Sa inpondo nyo from 47, it was downgraded to 32 million?

asr-000970
01:13:40.500 --> 01:13:40.620
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Okay.

asr-000971
01:13:40.620 --> 01:13:41.780
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Ano ho eh?

asr-000972
01:13:43.260 --> 01:13:47.560
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Ang mahalaga po ay yung mga research at yung data gathering.

asr-000973
01:13:48.520 --> 01:13:54.920
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Yung pag-coordinating with other agency po na makuha po yung tamang bilang.

asr-000974
01:13:55.280 --> 01:13:56.460
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Ayun po yung problema eh.

asr-000975
01:13:57.740 --> 01:14:05.040
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Gusto ho ng DDB magkaroon ng isang national dashboard na kung saan lahat ng mga impormasyon to,

asr-000976
01:14:05.360 --> 01:14:08.860
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: datos na ito, mailalagay doon at makikita natin.

asr-000977
01:14:08.860 --> 01:14:15.140
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Halimbawa po, yung parang isang drug information portal ang gusto po ng DDB.

asr-000978
01:14:16.100 --> 01:14:16.860
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: At yung...

asr-000979
01:14:18.520 --> 01:14:23.520
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Yung mga pondong naroon po sa mga nabanggit hong institution.

asr-000980
01:14:23.840 --> 01:14:32.840
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Yung mga SUC o HEI o LUC ay maibigay natin yung datos at yun ang matulungan ho.

asr-000981
01:14:34.160 --> 01:14:36.860
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: With that, with that, ano, with that, with that.

asr-000982
01:14:36.860 --> 01:14:48.160
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: The DDB is not asking for fund to implement yung mga reintegration program but simply to be able to collate all the data necessary.

asr-000983
01:14:48.520 --> 01:14:53.620
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Para alam natin kung kanino po maiaabot yung tulong na kailangan po.

asr-000984
01:14:54.920 --> 01:14:55.100
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Oo.

asr-000985
01:14:55.340 --> 01:15:00.120
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Saka kailangan po natin yung mga data na yun para mapabuti po natin yung...

asr-000986
01:15:00.120 --> 01:15:02.020
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: mga pulisiyan na meron po tayo.

asr-000987
01:15:02.980 --> 01:15:04.020
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Thank you, Mr. Speaker.

asr-000988
01:15:04.800 --> 01:15:06.500
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Under Board Resolution No. 9

asr-000989
01:15:06.500 --> 01:15:08.100
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Series of 2026,

asr-000990
01:15:08.740 --> 01:15:10.140
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: the DDB directed

asr-000991
01:15:10.140 --> 01:15:12.460
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: the maximization

asr-000992
01:15:12.460 --> 01:15:14.360
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: of digital infrastructure

asr-000993
01:15:14.360 --> 01:15:15.780
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: through shared

asr-000994
01:15:15.780 --> 01:15:17.800
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: digital workspaces,

asr-000995
01:15:19.280 --> 01:15:20.000
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: digitized

asr-000996
01:15:20.000 --> 01:15:22.060
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: workflows, strengthened

