asr-002307
02:40:55.360 --> 02:40:58.400
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: ay shoreline, napakahaba po.

asr-002308
02:40:58.720 --> 02:41:00.840
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Kaya yun ho yung tinitingnan nila.

asr-002309
02:41:01.500 --> 02:41:04.060
