asr-002316
02:41:26.260 --> 02:41:28.100
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: yung pinanggalingan po nung shipment.

asr-002317
02:41:29.100 --> 02:41:30.740
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Kaya po napakahalaga po.

asr-002318
02:41:31.340 --> 02:41:35.480
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Nagkataon po, yun din po yung mga pinanggagalingan po

asr-002319
02:41:35.480 --> 02:41:38.580
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: dahil siguro po mayayamang bansa po ito,

asr-002320
02:41:38.700 --> 02:41:42.620
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: pati po yung ecstasy ay doon din po mga nanggagaling po.

asr-002321
02:41:44.700 --> 02:41:46.460
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: At ito po yung binabantayan po natin

asr-002322
02:41:46.460 --> 02:41:49.140
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: dahil yung problema po ng drug use prevalence

asr-002323
02:41:50.140 --> 02:41:51.140
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: ay also,

asr-002324
02:41:51.520 --> 02:41:55.160
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: magistrata of our social class.

asr-002325
02:41:55.740 --> 02:41:57.940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Hindi lang ho yung mahihirap,

asr-002326
02:41:58.100 --> 02:42:01.360
