asr-002327
02:42:02.020 --> 02:42:04.900
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: pati ang nagiging victim,

asr-002328
02:42:05.540 --> 02:42:11.640
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: meaning our productivity ay apektado na rin.

asr-002329
02:42:12.720 --> 02:42:13.640
