asr-002466
02:47:57.540 --> 02:47:59.540
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Napakababa po noon, 2.9 million.

asr-002467
02:47:59.540 --> 02:48:02.540
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Eh easy na po ang frontliner natin

asr-002468
02:48:02.540 --> 02:48:05.540
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: when it comes apprehending those drugs.

asr-002469
02:48:05.540 --> 02:48:07.540
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Masyadong mababa, 2.9 million.

asr-002470
02:48:07.540 --> 02:48:09.540
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Totoo po, mababa po ito.

asr-002471
02:48:09.540 --> 02:48:14.540
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Dahil ito po yung nakaraang pong mga taon

asr-002472
02:48:14.540 --> 02:48:17.540
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: at ito nga yung gusto natin sanang mababago,

asr-002473
02:48:17.540 --> 02:48:20.540
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: ma-correct natin ayon doon sa halaga

asr-002474
02:48:20.540 --> 02:48:22.540
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: nung ginagawa po nitong

asr-002479
02:48:26.500 --> 02:48:27.500
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: mga K-9.

asr-002480
02:48:27.500 --> 02:48:29.500
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Mr. Speaker, remember itong canine natin

asr-002481
02:48:29.500 --> 02:48:32.500
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: humuhuli ng billion na drugs, no?

asr-002482
02:48:32.500 --> 02:48:38.500
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Tapos 2.9 million, parang may problema rito.

asr-002483
02:48:38.500 --> 02:48:40.500
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: So definitely, no?

asr-002484
02:48:40.500 --> 02:48:42.500
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Yung representation niya namin ito,

asr-002485
02:48:42.500 --> 02:48:43.500
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: masyadong mababa.

asr-002486
02:48:43.500 --> 02:48:46.500
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Yung pagsisilbi nila sa ating bansa,

asr-002487
02:48:46.500 --> 02:48:48.500
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: napakalaking bagay po yan.

asr-002488
02:48:48.500 --> 02:48:51.500
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: So again, moving forward,

asr-002489
02:48:51.500 --> 02:48:52.500
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: magdugo ang puso ko.

asr-002490
02:48:52.500 --> 02:48:54.500
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Mr. Speaker, idagdag ko lang po,

asr-002491
02:48:54.500 --> 02:48:56.500
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: ang mahalaga po rin dito sa canine natin,

asr-002492
02:48:56.500 --> 02:49:00.500
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: dahil lang po yung pagkain nila,

asr-002493
02:49:00.500 --> 02:49:01.500
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: supply nila.

asr-002494
02:49:01.500 --> 02:49:04.500
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Pinakamahalagaw yung mga training equipments po nila po.

asr-002495
02:49:04.500 --> 02:49:09.500
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Yung po siguro, kung pagtutunan ng pansin

asr-002496
02:49:09.500 --> 02:49:12.500
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: ng Committee on Appropriations,

asr-002497
02:49:12.500 --> 02:49:13.500
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: yung training systems po,

asr-002498
02:49:13.500 --> 02:49:15.500
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: yung training aid containers,

asr-002499
02:49:15.500 --> 02:49:17.500
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: yung mga vaults po nila.

asr-002500
02:49:17.500 --> 02:49:22.500
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Ayon po yung isa sa mahalagang kailangan din po natin.

asr-002501
02:49:22.500 --> 02:49:23.500
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Thank you, Mr. Speaker.

asr-002502
02:49:23.500 --> 02:49:24.500
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Di siyo sponsor, no?

asr-002503
02:49:24.500 --> 02:49:26.500
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Nakakalungkot.

asr-002504
02:49:26.500 --> 02:49:30.500
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Despite the fact na nagtatrabaho sa atin at yung mga canine natin,

asr-002505
02:49:30.500 --> 02:49:33.500
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: 2.9 million, masyadong mababa yan.

asr-002506
02:49:33.500 --> 02:49:37.500
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Siguro during budget deliberation,

asr-002507
02:49:37.500 --> 02:49:39.500
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: siguro isa ako sa magtatanong tungkol niya.

asr-002508
02:49:39.500 --> 02:49:43.500
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Kasama ko si Kong Manny Santos na nandyan po kanina pa.

asr-002509
02:49:43.500 --> 02:49:46.500
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Again, on barangay level naman po,

asr-002510
02:49:46.500 --> 02:49:48.500
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Mr. Speaker, in 2025,

asr-002511
02:49:48.500 --> 02:49:54.500
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: 5,522 or 13% of the country's 42,000 barangay,

asr-002512
02:49:54.500 --> 02:49:57.500
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: remain drug-affected.

asr-002513
02:49:57.500 --> 02:50:01.500
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Down from 14% in 2024.

asr-002514
02:50:01.500 --> 02:50:05.500
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: While 71% were declared drug-cleared

asr-002515
02:50:05.500 --> 02:50:08.500
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: and 14% drug-free.

asr-002516
02:50:08.500 --> 02:50:11.500
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Given this pace of reduction,

asr-002517
02:50:11.500 --> 02:50:15.500
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: what is today's target number of drug-affected barangays

asr-002518
02:50:15.500 --> 02:50:18.500
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: for the end of 2026 and 2027?

asr-002519
02:50:18.500 --> 02:50:22.500
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: And what specific fiscal year 2027 programs

asr-002520
02:50:22.500 --> 02:50:23.500
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: and fundings

asr-002521
02:50:23.500 --> 02:50:25.500
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: will support the clearing

asr-002522
02:50:25.500 --> 02:50:31.500
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: of the remaining affected barangays?

asr-002523
02:50:31.500 --> 02:50:34.500
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Alam ko, Mr. Speaker, mahirap maging 100%, no?

asr-002524
02:50:34.500 --> 02:50:37.500
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: That's why kudus to PIDEA, no?

asr-002525
02:50:37.500 --> 02:50:42.500
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Talagang they're doing their best.

asr-002526
02:50:42.500 --> 02:50:46.500
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Ang barangay po natin ay

asr-002527
02:50:46.500 --> 02:50:52.500
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: 42,000 po.

asr-002528
02:50:52.500 --> 02:51:01.500
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Ang affectation po natin sa national drug

asr-002529
02:51:01.500 --> 02:51:05.500
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: ay nasa 12.49 po ng barangay na yan.

asr-002530
02:51:05.500 --> 02:51:09.500
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Ibig sabihin po, out of the 42,000,

asr-002531
02:51:09.500 --> 02:51:12.500
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: meron po tayo humigit-kumulang na mga 5,000

asr-002532
02:51:12.500 --> 02:51:18.500
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: or 5,247 barangays na affected.

asr-002533
02:51:18.500 --> 02:51:20.500
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Meron po sila na mga na-clear na,

asr-002534
02:51:20.500 --> 02:51:27.500
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: na barangay ayon doon sa datos noong 2026, ngayon po,

asr-002535
02:51:27.500 --> 02:51:32.500
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: as of August, ang pinakahuling datos nila,

asr-002536
02:51:32.500 --> 02:51:35.500
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: na 30,263, no?

asr-002537
02:51:35.500 --> 02:51:39.500
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Or drug-free na barangay na nasa 6,229.

asr-002538
02:51:39.500 --> 02:51:42.500
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Pero, Mr. Speaker, tulad ng pinapaliwanag ko po

asr-002539
02:51:42.500 --> 02:51:46.500
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: kanina po sa ilang pagtatanong,

asr-002540
02:51:46.500 --> 02:51:48.500
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: ito po ay moving target po eh.

asr-002541
02:51:48.500 --> 02:51:49.500
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Talaga po hindi naman pwede dito.

asr-002542
02:51:49.500 --> 02:51:53.500
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Talaga po hindi naman pwedeng sabihin na drug-free na sa araw nito

asr-002543
02:51:53.500 --> 02:51:58.500
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: habang tayo po nag-uusap dito sa plenaryo ang isang barangay.

asr-002544
02:51:58.500 --> 02:52:04.500
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Maring may nakapasok na droga at nakapag merong gumamit ulit doon.

asr-002545
02:52:04.500 --> 02:52:08.500
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Sa kasalukuyan din po para sa kalaman po natin,

asr-002546
02:52:08.500 --> 02:52:12.500
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: meron po tayong nakapending na house bill.

asr-002547
02:52:12.500 --> 02:52:18.500
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Ito po ay ano, ini-sponsor po ni Kong Mark to institutionalize.

asr-002548
02:52:19.500 --> 02:52:24.500
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Ito po yung budget para sa BADAC at sa mga MADAC.

asr-002549
02:52:24.500 --> 02:52:30.500
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Dahil sa ngayon ay wala po itong pondong particular na nakalaan

asr-002550
02:52:30.500 --> 02:52:36.500
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: o kaya yung by law o statutorily ay merong ilalaan.

asr-002551
02:52:36.500 --> 02:52:40.500
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Pero para sagutin po yung tanong kung magkano po ba yung budget

asr-002552
02:52:40.500 --> 02:52:47.500
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: sa nanakalaan ngayon para sa BADAC at sa MADAC,

asr-002553
02:52:49.500 --> 02:52:54.500
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: para sa buong bansa po ito ay meron pong nakalagay po rito

asr-002554
02:52:54.500 --> 02:53:00.500
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: para sa implementation po ng clearing po na ginagawa po.

asr-002555
02:53:00.500 --> 02:53:06.500
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: 419 million po. Clearing po.

asr-002556
02:53:06.500 --> 02:53:17.500
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Ang totoo po ay sa maintenance and operating expenses po lamang itong ginagawa po.

asr-002557
02:53:17.500 --> 02:53:19.500
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Wala pa yung mga intelligence.

asr-002558
02:53:19.500 --> 02:53:20.500
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Yung information.

asr-002559
02:53:20.500 --> 02:53:24.500
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Yung mga kailangan pong mga kagamitan sa reporting.

asr-002560
02:53:24.500 --> 02:53:27.500
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Tulad ng sinasabi po natin kanina,

asr-002561
02:53:27.500 --> 02:53:32.500
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: yung reporting system na kailangan nila ng upgrade,

asr-002562
02:53:32.500 --> 02:53:37.500
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: yung module nila ay wala pa po dito.

asr-002563
02:53:37.500 --> 02:53:39.500
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Thank you, Mr. Speaker.

asr-002564
02:53:39.500 --> 02:53:41.500
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Distinguished Sponsors,

asr-002565
02:53:41.500 --> 02:53:43.500
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: beyond clearing barangays,

asr-002566
02:53:43.500 --> 02:53:48.500
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: how many barangays previously declared drug cleared?

asr-002567
02:53:48.500 --> 02:53:50.500
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Have been reaffected?

asr-002568
02:53:50.500 --> 02:53:53.500
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Yung sinasabi niyo kanina, is a moving target.

asr-002569
02:53:53.500 --> 02:53:58.500
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: As of this year, and what specific measures under the advocacy

asr-002570
02:53:58.500 --> 02:54:05.500
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: o laban sa illegal na droga ala program are being implemented to prevent reaffectation?

asr-002571
02:54:05.500 --> 02:54:09.500
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: As we know, is a moving target. As you mentioned, talagang hindi mawawala yan.

asr-002572
02:54:09.500 --> 02:54:12.500
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: But at least, ma-minimize natin.

asr-002573
02:54:12.500 --> 02:54:17.500
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Napakahalaga po yan. Dahil meron tayong na-clear na barangay ngayon,

asr-002574
02:54:17.500 --> 02:54:22.500
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: mamaya o bukas o sa susunod na buwan ay nabalik po.

asr-002575
02:54:22.500 --> 02:54:23.500
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Ano po?

asr-002576
02:54:35.500 --> 02:54:38.500
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Reaffected? Wala.

asr-002577
02:54:38.500 --> 02:54:43.500
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Ang totoo po, Mr. Chairman, Mr. Speaker rather,

asr-002578
02:54:43.500 --> 02:54:45.500
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: yung data po na hinihingi po ninyo,

asr-002579
02:54:45.500 --> 02:54:50.500
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: ay hindi po available sa ngayon sa PIDEA.

asr-002580
02:54:50.500 --> 02:54:58.500
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Admittedly, yun siguro we should be able to calibrate our data gathering

asr-002581
02:54:58.500 --> 02:55:00.500
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: tungkol sa bagay na yan.

asr-002582
02:55:00.500 --> 02:55:09.500
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Para malaman natin kung gaano ka-effective yung ating ginagawang drug clearing sa mga barangay.

asr-002583
02:55:09.500 --> 02:55:15.500
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Dahil sa data na meron dito, ang data lamang ay yung affected na barangay.

asr-002584
02:55:15.500 --> 02:55:17.500
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: At ilan po yung na-clear.

asr-002585
02:55:17.500 --> 02:55:22.500
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Pero wala yung tulad na sinasabi natin, yung na-apektohan ulit.

asr-002586
02:55:22.500 --> 02:55:28.500
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Bumalik sa previous status.

asr-002587
02:55:28.500 --> 02:55:30.500
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Thank you.

asr-002588
02:55:30.500 --> 02:55:40.500
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: We will provide you the data, Mr. Speaker, pag ito ay nakuha na po ng PIDEA po.

asr-002589
02:55:40.500 --> 02:55:45.920
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Thank you. Before I proceed to my last question.

asr-002590
02:55:45.920 --> 02:55:48.500
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Kanina may sinasabi si Kong Iris Montes.

asr-002591
02:55:48.500 --> 02:55:50.500
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Hindi na daw siya magtatanong.

asr-002592
02:55:50.500 --> 02:55:53.500
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: CS1 question lang.

asr-002593
02:55:53.500 --> 02:56:02.500
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: So paano natin, ano bang parameters natin sa paghuhuli para kumbaga yung successful rate natin?

asr-002594
02:56:02.500 --> 02:56:11.500
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: So sa mga nahuli natin, for example, 100 cases, how many po yung naku-convict natin na talagang napupunta sa korte?

asr-002595
02:56:11.500 --> 02:56:13.500
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Kasi napaka-importante po yan para hindi na sila umuli.

asr-002596
02:56:13.500 --> 02:56:19.500
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Che-check ko po yung, mabuti po yung data natin.

asr-002597
02:56:19.500 --> 02:56:30.500
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Kasi hindi ho lahat ng operation natin, lalo na yung intelligence-driven operation case ay 100% successful.

asr-002598
02:56:30.500 --> 02:56:35.500
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Kanina tulad nung aking pinapaliwanag, parang mga nasa 60% lamang.

asr-002599
02:56:35.500 --> 02:56:41.500
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Pero yung rate po, dapat hindi lang sukatin dun sa nahuli.

asr-002600
02:56:41.500 --> 02:56:42.500
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Ang pinakamahalaga,

asr-002601
02:56:42.500 --> 02:56:49.500
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: kung sindikato ito o pusher o organized syndicate,

asr-002602
02:56:49.500 --> 02:56:54.500
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: kung nadalabas sa korte at successfully na-prosecute,

asr-002603
02:56:54.500 --> 02:56:58.500
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: yun ang tingin natin magandang sukatan.

asr-002604
02:56:58.500 --> 02:57:10.500
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Sapagkat kung yung sindikato ay hindi nawala at nakasuhan lamang, patuloy pa rin ito sa modus na kinagawa.

asr-002605
02:57:10.500 --> 02:57:11.500
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Ano?

asr-002606
02:57:12.500 --> 02:57:21.500
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Meron po ditong cumulative statistics on drug cases filed.

asr-002607
02:57:21.500 --> 02:57:27.500
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Pero ito po ay ayon lamang sa record.

asr-002608
02:57:34.500 --> 02:57:40.500
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Ito po ay cumulative buhat nung 2002 hanggang 2026.

asr-002609
02:57:40.500 --> 02:57:52.500
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Ipapahiwalay ko lang, Mr. Speaker, yung ngayong taon marahil para makita natin kung ano yung conviction rate natin.

asr-002610
02:57:52.500 --> 02:57:58.500
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Total cases of 166,227 po.

asr-002611
02:57:58.500 --> 02:58:04.500
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Ang percentage po ng conviction natin ay 71.6%.

asr-002612
02:58:04.500 --> 02:58:08.500
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: May mga dismissal po na 10% ang nangyari.

asr-002613
02:58:08.500 --> 02:58:13.500
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Maring dun sa paghahandal po dun sa chain of custody.

asr-002614
02:58:13.500 --> 02:58:18.500
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Mali yung pagmamarka ho ng mga ebidensya.

asr-002615
02:58:18.500 --> 02:58:19.500
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Yan po.

asr-002616
02:58:19.500 --> 02:58:24.500
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Ito po, ang masakit po ay meron ding acquittal na 18%.

asr-002617
02:58:24.500 --> 02:58:27.500
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Mas pataas po yung acquittal na nangyari.

asr-002618
02:58:27.500 --> 02:58:31.500
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Siguro dahil sa paghahandal po ng prosecution.

asr-002619
02:58:31.500 --> 02:58:36.500
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: O on technicalities yung iba po rito eh.

asr-002620
02:58:36.500 --> 02:58:37.500
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Aho.

asr-002621
02:58:38.500 --> 02:58:39.500
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Oho.

asr-002622
02:58:39.500 --> 02:58:44.500
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Dahil may reasonable certainty of conviction ngayon po.

asr-002623
02:58:44.500 --> 02:58:47.500
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Opo.

asr-002624
02:58:47.500 --> 02:58:55.500
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Sa lukuyan po, tulad po nang binanggit ko kanina, ang mahalaga po yung ngayong taon.

asr-002625
02:58:55.500 --> 02:59:01.500
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Dahil yun ang dapat nating malaman kung ano performance ng PIDEA.

asr-002626
02:59:01.500 --> 02:59:07.500
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Dahil alam natin, hindi lang sa enforcement kundi sa prosecution ay sila ang namamahala.

asr-002627
02:59:07.500 --> 02:59:15.500
