asr-002891
03:21:15.120 --> 03:21:21.280
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: Observations regarding commingling of public funds and the lack of proper accounting segmentation.

asr-002892
03:21:22.020 --> 03:21:28.780
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: Prior to this directive, different streams of agency revenue, especially GAAP's 3% share from gross gate receipts,

asr-002893
03:21:28.780 --> 03:21:41.640
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: and broadcasting rights under PD 871, its regular license fees and trust funds were not cleanly separated at the processing and reporting levels.

asr-002894
03:21:42.280 --> 03:21:54.020
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: This lacked compliance with Update Bureau of Treasury, circulars, and exposed the agency to potential challenges in auditing specific special accounts in the general funds allocations.

asr-002895
