asr-002911
03:22:39.800 --> 03:22:45.520
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: Collecting officers were trained and detailed categorizing protocols.

asr-002912
03:22:45.920 --> 03:22:52.100
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: Reports are now structured to mandate separate entries from funds types

asr-002913
03:22:52.100 --> 03:22:59.480
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: such as account 151 for the 3% share versus regular license collections,

asr-002914
03:22:59.980 --> 03:23:03.060
