03:27:46.960 --> 03:27:50.000
Rep. Katrina Reiko Chua-Tai: Attorney Eric Jean Mayores,

asr-002997
03:27:50.000 --> 03:27:52.500
Rep. Katrina Reiko Chua-Tai: Ms. Violeta Tuazon,

asr-002998
03:27:52.500 --> 03:27:54.960
Rep. Katrina Reiko Chua-Tai: Dr. Lauro Domingo,

asr-002999
03:27:54.960 --> 03:27:57.200
Rep. Katrina Reiko Chua-Tai: Ms. Annie Ruiz,

asr-003000
03:27:57.200 --> 03:27:59.840
Rep. Katrina Reiko Chua-Tai: Engineer Victoria Moya,

asr-003001
03:27:59.840 --> 03:28:01.840
Rep. Katrina Reiko Chua-Tai: Mr. Aljon Basilan.

asr-003003
03:28:02.880 --> 03:28:06.380
Deputy Speaker Alfredo "Albee" B. Benitez: We acknowledge the presence of the heads and officials

asr-003004
03:28:06.380 --> 03:28:08.900
Deputy Speaker Alfredo "Albee" B. Benitez: from the Philippine Sports, Commission.

asr-003005
03:28:08.900 --> 03:28:11.260
Deputy Speaker Alfredo "Albee" B. Benitez: Welcome to the House of Representatives.

asr-003006
03:28:11.260 --> 03:28:12.200
Deputy Speaker Alfredo "Albee" B. Benitez: Majority Leader.

asr-003007
03:28:13.580 --> 03:28:14.700
Rep. Katrina Reiko Chua-Tai: Mr. Speaker,

asr-003008
03:28:14.700 --> 03:28:21.020
Rep. Katrina Reiko Chua-Tai: I move to recognize Representative Jerry Boy Espina, Jr.

asr-003009
03:28:21.020 --> 03:28:23.100
Rep. Katrina Reiko Chua-Tai: from the Lone District of Biliran.

asr-003010
03:28:24.460 --> 03:28:26.800
Deputy Speaker Alfredo "Albee" B. Benitez: Representative Espina from the Lone District of Biliran

asr-003011
03:28:26.800 --> 03:28:27.700
Deputy Speaker Alfredo "Albee" B. Benitez: is recognized.

asr-003012
03:28:29.420 --> 03:28:30.880
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: Thank you, Mr. Speaker.

asr-003013
03:28:30.880 --> 03:28:31.940
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: Mr. Speaker,

asr-003014
03:28:31.940 --> 03:28:34.840
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: to our distinguished colleagues,

asr-003015
03:28:36.100 --> 03:28:36.980
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: ladies and gentlemen,

asr-003016
03:28:37.140 --> 03:28:37.840
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: magandang hapon po.

asr-003017
03:28:39.100 --> 03:28:40.140
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: Mr. Speaker,

asr-003018
03:28:40.260 --> 03:28:41.740
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: it is my honor and privilege

asr-003019
03:28:41.740 --> 03:28:43.680
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: to sponsor the fiscal year budget

asr-003020
03:28:43.680 --> 03:28:45.960
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: 2027 of the

asr-003021
03:28:45.960 --> 03:28:47.360
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: Philippine Sports, Commission,

asr-003022
03:28:47.480 --> 03:28:52.960
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: amounting to 1,311,444,000 pesos,

asr-003023
03:28:53.300 --> 03:28:54.480
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: which is lower

asr-003024
03:28:54.480 --> 03:28:59.920
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: by 895,364,000 pesos

asr-003025
03:28:59.920 --> 03:29:01.920
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: or 40.57%

asr-003026
03:29:01.940 --> 03:29:03.940
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: compared with

asr-003027
03:29:03.940 --> 03:29:06.420
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: the previous year's budget.

asr-003028
03:29:07.320 --> 03:29:08.140
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: Mr. Speaker,

asr-003029
03:29:08.260 --> 03:29:09.340
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: I am now ready to answer

asr-003030
03:29:09.340 --> 03:29:11.200
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: any questions from our colleagues.

asr-003031
03:29:14.440 --> 03:29:15.340
Deputy Speaker Alfredo "Albee" B. Benitez: Majority Leader.

asr-003032
03:29:31.940 --> 03:29:48.560
Rep. Katrina Reiko Chua-Tai: I move to recognize Representative Presley De Jesus

asr-003033
03:29:48.560 --> 03:29:50.560
Rep. Katrina Reiko Chua-Tai: from Pilreka Partylist

asr-003034
03:29:50.560 --> 03:29:52.000
Rep. Katrina Reiko Chua-Tai: to interpolate the sponsor

asr-003035
03:29:52.000 --> 03:29:54.940
Rep. Katrina Reiko Chua-Tai: on the proposed budget

asr-003036
03:29:54.940 --> 03:29:56.520
Rep. Katrina Reiko Chua-Tai: of the Philippine Sports Commission.

asr-003037
03:29:56.920 --> 03:29:58.080
Deputy Speaker Alfredo "Albee" B. Benitez: Representative De Jesus

asr-003038
03:29:58.080 --> 03:29:59.980
Deputy Speaker Alfredo "Albee" B. Benitez: is recognized to interpolate.

asr-003039
03:30:00.000 --> 03:30:07.440
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Thank you, Mr. Speaker and Distinguished Sponsor, Pong Jerry Espina.

asr-003040
03:30:08.880 --> 03:30:25.180
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Mr. Speaker, the Philippine Sports Commission, which is very close to my heart, is mandated to set the priorities and direction of national sports promotion with emphasis on expanding grassroots sports participation.

asr-003041
03:30:25.180 --> 03:30:51.980
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: However, under Fiscal Year 2027 National Expedition Program, the financial assistance to athletes, including community sports development, sports spells, and sports activities was reduced from 545 million in 2026 to only 45 million, a 91.7% reduction,

asr-003042
03:30:51.980 --> 03:30:54.980
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: or 499 million.

asr-003043
03:30:55.180 --> 03:31:11.580
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: The 150 million National Grassroots Sports Development Program and 300 million Sports Tourism Program in 2026 were likewise not carried over into the Fiscal Year 2027 NEP.

asr-003044
03:31:11.580 --> 03:31:19.760
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Meanwhile, the National Sports for All Grassroots Center Police Program was reduced from 80 million to 63 million.

asr-003045
03:31:20.400 --> 03:31:25.160
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Given the PSC's statutory mandate to expand grassroots participation,

asr-003046
03:31:25.180 --> 03:31:36.360
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: how does Commission intend to maintain or expand grassroots sports activities and participation despite this significant reduction in funding?

asr-003047
03:31:37.460 --> 03:31:54.140
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: Mr. Speaker, Your Honor, under Section 6 and Section 26 of RA 6847, the PSC is mandated to supplement regular general appropriations from utilizing the National Sports Development Fund.

asr-003048
03:31:55.180 --> 03:32:10.620
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: To finance the staging of national games, grassroots talents identification, and community compensations.

asr-003049
03:32:11.300 --> 03:32:18.880
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: Furthermore, the PSC's strategic framework relies on inter-agency cooperation with local government units

asr-003050
03:32:18.880 --> 03:32:25.040
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: and local physical fitness and sports development councils under Executive Orders 63 and 64.

asr-003051
03:32:25.180 --> 03:32:30.260
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: to roll out community-level sports-for-all initiatives, Your Honor.

asr-003052
03:32:32.140 --> 03:32:39.640
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Mr. Speaker, on the onset, recently, as you know, Alex Ayala became famous.

asr-003053
03:32:40.380 --> 03:32:44.700
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Never in the history of the Philippines that we have a tennis player.

asr-003054
03:32:44.700 --> 03:32:45.660
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: First time po, no?

asr-003055
03:32:47.120 --> 03:32:53.620
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: At sa kanyang mga interview, mukhang mahirapan talaga ang ating mga atlit dito sa bansa

asr-003056
03:32:53.620 --> 03:32:56.660
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: because tennis is new to us, no?

asr-003057
03:32:57.060 --> 03:33:02.600
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Because as you know, Philippine is very tayo, masyado tayong dedicated sa basketball.

asr-003058
03:33:03.320 --> 03:33:07.700
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: So, with the new kind of atlit, no?

asr-003059
03:33:08.240 --> 03:33:11.880
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: In the presence of Alex Ayala, ano ba pwede natin itulong?

asr-003060
03:33:12.040 --> 03:33:17.480
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Lalo ngayon, para sa atin, ang tennis sport ay hindi naman ganun kagrabe.

asr-003061
03:33:18.140 --> 03:33:21.420
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Sabi nga nila, ang tennis daw sa Pilipinas, pang mayaman, no?

asr-003062
03:33:21.860 --> 03:33:22.820
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: I like basketball.

asr-003063
03:33:23.620 --> 03:33:28.360
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Yung volleyball, or kung mga larong pang ordinary, kaya.

asr-003064
03:33:28.540 --> 03:33:33.660
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: But tennis requires ang new mga equipments, medyo mahal.

asr-003065
03:33:34.180 --> 03:33:37.680
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: At kailangan magkaroon ka ng sponsor.

asr-003066
03:33:37.680 --> 03:33:44.240
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: If not, kung kaya ng magulang mo, kagaya nila Alex Ayala, ay napadala sa Spain, no?

asr-003067
03:33:44.720 --> 03:33:46.580
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Sa Rapa Academy.

asr-003068
03:33:47.340 --> 03:33:52.680
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: So, ngayon po, ano nakikita ng Philippine Sports Commission dito sa tennis?

asr-003069
03:33:53.620 --> 03:34:02.300
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Na ngayon ay talagang sikat na sikat na medyo umangat ang ating bansa because of Alex Ayala.

asr-003070
03:34:03.340 --> 03:34:10.440
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: Well, sangayon ako sa inyong pahayag, Ms. Your Honor.

asr-003071
03:34:11.440 --> 03:34:22.420
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: Sa katunayan, based kay chairman, we will continue to build the regional training centers

asr-003072
03:34:22.420 --> 03:34:23.420
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: focusing on...

asr-003073
03:34:23.620 --> 03:34:30.300
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: Tennis, and some facilities to help our athletes.

asr-003074
03:34:31.500 --> 03:34:32.680
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: Yun po, Your Honor.

asr-003075
03:34:33.540 --> 03:34:38.460
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: We will build more training centers for tennis.

asr-003076
03:34:38.860 --> 03:34:39.960
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Thank you, Mr. Speaker.

asr-003077
03:34:40.540 --> 03:34:41.880
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Masakit man tanggapin, no?

asr-003078
03:34:42.440 --> 03:34:44.600
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Tayo masyado hook up sa basketball.

asr-003079
03:34:45.440 --> 03:34:49.200
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Siguro, the next hundred years, I don't think magcha-champion tayo, no?

asr-003080
03:34:49.260 --> 03:34:52.920
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Kasi we're not built athletically.

asr-003081
03:34:52.920 --> 03:34:54.500
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Wala tayong height, no?

asr-003082
03:34:55.120 --> 03:34:57.040
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Unlike yung mga foreign na talaga.

asr-003083
03:34:57.540 --> 03:34:58.920
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: So, ako siguro, Mr. Chair, no?

asr-003084
03:34:59.020 --> 03:35:03.600
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: We can't concentrate boxing, tennis, and now, kahit sana yung golf.

asr-003085
03:35:03.820 --> 03:35:07.260
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Kaso, ang golf, again, is sabi nila, larong pang mayaman.

asr-003086
03:35:07.880 --> 03:35:09.920
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Do we see a future...

asr-003087
03:35:09.920 --> 03:35:17.600
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: This is your sponsor, of course, the help of Chairperson Pato Gregorio.

asr-003088
03:35:18.400 --> 03:35:21.440
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Na ito bang golf natin?

asr-003089
03:35:21.440 --> 03:35:22.440
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Pwede ba tayo magkaroon?

asr-003090
03:35:22.920 --> 03:35:24.320
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Pwede ba tayo magkaroon ng academy rin?

asr-003091
03:35:24.860 --> 03:35:28.960
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Na kagaya ng Thailand, kagaya ng Vietnam, nagsisimula na siya.

asr-003092
03:35:29.220 --> 03:35:32.580
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Kasi dito, Mr. Chair, dito ko lang nakikita na aasenso tayo, eh.

asr-003093
03:35:33.100 --> 03:35:35.680
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Tennis, golf, and boxing, no?

asr-003094
03:35:36.020 --> 03:35:37.920
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Not disrespecting basketball.

asr-003095
03:35:38.100 --> 03:35:41.200
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Eh, kahit anong gawin natin, hindi tayo aasenso, no?

asr-003096
03:35:41.740 --> 03:35:42.540
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Sa basketball.

asr-003097
03:35:42.720 --> 03:35:47.220
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Ito lang nakikita ko that will bring us yung tinatawag na promised land.

asr-003098
03:35:47.860 --> 03:35:52.240
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: What can you say, Mr. Speaker, this is your sponsor pagdating naman sa larong golf?

asr-003099
03:35:52.240 --> 03:35:52.540
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Ito.

asr-003100
03:35:52.920 --> 03:35:59.860
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Can we build also, or we started already building yung tinatawag nating academy natin?

asr-003101
03:36:00.160 --> 03:36:01.840
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: Well, Mr. Speaker, Your Honor,

asr-003102
03:36:03.400 --> 03:36:11.380
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: Philippine Sports Commission is now focused on medal-rich Olympic sports.

asr-003103
03:36:11.740 --> 03:36:16.220
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: Kagaya ng sinabi mo na pinipilit natin yung basketball,

asr-003104
03:36:16.220 --> 03:36:22.060
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: pero ilan taon na tayong talagang nakikita natin na hindi talaga uubra.

asr-003105
03:36:22.920 --> 03:36:28.060
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: So with that, we have to concentrate or focus dun sa mga sports na talagang alam natin

asr-003106
03:36:28.060 --> 03:36:34.980
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: may kakayahan ang Pilipino para mag-excel dun sa gano'ng klaseng sports.

asr-003107
03:36:35.160 --> 03:36:39.720
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: At ang ginagawa po ng Philippine Sports Commission ay gano'n po.

asr-003108
03:36:40.220 --> 03:36:40.600
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: Your Honor?

asr-003109
03:36:41.320 --> 03:36:45.100
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Thank you, Mr. Speaker, distinguished sponsor, no?

asr-003110
03:36:45.560 --> 03:36:46.800
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Sana supportahan natin.

asr-003111
03:36:46.800 --> 03:36:50.200
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Do you have any numbers, no?

asr-003112
03:36:50.760 --> 03:36:51.360
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Na tingin nyo?

asr-003113
03:36:51.440 --> 03:36:52.800
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Kasi ngayon, isa lang ang ating...

asr-003114
03:36:52.920 --> 03:36:59.320
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Sa lady golfer natin, if I'm not mistaken, si Pagdanganan ata, no?

asr-003115
03:36:59.760 --> 03:37:01.600
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Yung lady golfer natin.

asr-003116
03:37:02.060 --> 03:37:05.620
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Ito, nakapasok siya ngayon, naglalaro siya ngayon sa Florida or something, no?

asr-003117
03:37:06.040 --> 03:37:07.420
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: And of course, Alex Ayala.

asr-003118
03:37:07.880 --> 03:37:13.480
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Do you see any future natin na nakikitaan nyo po ng talent that we can develop?

asr-003119
03:37:15.180 --> 03:37:19.920
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: At yung bang pondo nyo ngayon, naka-allocate para dyan?

asr-003120
03:37:19.920 --> 03:37:22.920
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: O itong ating pondo ay allocated already?

asr-003121
03:37:22.920 --> 03:37:25.000
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Sa ibang sports?

asr-003122
03:37:25.760 --> 03:37:29.800
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: Mr. Speaker, Your Honor, si Ryan Maliksi.

asr-003123
03:37:31.100 --> 03:37:33.860
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: Malaki po ang future niya sa larangan ng golf.

asr-003124
03:37:34.600 --> 03:37:39.740
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: Bata pa po siya at nagpapakita siya ng kausayan sa larangan ng golf.

asr-003125
03:37:40.400 --> 03:37:44.320
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: So, sa tingin ko, ang PSC ay tututukan to.

asr-003126
03:37:45.160 --> 03:37:45.500
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: Your Honor?

asr-003127
03:37:46.160 --> 03:37:47.260
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Thank you, Mr. Speaker.

asr-003128
03:37:47.260 --> 03:37:52.540
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Sana tutukan natin yung makikita natin na kaya nilang mag-champion.

asr-003129
03:37:52.920 --> 03:37:54.620
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Tennis and golf.

asr-003130
03:37:55.440 --> 03:37:56.620
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Mr. Chair, with that, no?

asr-003131
03:37:56.840 --> 03:38:01.500
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: I have a lot of questions, but again, it's more on numbers, no?

asr-003132
03:38:01.560 --> 03:38:02.880
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: But again, that's the most important.

asr-003133
03:38:03.080 --> 03:38:05.580
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Maybe this one will be my last question.

asr-003134
03:38:06.240 --> 03:38:09.380
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Mr. Speaker, under PSC sports for all framework,

asr-003135
03:38:09.980 --> 03:38:13.520
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: inclusive sports programs include women in sports,

asr-003136
03:38:14.240 --> 03:38:17.060
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: para sports or the Pilipinas para games,

asr-003137
03:38:17.060 --> 03:38:19.820
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: and indigenous people's games.

asr-003138
03:38:21.100 --> 03:38:22.900
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Given the overall reduction in funding,

asr-003139
03:38:22.920 --> 03:38:27.740
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: for grassroots and sports for all programs under fiscal year 2027,

asr-003140
03:38:27.740 --> 03:38:33.080
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: how does the PSC ensure that this inclusive sports program

asr-003141
03:38:33.080 --> 03:38:36.400
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: receive adequate and predictable funding,

asr-003142
03:38:36.980 --> 03:38:43.040
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: and what specific amounts are programmed for them for fiscal year 2027?

asr-003143
03:38:44.360 --> 03:38:45.320
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: Mr. Speaker, Your Honor,

asr-003144
03:38:45.540 --> 03:38:51.800
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: while regular appropriations for national sports for all grassroots centerpiece programs

asr-003145
03:38:51.800 --> 03:38:52.880
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: stand at

asr-003146
03:38:52.920 --> 03:38:56.960
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: 63.48 million in the fiscal year 2027,

asr-003147
03:38:57.280 --> 03:39:03.340
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: down from 80.07 million in 2026,

asr-003148
03:39:03.860 --> 03:39:07.280
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: the PSC supplements regular line items

asr-003149
03:39:07.280 --> 03:39:11.140
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: by drawing from the off-budget National Sports Development Fund

asr-003150
03:39:11.140 --> 03:39:14.480
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: under Section 26 of RA 6847,

asr-003151
03:39:14.480 --> 03:39:18.560
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: automatic remittances from Pagcor gross income shares

asr-003152
03:39:18.560 --> 03:39:20.780
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: and PCS or sweepstakes proceeds

asr-003153
03:39:20.780 --> 03:39:22.680
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: are legally earmarked to finance,

asr-003154
03:39:22.920 --> 03:39:26.160
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: multi-level sports competition,

asr-003155
03:39:26.160 --> 03:39:31.420
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: and inclusive community projects like women in sports,

asr-003156
03:39:31.420 --> 03:39:36.060
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: indigenous people's games and Pilipinas para games.

asr-003157
03:39:36.060 --> 03:39:37.060
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: Your Honor.

asr-003158
03:39:37.060 --> 03:39:42.860
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Mr. Speaker, that will end my interpellation.

asr-003159
03:39:42.860 --> 03:39:43.860
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Thank you very much.

asr-003160
03:39:43.860 --> 03:39:44.860
Deputy Speaker Alfredo "Albee" B. Benitez: Thank you.

asr-003161
03:39:44.860 --> 03:39:46.860
Deputy Speaker Alfredo "Albee" B. Benitez: Before that, good sponsor,

asr-003162
03:39:46.860 --> 03:39:49.860
Deputy Speaker Alfredo "Albee" B. Benitez: I just would like to do a few clarification.

asr-003163
03:39:49.860 --> 03:39:52.860
Deputy Speaker Alfredo "Albee" B. Benitez: Does the Philippine Sports Commission consider,

asr-003164
03:39:52.920 --> 03:39:57.920
Deputy Speaker Alfredo "Albee" B. Benitez: tying up with renowned academy

asr-003165
03:39:57.920 --> 03:39:59.920
Deputy Speaker Alfredo "Albee" B. Benitez: for putting them here in the Philippines

asr-003166
03:39:59.920 --> 03:40:02.920
Deputy Speaker Alfredo "Albee" B. Benitez: so that the training, technology,

asr-003167
03:40:02.920 --> 03:40:11.150
Deputy Speaker Alfredo "Albee" B. Benitez: the transfer of skills can be accessed here in the country?

asr-003168
03:40:11.150 --> 03:40:12.410
Deputy Speaker Alfredo "Albee" B. Benitez: Ginagawa pa po natin 'yon?

asr-003169
03:40:12.410 --> 03:40:21.350
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: Yes, we are very interested and we are pursuing that, Mr. Speaker.

asr-003170
03:40:21.350 --> 03:40:22.080
Deputy Speaker Alfredo "Albee" B. Benitez: Okay, good to know.

asr-003171
03:40:22.080 --> 03:40:24.000
Deputy Speaker Alfredo "Albee" B. Benitez: Kasi lahat ng mga

asr-003172
03:40:24.000 --> 03:40:27.359
Deputy Speaker Alfredo "Albee" B. Benitez: sikat natin na athletes talagang nag-train abroad eh.

asr-003173
03:40:27.359 --> 03:40:32.720
Deputy Speaker Alfredo "Albee" B. Benitez: Tapos doon sila nakakakuha ng mga, uh, well, skills na

asr-003174
03:40:32.720 --> 03:40:36.680
Deputy Speaker Alfredo "Albee" B. Benitez: nagiging, uh, very successful ang kanilang career.

asr-003175
03:40:36.680 --> 03:40:38.200
Deputy Speaker Alfredo "Albee" B. Benitez: No, so Majority Leader.

asr-003176
03:40:42.160 --> 03:40:45.160
Rep. Katrina Reiko Chua-Tai: Mr. Speaker, next to interpellate the sponsor,

asr-003177
03:40:45.160 --> 03:40:48.160
Rep. Katrina Reiko Chua-Tai: I move to recognize Representative Jet Nisay

asr-003178
03:40:48.160 --> 03:40:51.160
Rep. Katrina Reiko Chua-Tai: from Pusong Pinoy Party List.

asr-003179
03:40:52.160 --> 03:40:56.160
Deputy Speaker Alfredo "Albee" B. Benitez: Representative from Pusong Pinoy Party List is recognized.

asr-003180
03:40:56.160 --> 03:41:00.160
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Good morning, Mr. Speaker, Mr. Sponsor.

asr-003181
03:41:00.160 --> 03:41:04.160
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: A few questions lamang po para po sa PSC.

asr-003182
03:41:04.160 --> 03:41:09.160
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Unang-una ho, pagdating sa grassroots po natin.

asr-003183
03:41:09.160 --> 03:41:14.160
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Mr. Speaker, Mr. Sponsor, sa Batang Pinoy na umaabot

asr-003184
03:41:14.160 --> 03:41:18.160
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: sa around 15,000 young athletes aged 17 and below

asr-003185
03:41:18.160 --> 03:41:21.160
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: na nagko-compete sa 27 sports.

asr-003186
03:41:21.160 --> 03:41:25.160
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Paano po natin sinusundan ang kanilang development

asr-003187
03:41:25.160 --> 03:41:27.160
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: pagkatapos nilang makilahok?

asr-003188
03:41:27.160 --> 03:41:33.160
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: At ilan sa kanilang eventually napupunta sa national training pool?

asr-003189
03:41:45.160 --> 03:41:47.160
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: After, Mr. Speaker, Your Honor,

asr-003190
03:41:47.160 --> 03:41:49.160
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: after Batang Pinoy po,

asr-003191
03:41:49.160 --> 03:42:01.160
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: kasunod po ang Palarong Pambansa sa pag-monitor sa ating mga athletes.

asr-003192
03:42:05.160 --> 03:42:13.160
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: Then ang NSA po ang nagsa-check ng mga best performances sa ating mga athletes.

asr-003193
03:42:13.160 --> 03:42:17.160
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: At ang PSC po ay merong youth pool.

asr-003194
03:42:17.160 --> 03:42:21.160
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: Your Honor.

asr-003195
03:42:21.160 --> 03:42:23.160
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Mr. Speaker, Mr. Sponsor,

asr-003196
03:42:23.160 --> 03:42:29.160
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: napakalaga po nito dahil hindi nagtatapos sa isang torneo ang talent identification.

asr-003197
03:42:29.160 --> 03:42:35.160
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Dapat ay may sistema para masundan at ma-develop ang mga atleta na may angking husay at talento.

asr-003198
03:42:35.160 --> 03:42:39.160
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Ang follow-up question ko lamang ho, Mr. Speaker, Mr. Sponsor,

asr-003199
03:42:39.160 --> 03:42:43.160
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: may centralized talent tracking system po ba ang PSC?

asr-003200
03:42:43.160 --> 03:42:45.160
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: From grassroots happening,

asr-003201
03:42:45.160 --> 03:42:47.160
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: elite level?

asr-003202
03:42:47.160 --> 03:42:55.160
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: At may data po ba kung ilan sa mga dating palarumpang bansa at Batang Pinoy athletes ang umabot na sa national level o team?

asr-003203
03:43:01.160 --> 03:43:05.160
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: Yes po, meron pong tracking yan.

asr-003204
03:43:05.160 --> 03:43:07.160
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: Ang humahawak po niyan ay ang NSAs.

asr-003205
03:43:07.160 --> 03:43:09.160
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: At ang mga kanya-kanyang

asr-003206
03:43:09.160 --> 03:43:11.160
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: ahm

asr-003207
03:43:11.160 --> 03:43:13.160
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: ahm

asr-003208
03:43:13.160 --> 03:43:23.160
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: Sanasabit po sa PSC ang mga list ng mga atleta?

asr-003209
03:43:23.160 --> 03:43:27.160
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Thank you Mr. Speaker, Mr. Sponsor.

asr-003210
03:43:27.160 --> 03:43:29.160
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Ang pangalawang katanungan ko po,

asr-003211
03:43:29.160 --> 03:43:31.160
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Mr. Speaker, Mr. Sponsor,

asr-003212
03:43:31.160 --> 03:43:37.160
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: May 44 million plus po sa NEP, sa 27 NEP para sa regional training centers.

asr-003213
03:43:39.160 --> 03:43:41.160
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Ilang centers po ang target nitong ponduhan

asr-003214
03:43:41.160 --> 03:43:46.000
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: at saan po sila ilalagay at ilang atlets ang direktang makikinabang.

asr-003215
03:44:01.160 --> 03:44:10.400
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: Mr. Speaker, Your Honor, PSC will support 44, 40 sports

asr-003216
03:44:11.160 --> 03:44:14.100
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: focused on Olympic sports.

asr-003217
03:44:16.820 --> 03:44:25.460
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: At kada sport po, merong tatlong regional training center

asr-003218
03:44:25.460 --> 03:44:27.860
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: in Luzon, Visayas, and Mindanao.

asr-003219
03:44:29.460 --> 03:44:32.260
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Mr. Speaker, Mr. Sponsor, napakalaga po nito

asr-003220
03:44:32.260 --> 03:44:36.500
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: dahil hindi lahat ng promising atlets ay malapit sa Metro Manila.

asr-003221
03:44:37.460 --> 03:44:39.580
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Kung kulang ang regional training infrastructure,

asr-003222
03:44:39.580 --> 03:44:40.920
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: mas mahirap po.

asr-003223
03:44:40.920 --> 03:44:43.300
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Sa atlets from the provinces na magkaroon

asr-003224
03:44:43.300 --> 03:44:46.700
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: ng regular access sa quality training and support.

asr-003225
03:44:47.320 --> 03:44:48.540
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Ang follow-up question ko po,

asr-003226
03:44:48.920 --> 03:44:50.540
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: ano po ang kriteriya ng PSC

asr-003227
03:44:50.540 --> 03:44:54.420
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: sa pagpili ng regions na magkakaroon ng regional training centers?

asr-003228
03:44:55.000 --> 03:44:58.180
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Nakabatay rin ba ito kung nag-excel ang kada region o probinsya?

asr-003229
03:45:00.000 --> 03:45:04.580
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: Yes, totoo po yan.

asr-003230
03:45:06.140 --> 03:45:20.500
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: Since Chairman Gregorio took office in July 2025, PSC has established at least 21 locations, project nationwide, covering completed and ongoing centers.

asr-003231
03:45:21.200 --> 03:45:27.980
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: These efforts are urgently being implemented in response to express directive from the Office of the President.

asr-003232
03:45:27.980 --> 03:45:40.420
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Mr. Speaker, Mr. Sponsor, may national assessment po ba ang PSC kung ating regions ang underserved in terms of sports facilities and training capacity?

asr-003233
03:45:50.920 --> 03:45:57.420
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: Mr. Speaker, Your Honor, si Chairman po ang mismong umiikot sa...

asr-003234
03:45:57.980 --> 03:46:02.900
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: ...bansa natin para pag-inspect at pagtingin sa mga sitwasyon ng kada probinsya.

asr-003235
03:46:04.200 --> 03:46:05.060
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: Your Honor.

asr-003236
03:46:07.060 --> 03:46:21.900
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Mr. Speaker, Mr. Sponsor, mas maganda po siguro mas madagdagan pa o mas lakihan pa yung pondo pagdating po sa mga sports center po natin across sa 18 regions po natin.

asr-003237
03:46:21.900 --> 03:46:26.620
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: So yung 44 million plus po na to, kulang na kulang.

asr-003238
03:46:27.980 --> 03:46:30.120
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Hindi po doblihin, triplihin o mas lakihan pa.

asr-003239
03:46:31.040 --> 03:46:33.840
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Mr. Speaker, Mr. Sponsor.

asr-003240
03:46:34.260 --> 03:46:44.080
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: Mr. Speaker, Your Honor, actually, sangayon po ako dyan dahil base po dito sa na-aprubahan ng DBM para sa PSC,

asr-003241
03:46:44.840 --> 03:46:51.820
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: nagbawas po ng 40.57% amounting to 895,364,000.

asr-003242
03:46:51.820 --> 03:46:57.120
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: Pero alam ko po sa ating bagong chairman ng Philippine Sports Commission,

asr-003243
03:46:57.980 --> 03:47:03.640
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: po yung kanyang ginagawa at mga achievements, kahit maiksi pa lang ang kanyang panunungkulan,

asr-003244
03:47:03.760 --> 03:47:07.340
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: e marami na pong mga nagawa ng mga regional training centers.

asr-003245
03:47:08.460 --> 03:47:11.920
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Thank you, Mr. Speaker, Mr. Sponsor.

asr-003246
03:47:12.580 --> 03:47:15.600
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Pagdating naman po sa sports as an economic industry,

asr-003247
03:47:16.700 --> 03:47:18.560
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Mr. Speaker, Mr. Sponsor,

asr-003248
03:47:19.360 --> 03:47:21.840
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: ang sports is not only government expenditure,

asr-003249
03:47:22.360 --> 03:47:27.840
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: maaari rin po itong maging industriya, trabaho at karir for coaches, sportsmen,

asr-003250
03:47:27.980 --> 03:47:35.000
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: medicine, fitness, events, broadcasting, tourism facilities, and sports equipment.

asr-003251
03:47:35.760 --> 03:47:40.200
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: May national strategy po ba ang PSC para mapalagong sports economy?

asr-003252
03:47:49.000 --> 03:47:57.960
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: Sa totoo lang po, base kay chairman, dyan po ang talagang isa sa mandato ng PSC coming from the President.

asr-003253
03:47:57.960 --> 03:48:04.080
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: President himself, Administrative Order No. 38,

asr-003254
03:48:06.060 --> 03:48:17.200
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: creating the Sports Tourism Council to support economic development, Your Honor.

asr-003255
03:48:17.940 --> 03:48:20.360
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Thank you, Mr. Speaker, Mr. Sponsor.

asr-003256
03:48:20.360 --> 03:48:27.860
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Ang aking follow-up question, nakikipag-coordinate po ba ang PSC with DTI and DOT upang gawing economic activity?

asr-003257
03:48:27.960 --> 03:48:32.100
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: In major sporting events and sports tourism.

asr-003258
03:48:42.940 --> 03:48:56.820
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: Ang DOT po, Mr. Speaker, Your Honor, ang DOT po ang tumatayong vice chairman ng NST committee at ang chairman po ang PSC.

asr-003259
03:48:57.960 --> 03:49:10.580
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Mr. Speaker, Mr. Sponsor, may estimate din po ba ang PSC kung ilang jobs and economic activity ang nililika ng major sporting events and sports facilities?

asr-003261
03:49:27.960 --> 03:49:52.600
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: Mr. Speaker, Your Honor, sa economic indicator po natin, sa $1 na gastos sa bawat sports tourism, ang balik po niyan ay times 15.

asr-003262
03:49:54.940 --> 03:49:57.940
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: According to the Nielsen Report, Your Honor.

asr-003263
03:49:57.960 --> 03:50:01.340
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Thank you, Mr. Speaker, Mr. Sponsor.

asr-003264
03:50:02.020 --> 03:50:09.020
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Pagdating naman po sa ating athlete safety, lessons from the Baterbonia and Adili tragedy,

asr-003265
03:50:09.860 --> 03:50:19.720
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Mr. Speaker, Mr. Sponsor, kamakailan lamang po ay nasawi ang ating dalawang student-athletes na si Rene Baterbonia at Divine Adili sa isang team-building activity.

asr-003266
03:50:20.780 --> 03:50:27.440
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Nagpanukala rin po ang inyong lingkod ng House Bill 9892 o ang Local of Campus Activities Safety Act.

asr-003267
03:50:27.960 --> 03:50:37.840
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Na layong magkaroon ng safety standards at risk classification ang iba't-ibang off-campus activities ng mga mag-aaral sa ilalim ng DepEd, CHED, TESDA.

asr-003268
03:50:37.840 --> 03:50:57.840
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Pero para sa Philippines Sports Commission na may mandato sa athletes welfare at sports development, ano pong specific role ng PSC sa pagtiyak ng kaligtasan ng ating mga atleta, lalo na kapag sila ay kabilang sa school-based sports programs at officially sanctioned activities?

asr-003269
03:50:57.960 --> 03:51:22.160
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: Mr. Speaker, Your Honor, nagtatag na po ang PSC ng Stakeholders Committee together with DepEd, CHED, UAAP, SBP, and National Youth Commission.

asr-003270
03:51:22.160 --> 03:51:27.160
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: At nabanggit siya po yung nangyaring disgrasya sa...

asr-003271
03:51:27.960 --> 03:51:33.720
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: Sa Ateneo, PSC extended P250,000 to each family.

asr-003272
03:51:34.720 --> 03:51:35.100
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: Your Honor.

asr-003273
03:51:36.340 --> 03:51:39.080
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Thank you, Mr. Speaker, Mr. Sponsor.

asr-003274
03:51:39.880 --> 03:51:41.140
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Follow-up question ko lamang po.

asr-003275
03:51:41.620 --> 03:51:57.800
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Dahil marami pong student-athletes ay mula sa private schools, malinaw po ba kung hanggang saan ng responsibilidad ng PSC, ng school, ng National Sports Association, at ng event organizer kapag may serious injury o fatal accident sa isang sports-related activities?

asr-003276
03:51:57.960 --> 03:52:25.220
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: Mr. Speaker, Your Honor, sa mga ganyang sitwasyon po, ang nangunguna po dyan ay ang CHED,

asr-003277
03:52:25.220 --> 03:52:27.220
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: at ang...

asr-003278
03:52:27.960 --> 03:52:34.720
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: sponsoring league, for example, UAAP, and then...

asr-003279
03:52:38.720 --> 03:52:47.660
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: PSC is developing a National Athlete and Coaches Code with strong iterations of safe sport principles.

asr-003280
03:52:48.180 --> 03:52:57.000
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: It is also backing stronger coaching and safeguarding standards, including the proposed Sports Coaching Act, House Bill 2631,

asr-003281
03:52:57.000 --> 03:52:57.300
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: which...

asr-003282
03:52:57.300 --> 03:53:12.400
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: which seeks a national multi-sport coaching accreditation system, a national roster of accredited coaches, continuing education, and stronger safety and competency requirements.

asr-003283
03:53:12.520 --> 03:53:12.840
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: Your Honor.

asr-003284
03:53:13.360 --> 03:53:15.380
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Thank you, Mr. Speaker, Mr. Sponsor.

asr-003285
03:53:15.980 --> 03:53:26.440
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Bilang huling katalungan na lamang po, familiar po ba kayo sa mga tinatawag na pay-to-play in sports pagdating po sa grassroots program po natin?

asr-003286
03:53:27.300 --> 03:53:42.640
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: Mr. Speaker, Your Honor, and sa PSC po, wala po.

asr-003287
03:53:43.240 --> 03:53:43.340
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Oo.

asr-003288
03:53:44.120 --> 03:53:50.300
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Mr. Speaker, Mr. Sponsor, gusto ko rin pong itanong ang issue ng play...

asr-003289
03:53:51.620 --> 03:53:53.980
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: pay-to-play sa grassroots and youth sports.

asr-003290
03:53:54.280 --> 03:53:56.820
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Alam po ninyo, marami pong mga organization.

asr-003291
03:53:57.300 --> 03:53:58.880
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Ang bumababa sa mga probinsya.

asr-003292
03:53:59.520 --> 03:54:07.220
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: So, ito po yung mga sports organization na hindi ko po alam kung nakikipag-partner po ba ito sa atin pong Philippine Sports Commission.

asr-003293
03:54:07.220 --> 03:54:24.200
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Ang nangyayari, malalaking liga, maglalaro ang mga bata, pero kailangan nilang gumastos para sa pang-sarili nilang mga entrance fee, mga uniform, iba't iba pong mga gastos pagdating sa sports program.

asr-003294
03:54:24.780 --> 03:54:27.280
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Ano po kaya yung maaaring tulong?

asr-003295
03:54:27.300 --> 03:54:31.820
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Ano po kaya yung maaaring tulong ng PSC pagdating ko sa mga problema na nangyayari po sa mga probinsya?

asr-003296
03:54:37.640 --> 03:54:42.980
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: Mr. Speaker, Your Honor, yung po bang sinasabi nyo, yung mga nakikita nating mga ligang labas?

asr-003297
03:54:44.420 --> 03:54:51.520
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Hindi po, Mr. Speaker, Mr. Sponsor. Ito po yung mga sports organization na bumababa sa mga iba't-ibang probinsya.

asr-003298
03:54:51.520 --> 03:54:56.640
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Pwedeng basketball, pwedeng volleyball, pwedeng football.

asr-003299
03:54:57.300 --> 03:55:06.120
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Tapos marami pong magsasali at syempre, malaking gastos kasi yun. Nagbabayad sila ng entrance, ng uniform.

asr-003300
03:55:13.740 --> 03:55:24.620
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: Mr. Speaker, Your Honor, tumutulong po ang PSC. Katunayan sa Baguio po ngayon, may bagong liga na supportado ng PSC.

asr-003301
03:55:24.620 --> 03:55:40.560
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Siguro po, Mr. Speaker, Mr. Sponsor, siguro po mas maganda ma-i-register po natin sila lahat para sa pagkakataon po na mas marami po tayong matulungan po sa across 18 regions.

asr-003302
03:55:40.560 --> 03:55:53.740
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Kasi ito po yung sports program na nauuso ngayon. Marami po halos yung mga magulang gumagastos para makasali lamang yung kanilang anak doon sa paborito nilang sports.

asr-003303
03:55:54.620 --> 03:56:00.980
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: At, Mr. Speaker, Mr. Sponsor, I am manifesting my full support para sa Philippine Sports Commission.

asr-003304
03:56:02.100 --> 03:56:08.900
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Bilang isa ring atleta, napakalaga po ang patuloy na investment natin sa ating bawat atleta at kabataan.

asr-003305
03:56:08.900 --> 03:56:19.020
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Hindi lamang para sa mga medalya, kundi para sa disiplina, kalusugan, oportunidad, at pagbandera ng kanilang galing at talento sa buong mundo.

asr-003306
03:56:19.700 --> 03:56:24.500
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Umaasa po tayo na sa ilalim ng 2027 budget, mas marami pang kabataan.

asr-003307
03:56:24.620 --> 03:56:33.460
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Mas marami pang kabataan na mabigyan ng pagkakataon matuklasan at malinang ang kanilang talento para sa kinabukasan ng Philippine sports sa dangal ng ating bansa.

asr-003308
03:56:34.000 --> 03:56:48.220
