asr-003623
04:09:26.060 --> 04:09:26.960
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: ay isang parte ng kultura natin,

asr-003625
04:09:27.040 --> 04:09:28.680
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Mr. Speaker, no?

asr-003626
04:09:28.680 --> 04:09:31.040
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Since time immemorial,

asr-003627
