asr-003629
04:09:33.640 --> 04:09:36.160
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: it's a dying industry.

asr-003630
04:09:36.160 --> 04:09:37.720
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: That's why

asr-003631
04:09:37.720 --> 04:09:41.880
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Congressman Dogok and I filed House Bill number 9386

asr-003632
04:09:41.880 --> 04:09:45.220
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: to strengthen the Philippine Racing Commission

asr-003633
04:09:45.220 --> 04:09:47.320
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: from Piracom to Piracor

asr-003634
04:09:47.320 --> 04:09:49.660
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: to have IPEN.

asr-003635
04:09:49.660 --> 04:09:53.940
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: At alam po natin that the Philippine Racing Commission,

asr-003636
04:09:53.940 --> 04:09:55.160
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: horse racing natin,

asr-003637
04:09:55.160 --> 04:09:56.160
