asr-003638
04:09:56.160 --> 04:09:57.040
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: ay nagbibigay

asr-003639
04:09:57.040 --> 04:10:00.080
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: po ito ng pera sa gobyerno natin

asr-003640
04:10:00.080 --> 04:10:04.160
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: every year. At despite the fact,

asr-003641
04:10:04.160 --> 04:10:08.200
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: bumabalik lang po sa kanila

asr-003642
04:10:08.200 --> 04:10:14.760
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: is 20% lang po out of remittance po nila.

asr-003643
04:10:14.760 --> 04:10:18.150
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: So if we're not going to support this Philippine Racing Commission,

asr-003644
04:10:18.150 --> 04:10:21.500
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: baka po mawala ang ating kultura.

asr-003646
04:10:21.500 --> 04:10:31.440
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Kaya po ako ay kaisa po ng Philippine Racing Commission para po mapalakas po natin, kagaya po ng Philippine Sports Commission.

asr-003647
04:10:32.260 --> 04:10:39.340
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: For that, Mr. Speaker, my first question, under the proposed fiscal year 2027 budget,

asr-003648
04:10:40.060 --> 04:10:49.320
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Piracom's capital outlays have been reduced to zero from 605,000 for 2026.

asr-003649
04:10:49.320 --> 04:10:58.980
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: At the same time, its own MOE for general administration and support is reduced from 12 million to 10.5 million.

asr-003650
04:10:59.580 --> 04:11:07.460
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Imagine, Mr. Chair, given these reductions, how does Piracom intend to sustain the replacement,

asr-003651
04:11:08.800 --> 04:11:15.160
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: upgrading, or modernization of its equipment and administrative systems,

asr-003652
04:11:15.580 --> 04:11:19.140
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: particularly those needed for track inspection,

asr-003653
04:11:19.320 --> 04:11:24.160
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: laboratory testing, and regulatory operations?

asr-003654
04:11:26.040 --> 04:11:32.400
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: Mr. Speaker, Your Honor, under Special Provision No. 1 of the NEP,

asr-003655
04:11:33.000 --> 04:11:39.460
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: Piracom relies on off-budget trust receipts derived from the racetrack breakage,

asr-003656
04:11:40.180 --> 04:11:47.020
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: which are legally earmarked to cover necessary capital outlays and horse breeding expenses.

asr-003657
04:11:47.220 --> 04:11:48.100
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: Furthermore,

asr-003658
04:11:48.100 --> 04:11:57.820
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: anti-doping and testing facilities have historically been provided or charged under the legislative franchise of the racing clubs themselves.

asr-003659
04:11:58.820 --> 04:12:05.240
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: Piracom currently operates on limited regulatory funds and have requested additional budgetary support

asr-003660
04:12:05.240 --> 04:12:09.320
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: to safely perform their oversight functions, Your Honor.

asr-003661
04:12:10.020 --> 04:12:10.680
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Thank you.

asr-003662
04:12:10.680 --> 04:12:16.280
