Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: And how will Piracom...

asr-003664
04:12:18.100 --> 04:12:25.140
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: ensure that these reductions do not compromise its regulatory and monetary functions?

asr-003665
04:12:25.900 --> 04:12:27.000
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: Mr. Speaker, Your Honor,

asr-003666
04:12:27.800 --> 04:12:30.840
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: Piracom will not defer any program.

asr-003667
04:12:31.460 --> 04:12:31.820
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: However,

asr-003668
04:12:32.720 --> 04:12:35.880
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: the Commission will maximize the budget provided.

asr-003669
04:12:36.740 --> 04:12:38.160
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: Mr. Your Honor.

asr-003670
