Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Mr. Speaker,

asr-003672
04:12:43.160 --> 04:12:47.940
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Piracom does not currently have a dedicated full-scale agency-owned

asr-003673
04:12:47.940 --> 04:12:49.700
