asr-003674
04:12:49.700 --> 04:12:54.200
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: and relies in part on race club facilities

asr-003675
04:12:54.200 --> 04:12:56.400
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: and available agency resources

asr-003676
04:12:56.400 --> 04:12:59.640
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: for anti-doping enforcement.

asr-003677
04:13:00.380 --> 04:13:04.220
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Given that fiscal 2027 horse racing regulatory program

asr-003678
04:13:04.220 --> 04:13:08.120
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: provides only 7 million in MOOE

asr-003679
04:13:08.120 --> 04:13:10.360
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: and zero capital outlay,

asr-003680
04:13:10.860 --> 04:13:14.780
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: how does Piracom ensure that anti-doping testing

asr-003681
04:13:14.780 --> 04:13:17.280
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: is independent, mandatory,

asr-003682
04:13:17.940 --> 04:13:23.020
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: random, and sufficiently funded to cover racehorses and jockeys?

asr-003683
04:13:24.100 --> 04:13:25.480
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: Mr. Speaker, Your Honor,

asr-003684
04:13:25.480 --> 04:13:31.580
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: Piracom relies on testing facilities and equipment provided under the legislative franchise

asr-003685
04:13:31.580 --> 04:13:33.680
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: of the operating race clubs,

asr-003686
04:13:33.680 --> 04:13:37.020
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: Metro Manila Turf Club and Philippine Racing Club

asr-003687
04:13:37.500 --> 04:13:39.460
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: to perform horse testing

asr-003688
04:13:39.460 --> 04:13:43.720
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: rather than using agency-owned capital assets.

asr-003689
04:13:44.140 --> 04:13:47.800
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: While Piracom utilizes its limited regulatory,

asr-003690
04:13:47.940 --> 04:13:49.460
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: program MOE

asr-003691
04:13:49.460 --> 04:13:52.160
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: 7.115

asr-003692
04:13:52.160 --> 04:13:54.160
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: million for day-to-day

asr-003693
04:13:54.160 --> 04:13:56.060
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: regulatory operations, their

asr-003694
04:13:56.060 --> 04:13:57.960
Rep. Gerardo J. Espina Jr.: funds are limited and have formally

asr-003695
04:13:57.960 --> 04:13:59.580
