asr-004556
05:23:39.000 --> 05:23:45.040
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Mas gustuhin mo naman na safe ka, sound, and malinis po ang units po.

asr-004557
05:23:46.220 --> 05:23:46.940
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: So, okay.

asr-004558
05:23:47.180 --> 05:23:50.320
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: So, nandyan ng DSUD to make sure na talaga ito.

asr-004559
05:23:50.620 --> 05:23:51.900
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Yes, Mr. Speaker.

asr-004560
05:23:52.700 --> 05:23:53.460
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Good answer.

asr-004561
05:23:53.880 --> 05:23:56.480
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: And State Management Council po.

asr-004562
05:23:56.640 --> 05:23:56.940
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Okay.

asr-004563
05:23:58.180 --> 05:23:59.080
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Follow-up question again.

asr-004564
05:23:59.260 --> 05:24:01.500
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: For rental housing program naman ng 4PH.

asr-004565
05:24:01.500 --> 05:24:07.880
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: The SHUD has also identified rental housing as a component of the 4PH program,

asr-004566
05:24:08.380 --> 05:24:18.500
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: potentially providing an alternative for families that may not yet be capable of assuming a long-term housing loan and monthly amortization.

asr-004567
05:24:19.740 --> 05:24:20.080
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Question.

asr-004568
05:24:20.620 --> 05:24:27.260
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Can the SHUD explain the 4PH rental housing program, particularly its indented beneficiaries,

asr-004569
05:24:27.260 --> 05:24:32.700
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: and how it differs from the ownership-based component of PH?

asr-004570
05:24:36.720 --> 05:24:40.520
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: So, in short, mayroon pala kayo rental housing program. May program pala ito.

asr-004571
05:24:42.400 --> 05:24:48.260
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Mr. Speaker, for rental housing po, sa government nyo, and then after matapos,

asr-004572
05:24:48.260 --> 05:24:54.220
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: i-turnover na po sa local government units, sila na po nag-administer.

asr-004573
05:24:54.760 --> 05:24:59.540
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: So, ang LGU, once being done, transferred to LGU, sila na mag-maintain?

asr-004574
05:24:59.800 --> 05:25:00.800
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Yes, Mr. Speaker.

asr-004575
05:25:01.080 --> 05:25:04.760
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: And then, even the ownership ba noon, o hindi lang yung ano lang?

asr-004576
05:25:05.060 --> 05:25:06.120
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Yung management lang?

asr-004577
05:25:06.140 --> 05:25:07.220
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Rental lang po, Mr. Speaker.

asr-004578
05:25:07.480 --> 05:25:07.740
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Okay.

asr-004579
05:25:07.740 --> 05:25:17.980
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: So, what are the eligibility requirements, and how does the SHUD determine,

asr-004580
05:25:17.980 --> 05:25:23.860
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: and validate whether a household actually requires subsidized rental housing?

asr-004581
05:25:25.400 --> 05:25:30.940
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Actually, Mr. Speaker, ang priority natin dyan is yung mga nasa danger zones,

asr-004582
05:25:31.160 --> 05:25:33.800
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: and yung LGU din po nag-identify.

asr-004583
05:25:34.780 --> 05:25:35.960
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: So, the LGU is the one...

asr-004584
05:25:35.960 --> 05:25:41.180
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Danger zones, tapos yung mga napektuhan ng programa, proyekto ng gobyerno, yun po.

asr-004585
05:25:41.180 --> 05:25:47.900
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: So, what are the mechanics of the subsidy?

asr-004586
05:25:47.980 --> 05:25:50.920
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: How much of the rent is shouldered by the government?

asr-004587
05:25:51.600 --> 05:25:54.040
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: How much is paid by the bilipasyari?

asr-004588
05:25:54.620 --> 05:25:57.840
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: And for how long can a household receive assistance?

asr-004589
05:25:59.100 --> 05:26:04.920
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Mr. Speaker, yung binabayad po nila, rental fee, sobrang mababa na po yun.

asr-004590
05:26:05.100 --> 05:26:07.780
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Para lang po yun for the estate management.

asr-004591
05:26:08.340 --> 05:26:10.740
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: So, definitely po walang kita ang gobyerno natin dyan.

asr-004592
05:26:14.640 --> 05:26:17.080
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Actually, hindi ko sinabi yung mga committee gobyerno.

asr-004593
05:26:17.080 --> 05:26:17.780
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: So, how much...

asr-004594
05:26:17.980 --> 05:26:22.180
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: How much rent shouldered by the government?

asr-004595
05:26:22.820 --> 05:26:25.580
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Sila ba may share sila sa pagbayad o wala?

asr-004596
05:26:25.580 --> 05:26:30.840
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Mr. Speaker, yung sinolder po ng government, yung pagawa mismo ng building.

asr-004597
05:26:32.520 --> 05:26:38.520
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: So, what is the process for a family to apply for and avail itself of the program?

asr-004598
05:26:38.760 --> 05:26:42.040
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Ito ba available po sa lahat ng Pilipino or there should be...

asr-004599
05:26:42.040 --> 05:26:43.060
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Actually, dati po.

asr-004600
05:26:43.060 --> 05:26:47.060
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: In LGU kasi na po ang merong...

asr-004601
05:26:47.060 --> 05:26:47.920
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Kahit sino?

asr-004602
05:26:47.980 --> 05:26:48.680
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Knowledge po niyan.

asr-004603
05:26:48.820 --> 05:26:51.300
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Kahit sino, pwede mag-apply o yung mga nasa lay-in muna.

asr-004604
05:26:51.300 --> 05:26:54.200
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Meron po tayo mechanics. Meron po mechanics ang LGU.

asr-004605
05:26:54.580 --> 05:26:57.380
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Una is, yun nga, yun na sa danger zone.

asr-004606
05:26:57.900 --> 05:27:01.780
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Second, yung ma-informal settlers na na-evict sa mga pamamahay nila.

asr-004607
05:27:02.680 --> 05:27:08.200
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Third, yung mga nasalanta ng magyo, yung mga dilubyo, yung nasunugan.

asr-004608
05:27:08.340 --> 05:27:10.420
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Like, best example po, dito sa NIA.

asr-004609
05:27:11.020 --> 05:27:13.760
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Nasunog yung babae nila. Ngayon, ginagawa po ng gobyerno.

asr-004610
05:27:14.240 --> 05:27:17.340
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Sila din yung po yung titira, yung mga biktima po ng sunog.

asr-004611
05:27:17.980 --> 05:27:21.220
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Fair enough. Good answer.

asr-004612
05:27:21.600 --> 05:27:22.060
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Thank you.

asr-004613
05:27:22.300 --> 05:27:30.180
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: As of today, how many rental housing units have actually been completed and made available for occupancy?

asr-004614
05:27:30.420 --> 05:27:35.140
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: And how many families are currently renting units under the program?

asr-004615
05:27:36.060 --> 05:27:39.840
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Mr. Speaker, almost 5,000 po. Ginagawa pa lang ngayon.

asr-004616
05:27:39.960 --> 05:27:43.760
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: But next year, first quarter, mag-start na po ng turnover.

asr-004617
05:27:45.220 --> 05:27:46.300
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Ng 5,000 units?

asr-004618
05:27:46.360 --> 05:27:46.820
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Yes po.

asr-004619
05:27:46.820 --> 05:27:47.820
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Yes, Mr. Speaker.

asr-004620
05:27:47.980 --> 05:27:48.360
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Are you sure?

asr-004621
05:27:48.680 --> 05:27:50.140
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Yes po. Start pa lang.

asr-004622
05:27:50.140 --> 05:27:51.080
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: How can you be sure?

asr-004623
05:27:51.340 --> 05:27:53.460
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: I can be sure because I have it in my district.

asr-004624
05:27:53.920 --> 05:27:54.800
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Okay. Thank you.

asr-004625
05:27:56.180 --> 05:27:57.780
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Now, my follow-up question.

asr-004626
05:27:58.800 --> 05:28:04.820
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: The Social Housing Finance Corporation continues to implement the Community Mortgage Program

asr-004627
05:28:04.820 --> 05:28:11.800
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: which assists organized communities in acquiring and developing land for housing.

asr-004628
05:28:11.800 --> 05:28:17.800
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Some Community Mortgage Program projects have also been presented as part of

asr-004629
05:28:17.980 --> 05:28:20.920
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: the accomplishment of the 4-Page Program.

asr-004630
05:28:20.920 --> 05:28:35.040
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Question. What criteria does the SHFC use in determining which communities or sites will be prioritized for financing under the Community Mortgage Program?

asr-004631
05:28:35.040 --> 05:28:47.260
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Mr. Speaker, sa totoo lang po, pag may lupa na available, pag-organize si Homeowners Association, magpapadala po ng member ng board,

asr-004632
05:28:47.980 --> 05:28:53.660
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: si SHFC, tapos first-come, first-served sa makakumplay.

asr-004633
05:28:54.840 --> 05:29:02.960
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: So, wala pong problema po sa beneficiary, basta po, kompleto, in compliance po sa mga requirement.

asr-004634
05:29:02.960 --> 05:29:15.760
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Best example, for example, si LGU or si DSUD, meron pong available ang lot na i-offer ang isang private individual.

asr-004635
05:29:15.760 --> 05:29:24.200
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Pag nagkakasundo po sa presyo, posible po na magbibigyan ng importansya ni SHFC.

asr-004636
05:29:24.700 --> 05:29:27.240
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: What is good with this, meron po silang dalawang team.

asr-004637
05:29:27.740 --> 05:29:35.320
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Una, yung appraisal. Second, yung member po ng board or yung komposisyon po ng engineer, architects.

asr-004638
05:29:35.320 --> 05:29:44.540
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: So, they would check the area. Then, after po dyan, if necessary na mag-meet sila, often in a week, gagawin po nila yan.

asr-004639
05:29:45.760 --> 05:29:56.580
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Kaya po, importante talaga for LGU, for local government units sa area na sila mismo tutulungan po yung hoa nila makumplay yung mga dokumento na needed po.

asr-004640
05:29:57.240 --> 05:29:57.660
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Thank you.

asr-004641
05:29:57.660 --> 05:30:00.320
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: For Community Mortgage Program Project,

asr-004642
05:30:00.320 --> 05:30:02.860
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: being reported as 4PH accomplishments.

asr-004643
05:30:03.920 --> 05:30:07.980
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: How many are genuinely new projects initiated under 4PH

asr-004644
05:30:07.980 --> 05:30:11.320
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: and how many had already been identified,

asr-004645
05:30:12.040 --> 05:30:17.320
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: organized or processed before they were included under the 4PH banner?

asr-004646
05:30:17.780 --> 05:30:22.440
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: 47, Mr. Speaker, around 8,000 families po.

asr-004647
05:30:23.080 --> 05:30:27.140
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: And meron pa po yung naka-next in line sa pipeline po for this year.

asr-004648
05:30:27.720 --> 05:30:28.840
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: So next in line meron pa?

asr-004649
05:30:28.840 --> 05:30:29.520
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Yes po.

asr-004650
05:30:29.520 --> 05:30:31.020
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: And how, ilan sila?

asr-004651
05:30:31.240 --> 05:30:32.880
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Another 40.

asr-004652
05:30:32.880 --> 05:30:36.980
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Pero Mr. Speaker, sa totoo lang, ang challenge po dun sa WHOAS

asr-004653
05:30:36.980 --> 05:30:41.220
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: is hindi po nila kaya i-organize yung mga members nila.

asr-004654
05:30:41.740 --> 05:30:45.100
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: But that is why, kaya po si D. Sud nandoon na rin

asr-004655
05:30:45.100 --> 05:30:47.820
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: para tutulungan din yung local members nila.

asr-004656
05:30:48.760 --> 05:30:49.140
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Thank you.

asr-004657
05:30:49.460 --> 05:30:56.600
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: For projects that were already in the SHFC pipeline before 4PH,

asr-004658
05:30:57.160 --> 05:30:59.480
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: what additional intervention or financing

asr-004659
05:30:59.480 --> 05:31:04.060
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: was provided under 4PH that warrants counting them

asr-004660
05:31:04.060 --> 05:31:06.560
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: as 4PH accomplishments?

asr-004661
05:31:06.560 --> 05:31:11.680
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Actually po, Mr. Speaker, sa enhanced mortgage program,

asr-004662
05:31:12.220 --> 05:31:15.240
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: sinasama, allowed na po, at sinasama na nga yung utilities,

asr-004663
05:31:15.820 --> 05:31:17.640
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: yung land developments, streetlights po,

asr-004664
05:31:17.980 --> 05:31:19.880
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: yan po yung bagong programa ngayon ng SHFC.

asr-004665
05:31:20.520 --> 05:31:23.160
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: So, yung mga lahat yan?

asr-004666
05:31:23.780 --> 05:31:24.820
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Yes, Mr. Speaker.

asr-004667
05:31:24.820 --> 05:31:25.040
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Okay.

asr-004668
05:31:27.600 --> 05:31:28.820
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: How were these...

asr-004669
05:31:29.480 --> 05:31:30.880
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: sites prioritized?

asr-004670
05:31:31.700 --> 05:31:34.780
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Particularly when the acquisition of the property is financed

asr-004671
05:31:34.780 --> 05:31:37.620
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: using SHFC escrow funds?

asr-004672
05:31:38.260 --> 05:31:41.720
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: So, paano nyo i-prioritize yung location?

asr-004673
05:31:42.200 --> 05:31:45.580
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Mr. Speaker, as what I've said po, Mr. Speaker,

asr-004674
05:31:47.160 --> 05:31:52.480
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: kung sino ang una makapag-comply ng dokumento?

asr-004675
05:31:53.480 --> 05:31:56.700
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Kasi una, marami din request sa buong Pilipinas.

asr-004676
05:31:57.280 --> 05:31:59.480
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Especially po, ako, tip ko sa lahat,

asr-004677
05:31:59.480 --> 05:32:03.220
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: dapat mura para i-prioritize siya.

asr-004678
05:32:03.440 --> 05:32:05.640
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Kasi there are areas na sobrang mahal na.

asr-004679
05:32:07.440 --> 05:32:11.040
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Unaffordable na yung cost per square meters.

asr-004680
05:32:12.420 --> 05:32:12.640
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Okay.

asr-004681
05:32:12.880 --> 05:32:13.400
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Follow-up question.

asr-004682
05:32:13.560 --> 05:32:19.440
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Can SHFC provide a breakdown of the community mortgage program projects

asr-004683
05:32:19.440 --> 05:32:22.160
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: currently counted under 4PH,

asr-004684
05:32:22.620 --> 05:32:25.940
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: indicating when each project was first identified,

asr-004685
05:32:25.940 --> 05:32:28.940
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: when it entered the SHFC pipeline,

asr-004686
05:32:29.480 --> 05:32:32.540
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: when it was included under 4PH,

asr-004687
05:32:32.660 --> 05:32:37.260
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: the number of beneficiaries and the source of financing?

asr-004688
05:32:38.060 --> 05:32:39.240
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Yes, Mr. Speaker.

asr-004689
05:32:39.420 --> 05:32:40.060
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: We will comply.

asr-004690
05:32:40.200 --> 05:32:40.800
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: We will submit.

asr-004691
05:32:41.600 --> 05:32:41.720
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Okay.

asr-004692
05:32:45.140 --> 05:32:46.740
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Ito, very interesting to.

asr-004693
05:32:47.780 --> 05:32:51.680
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: During Secretary Jose Ramon Aliling's confirmation proceedings,

asr-004694
05:32:52.440 --> 05:32:55.940
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: then Congressman Luis Raymond L. Ray Villapuerta Jr.

asr-004695
05:32:56.740 --> 05:32:59.460
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: raised the issue of the Secretary's interest in private property.

asr-004696
05:32:59.460 --> 05:33:00.460
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: He also raised the issue of the Secretary's interest in private companies

asr-004697
05:33:00.460 --> 05:33:05.040
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: and whether this interest will be divested upon assuming public office.

asr-004698
05:33:05.040 --> 05:33:08.160
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Ang problema natin doon sa Secretary natin, single pa kasi eh.

asr-004699
05:33:08.240 --> 05:33:10.060
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Kaya walang puro trabaho.

asr-004700
05:33:10.240 --> 05:33:14.960
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Pero ngayon, I can assure you, 100% fully divested na po yung properties

asr-004701
05:33:14.960 --> 05:33:19.160
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: at yung mga interest ni Mr. Secretary sa corporation.

asr-004702
05:33:19.740 --> 05:33:21.040
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: I have nothing against the Secretary.

asr-004703
05:33:21.540 --> 05:33:24.860
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: I just saw it during the confirmation, so I have to relay lang ha.

asr-004704
05:33:25.240 --> 05:33:26.620
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: I have nothing to do with this.

asr-004705
05:33:26.620 --> 05:33:29.380
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Because, you know, since this is a budget, ano,

asr-004706
05:33:29.460 --> 05:33:32.760
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: okay, so we need to discuss everything.

asr-004707
05:33:35.280 --> 05:33:38.660
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Secretary, may we ask whether you have already completed,

asr-004708
05:33:38.980 --> 05:33:41.120
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: again, you already answered that, no?

asr-004709
05:33:42.300 --> 05:33:46.240
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: If yes, when was the divestment completed?

asr-004710
05:33:47.040 --> 05:33:51.340
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: And has the appropriate documentation been submitted to the relevant government agencies?

asr-004711
05:33:52.460 --> 05:33:54.340
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: I guess you complied that already.

asr-004712
05:33:54.940 --> 05:33:56.960
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Mr. Speaker, according to the good Secretary,

asr-004713
05:33:56.960 --> 05:33:57.960
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: as for the divestment,

asr-004714
05:33:59.460 --> 05:34:06.900
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: do you presently retain any direct or indirect financial interest

asr-004715
05:34:06.900 --> 05:34:12.400
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: in any company engaged in construction, real estate, development, engineering, property?

asr-004716
05:34:12.400 --> 05:34:14.780
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: According to the good Secretary, 100% divested.

asr-004717
05:34:15.980 --> 05:34:17.740
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Hindi pa ako tapos. Galing mo sa umugot, ha?

asr-004718
05:34:19.040 --> 05:34:23.380
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Given the technical and highly specialized nature of housing policy,

asr-004719
05:34:24.180 --> 05:34:28.520
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: urban development, housing finance, estate management,

asr-004720
05:34:28.520 --> 05:34:29.440
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: and so on,

asr-004721
05:34:29.460 --> 05:34:34.900
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: the development planning, the professional expertise of the SHUD's senior leadership

