Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Madam Speaker, sa totoo lang po, since 2025, meron na pong mga proyekto using escrow funds.

asr-006064
06:35:42.920 --> 06:35:48.240
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: But yung disbursement po, progressive based on the construction.

asr-006065
06:35:48.840 --> 06:35:53.700
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: And of the progress or completion of a certain project, Madam Speaker.

asr-006066
06:35:54.880 --> 06:35:57.040
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Madam Speaker, maaari bang magbigay ang disbursement?

asr-006067
06:35:57.160 --> 06:36:02.360
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ang DSUD ng detalyadong report ukol sa mga projects na napondohan ng escrow fund?

asr-006068
06:36:02.480 --> 06:36:04.380
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Yes, Madam Speaker, we will submit po.

asr-006069
06:36:04.840 --> 06:36:11.920
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ito po bang 12.9 billion? Meron na kayong plano? 100% para sa paggamit nito?

asr-006070
06:36:12.280 --> 06:36:15.680
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Yes, Madam Speaker, 80% already allocated.

asr-006071
06:36:16.420 --> 06:36:16.940
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: 80%?

asr-006072
06:36:17.020 --> 06:36:17.940
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Yes, Madam Speaker.

asr-006073
06:36:18.140 --> 06:36:20.340
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Para saan naman po ang 20% na natin?

asr-006074
06:36:20.340 --> 06:36:25.280
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Depende po yun sa area, especially yung mga priority po ng gobyerno.

asr-006075
06:36:25.800 --> 06:36:26.340
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Yun nga po, yung mga...

asr-006076
06:36:27.160 --> 06:36:30.580
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Nasa danger zone, nag-aantay tayo ng lupa.

asr-006077
06:36:31.220 --> 06:36:32.320
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: So yun po, Madam Speaker.

asr-006078
06:36:34.660 --> 06:36:40.180
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ngayon naman, Madam Speaker, at abangan po natin ang ulat mula sa ating distinguished sponsor at mula sa DSUD.

asr-006079
06:36:40.180 --> 06:36:55.900
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Sa budget presentation, makikita na sa direct housing provision, nasa 382,000 units ang accomplishment noong Aquino administration, 281,905 noong last administration.

asr-006080
06:36:55.900 --> 06:37:01.320
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ngunit 81,295 pa lamang sa ilalim ng Marcos administration.

asr-006081
06:37:01.720 --> 06:37:11.840
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ibig sabihin, kung direct housing provision ang pag-uusapan, makikita natin ang malalaking pagbaba ng aktual na housing production ng pamahalaan sa kasalukuyan.

asr-006082
06:37:12.380 --> 06:37:14.780
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ano ba ang overall assessment dito ng DSUD?

asr-006083
06:37:14.780 --> 06:37:25.080
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Hindi ba nagkakaroon tayo ng cycle kung saan binabawasan ang kapasidad ng public housing agencies, bumababa ang direct housing production,

asr-006084
06:37:25.300 --> 06:37:25.780
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: at pagkatapos...

asr-006085
06:37:25.900 --> 06:37:32.660
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Mas napipilitan ang gobyerno na umasa sa private developers at market-based financing?

asr-006086
06:37:33.480 --> 06:37:38.060
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Madam Speaker, noong panahon po ni President Pinoy, 382.

asr-006087
06:37:38.400 --> 06:37:44.900
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Tama po, 81,721 noong kasama sa panahon ni PBBM.

asr-006088
06:37:45.720 --> 06:37:48.000
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Pero wala pa po yun yung 4-page program.

asr-006089
06:37:48.220 --> 06:37:52.400
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: And if I can remember it right, yung pondo ng 2010,

asr-006090
06:37:52.960 --> 06:37:54.640
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: nasa 15 to...

asr-006091
06:37:54.640 --> 06:37:55.640
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: 10 to...

asr-006092
06:37:55.900 --> 06:37:59.100
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: 15 billion po ang pondo per year ng DSUD.

asr-006093
06:37:59.640 --> 06:38:00.480
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Bumaba ng...

asr-006094
06:38:00.480 --> 06:38:03.060
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: I mean, bumaba lang po ngayon.

asr-006095
06:38:03.060 --> 06:38:17.660
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: So, but kung titignan niyo po sa accomplishments, more than 301,000 sa panahon ni PBBM for PBH and 99,489 po sa direct housing provisions.

asr-006096
06:38:18.280 --> 06:38:23.560
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: So, sa tingin ko po, tama naman, hindi naman pwedeng iasa lang natin yung pabahay sa gobyerno.

asr-006097
06:38:23.900 --> 06:38:25.540
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: We need also to capacitate.

asr-006098
06:38:25.540 --> 06:38:31.000
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: We need also to help.

asr-006099
06:38:31.280 --> 06:38:35.980
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Kung mga sila mismo yung mga taon, hindi pwedeng puro dolo out tayo.

asr-006100
06:38:36.340 --> 06:38:39.320
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Kaya nagkaroon ng different modalities tayo, Madam Speaker.

asr-006101
06:38:39.860 --> 06:38:48.860
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: So, ang concentration ngayon, pag-ibig funds take out, para po, developers, both private and public, Madam Speaker.

asr-006102
06:38:48.860 --> 06:38:54.860
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Again, ulitin ko po, yung pondo dati, nasa 10 billion, meron noong 2020.

asr-006103
06:38:55.540 --> 06:38:58.100
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: 2015, umabot ng 15 billion.

asr-006104
06:38:58.760 --> 06:39:03.400
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: And in 2022, dun po tayo nag-12, 10, bumaba talaga.

asr-006105
06:39:03.620 --> 06:39:11.780
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: But despite and in spite na bumaba ang pondo under this administration, mas marami naman po ang nabigyan ng pabahay.

asr-006106
06:39:12.140 --> 06:39:20.940
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Especially by 2028, it is expected na we will deliver 1,100,000 po indirect and indirect, Madam Speaker.

asr-006107
06:39:21.420 --> 06:39:23.940
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ngayon, Madam Speaker, tungkol dun sa...

asr-006108
06:39:25.540 --> 06:39:32.360
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Pagbaba ng direct housing production at yung pagbawas mismo ng capacity ng public housing agencies.

asr-006109
06:39:32.880 --> 06:39:37.760
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maganda po pag-usapan natin yung tungkol sa pondo ng National Housing Authority.

asr-006110
06:39:37.760 --> 06:39:45.000
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Yung original budget proposal ng NHA para sa 2027, nasa 44.7 billion pesos.

asr-006111
06:39:45.580 --> 06:39:53.260
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ngunit ang nasa General Appropriations Bill ngayon, kumigit-kumulang 2.27 billion na lamang.

asr-006112
06:39:53.880 --> 06:39:54.760
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Napakalaki ng discrepancy.

asr-006113
06:39:55.540 --> 06:40:03.580
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ano ba yung mga programa at housing projects na hindi matutustusan dahil sa pagkalaki-laki na reduction na ito?

asr-006114
06:40:04.220 --> 06:40:05.740
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ito yung sinasabi ko, Madam Speaker.

asr-006115
06:40:06.840 --> 06:40:13.640
