asr-006622
07:09:26.960 --> 07:09:28.220
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: with different modality,

asr-006623
07:09:28.840 --> 07:09:29.960
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: rent, CMP,

asr-006624
07:09:31.300 --> 07:09:34.520
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: 733,147,

asr-006625
07:09:34.660 --> 07:09:35.320
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Madam Speaker,

asr-006626
07:09:35.700 --> 07:09:36.200
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: units.

asr-006627
07:09:37.500 --> 07:09:37.820
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Now,

asr-006628
07:09:39.040 --> 07:09:39.340
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: ah,

asr-006629
07:09:46.340 --> 07:09:48.700
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: you mentioned earlier,

asr-006630
07:09:49.160 --> 07:09:50.020
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: yung, ah,

asr-006631
07:09:50.660 --> 07:09:51.960
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: kagaya, babalik ako yun,

asr-006632
07:09:52.040 --> 07:09:53.020
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: that the types,

asr-006633
07:09:53.040 --> 07:09:54.040
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: that the types of, ah,

asr-006634
07:09:54.040 --> 07:09:58.040
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: of housing units which are currently being constructed,

asr-006635
07:09:58.860 --> 07:10:00.780
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: tama naman yung sinabi mo dati,

asr-006636
07:10:00.780 --> 07:10:04.720
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: ang preference would be horizontal housing,

asr-006637
07:10:04.720 --> 07:10:06.540
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: yun yung mga preference dati.

asr-006638
07:10:06.960 --> 07:10:09.520
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: But if we look at, ah,

asr-006639
07:10:11.100 --> 07:10:17.340
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: if we look at the changing times and kung i-account natin

asr-006640
07:10:17.780 --> 07:10:21.740
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: that land is exhaustible, hindi naman, ah,

asr-006641
07:10:21.840 --> 07:10:22.460
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: na,

asr-006642
07:10:22.460 --> 07:10:27.620
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Nauubos ang lupa eh, pero ang tao patuloy na dumarami.

asr-006643
07:10:28.400 --> 07:10:38.900
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: If we go to more advanced countries, makikita mo they are no longer focusing on horizontal housing units.

asr-006644
07:10:39.140 --> 07:10:43.700
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Dahil alam nila na mauubos yung lupa, pero ang mga tao hindi eh.

asr-006645
07:10:44.540 --> 07:10:48.520
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Pero bakit babalik pa tayo sa ano?

asr-006646
07:10:48.520 --> 07:10:56.420
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Madam Speaker, there are areas po na, based tayo sa market driven, there are areas po na horizontal pa rin yung gusto nila.

asr-006647
07:10:57.320 --> 07:11:04.400
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Meron ding appropriate areas for horizontal, and meron appropriate areas for vertical, Madam Speaker.

asr-006648
07:11:04.400 --> 07:11:16.320
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Naalala ko dati sa Quezon City, nung unang, when I was still a city councilor, dahil maraming tao ang gusto ng horizontal,

asr-006649
07:11:17.420 --> 07:11:18.400
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: yun yung focus nila.

asr-006650
07:11:18.520 --> 07:11:21.400
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Na ginawa nung, ng Quezon City government.

asr-006651
07:11:21.940 --> 07:11:25.740
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: In fact, at the time, I was espousing for vertical construction.

asr-006652
07:11:26.380 --> 07:11:31.640
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Because the truth is, ang lupa, nauubos ang tao, hindi.

asr-006653
07:11:31.640 --> 07:11:37.400
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Ang lupa, tumataas yung presyo over time, ang tao dumarami.

asr-006654
07:11:38.100 --> 07:11:40.100
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: And merong law of supply and demand.

asr-006655
07:11:40.360 --> 07:11:47.780
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: While I understand na maraming tao sa probinsya, maaaring gusto yung horizontal,

asr-006656
07:11:48.520 --> 07:11:58.700
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: but, di ba, minsan, we have to prepare for the eventuality, eh, na mauubos yung mga lupa natin,

asr-006657
07:11:58.700 --> 07:12:04.700
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: at hindi natin mabibigyan ng sapat na pabahay ang mga nangangailangan ng bahay.

asr-006658
07:12:06.100 --> 07:12:06.980
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Yun yung, ah...

asr-006659
07:12:06.980 --> 07:12:11.960
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Madam Speaker, kaya po nag-fail yung una, kasi pinipilit nila yung vertical.

asr-006660
07:12:12.860 --> 07:12:16.280
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Kaya nagka-problema tayo in some areas, Madam Speaker.

asr-006661
07:12:17.080 --> 07:12:17.800
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Now,

asr-006662
07:12:18.520 --> 07:12:25.460
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: look at, ewan ko kung doon tayo nag-fail. Later on, babalik ako dyan.

asr-006663
07:12:26.680 --> 07:12:28.000
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: NHA performance.

asr-006664
07:12:28.540 --> 07:12:33.160
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Families actually provided housing. Target was 72.5%.

asr-006665
07:12:33.160 --> 07:12:36.480
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Actual na nabigyan, 53.5%.

asr-006666
07:12:36.480 --> 07:12:40.180
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: NHA missed the target by 19 percentage points.

asr-006667
07:12:40.920 --> 07:12:43.700
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Vacant and unawarded housing. This is very telling.

asr-006668
07:12:43.700 --> 07:12:53.720
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Ah, 25% dapat ang target.

asr-006669
07:12:55.100 --> 07:12:59.700
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Pero, 84% remains unawarded.

asr-006670
07:13:00.980 --> 07:13:04.700
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Merong problema sa housing ang mga Pilipino.

asr-006671
07:13:04.700 --> 07:13:13.700
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Pero, 84% ng ready housing units, hindi naman mabigyan ng housing.

asr-006672
07:13:13.700 --> 07:13:15.280
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Nang binipisaryo.

asr-006673
07:13:16.300 --> 07:13:18.700
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: In fact, babalik ako dyan sa, ano...

asr-006674
07:13:19.760 --> 07:13:20.700
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Ah...

asr-006675
07:13:21.880 --> 07:13:22.580
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: In Rizal.

asr-006676
07:13:23.260 --> 07:13:26.560
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: I remember during the 18th Congress,

asr-006677
07:13:27.680 --> 07:13:31.480
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: I went to look at the site sa Rizal.

asr-006678
07:13:32.780 --> 07:13:35.700
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Ano yun, eh. Horizontal housing units yung mga naka...

asr-006679
07:13:36.840 --> 07:13:38.580
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: mga tinayo sa Rizal, eh.

asr-006680
07:13:39.340 --> 07:13:41.080
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: In fact, ang inabutan ko doon,

asr-006681
07:13:41.820 --> 07:13:43.340
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: ewan ko kung ayalan total.

asr-006682
07:13:43.700 --> 07:13:46.700
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: I think the target was a total of 1,000 units.

asr-006683
07:13:46.960 --> 07:13:49.040
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Pero, pagpunta ko doon,

asr-006684
07:13:49.480 --> 07:13:51.360
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: ang dami ng mga housing units,

asr-006685
07:13:52.460 --> 07:13:54.220
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: which was still vacant.

asr-006686
07:13:54.860 --> 07:13:57.140
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: In fact, nasisira na yung mga ibang units.

asr-006687
07:13:57.720 --> 07:13:58.460
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Nasisira na.

asr-006688
07:13:58.860 --> 07:14:00.340
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Wala pa rin binipisaryo.

asr-006689
07:14:01.800 --> 07:14:04.080
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: And, it's not only in Rizal.

asr-006690
07:14:04.080 --> 07:14:09.080
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: It has happened in various other places.

asr-006691
07:14:11.320 --> 07:14:13.140
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Madam Speaker, sa totoo lang,

asr-006692
07:14:13.700 --> 07:14:15.240
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: siya talaga tanggapin ng taga-Rizal,

asr-006693
07:14:15.380 --> 07:14:16.120
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: nag-ibang bayan.

asr-006694
07:14:16.760 --> 07:14:18.440
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Pero, ngayon, sa 5,000 dati,

asr-006695
07:14:18.520 --> 07:14:19.900
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: 2,000 na lang nandun.

asr-006696
07:14:20.200 --> 07:14:21.060
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: That was not the reason.

asr-006697
07:14:21.680 --> 07:14:22.820
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Because, at the time,

asr-006698
07:14:23.820 --> 07:14:24.780
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: I was, ano, eh.

asr-006699
07:14:24.920 --> 07:14:27.320
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: I was with Mayor Junjun Inariz, eh.

asr-006700
07:14:27.860 --> 07:14:30.360
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: And, in fact, okay na sa kanya, eh.

asr-006701
07:14:30.380 --> 07:14:32.320
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Totoo, ang mga local government units,

asr-006702
07:14:32.420 --> 07:14:33.480
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: especially the mayors,

asr-006703
07:14:33.580 --> 07:14:34.480
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: nasasabihin nila,

asr-006704
07:14:35.380 --> 07:14:37.340
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: kasi madami rin mga

asr-006705
07:14:37.340 --> 07:14:40.660
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: nangangailangan ng pabahay

asr-006706
07:14:40.660 --> 07:14:41.620
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: sa aming lunsod.

asr-006707
07:14:42.220 --> 07:14:43.540
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: So, gusto namin ang binipisaryo,

asr-006708
07:14:43.700 --> 07:14:44.660
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: tiga sa amin.

asr-006709
07:14:45.100 --> 07:14:45.780
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: But, the thing is,

asr-006710
07:14:46.460 --> 07:14:47.600
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: they allow.

asr-006711
07:14:47.980 --> 07:14:48.700
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: In fact, kaya nga,

asr-006712
07:14:48.820 --> 07:14:50.380
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: meron tayong mga relocaties

asr-006713
07:14:50.380 --> 07:14:52.940
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: na napupunta sa Bulacan,

asr-006714
07:14:53.240 --> 07:14:54.380
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: meron sa Montalban.

asr-006715
07:14:55.820 --> 07:14:58.100
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: And, assuming, assuming na

asr-006716
07:14:58.100 --> 07:14:59.980
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: I would agree with the...

asr-006717
07:15:00.000 --> 07:15:09.500
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Madam Speaker, meron po ngayon provincial resolution that they will really not accept. In province lang, talaga accept na lang.

asr-006718
07:15:09.500 --> 07:15:18.860
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Kagaya ang sinabi mo, meron na ngayon. I'm talking about nung wala pa yung resolution na yun. And assuming na I would agree with what you said,

asr-006719
07:15:18.860 --> 07:15:31.040
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: e di sana binigay na lang natin yung mga pabahay dun sa mga tigarizal, imbis na nasira yung mga housing units na iwan na unoccupied.

asr-006720
07:15:31.120 --> 07:15:34.360
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Madam Speaker, yun na po yung nangyari ngayon. Binigay na lang sa tigarizal.

asr-006721
07:15:43.620 --> 07:15:47.420
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: The reason why I'm asking these questions.

asr-006722
07:15:48.860 --> 07:15:52.100
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Because we have to face actual facts. We should not sugarcoat it.

asr-006723
07:15:52.100 --> 07:15:57.640
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Kasi kung, if we do not recognize a problem, then we will not be able to come up with a solution.

asr-006724
07:15:58.360 --> 07:16:06.140
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Masasayang ang pera na, masasayang yung pabahay, yung oras na ginugol para gawin yung pabahay na yan.

asr-006725
07:16:06.660 --> 07:16:10.520
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Tapos hindi natin nababawasan yung mga taong nangangailangan ng tirahan.

asr-006726
07:16:11.260 --> 07:16:17.520
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Diba? That's my point, Madam Chair, our good sponsor.

asr-006727
07:16:17.520 --> 07:16:29.720
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Because if we do not provide a fallback to this, alam ko meron tayong mga guidelines na gustong gawin.

asr-006728
07:16:29.820 --> 07:16:38.760
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: But as I mentioned, for practicality purposes, based on what is actually happening, if we just look at it really,

asr-006729
07:16:39.680 --> 07:16:44.500
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: then makikita natin napakadaming pabahay na sasayang.

asr-006730
07:16:44.500 --> 07:16:47.500
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: In fact, naalala ko, during the time of former president,

asr-006731
07:16:47.520 --> 07:16:55.460
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: President Duterte, nakalimutan ko ano yung mga nag-occupy dun sa mga pabahay na hindi pa nabibigyan ng beneficiary.

asr-006732
07:16:56.100 --> 07:16:57.560
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: That also became the problem.

asr-006733
07:16:59.740 --> 07:17:04.320
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Sino ba yun? Yung group that occupied yung mga housing units?

asr-006734
07:17:05.220 --> 07:17:07.440
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Maybe NHA would know, or they should.

asr-006735
07:17:08.700 --> 07:17:10.000
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: That was an issue before.

asr-006736
07:17:11.120 --> 07:17:12.520
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Kadamay, Madam Speaker.

asr-006737
07:17:12.520 --> 07:17:16.200
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Kadamay, diba? Dahil anong sinabi nila, anong binigay nilang reason?

asr-006738
07:17:16.200 --> 07:17:16.920
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Sabi nila.

asr-006739
07:17:17.520 --> 07:17:21.860
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Kaya naman yung mga unit, ang tagal-tagal nang nakatiwangwang, ang tagal-tagal nang walang occupant,

asr-006740
07:17:22.360 --> 07:17:29.360
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: eh, tutal, ayaw nyo naman ibigay sa beneficaryo, eh, o-occupy na namin.

asr-006741
07:17:29.520 --> 07:17:35.800
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Kaya, that was a problem before, and that remained a problem up to now.

asr-006742
07:17:36.920 --> 07:17:38.580
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: So, ano yung ginawa natin?

asr-006743
07:17:39.900 --> 07:17:41.520
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: What steps have we taken?

asr-006744
07:17:41.520 --> 07:17:46.520
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: So that, as we construct units, we are able to...

asr-006745
07:17:47.520 --> 07:17:53.580
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: put a family in this unit, para-housing units, para naman nagagamit na nila.

asr-006746
07:17:57.480 --> 07:17:59.200
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Madam Speaker, yun nga po.

asr-006747
07:17:59.700 --> 07:18:09.720
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Sa ngayon, from 5,000 units, 2,000 na lang un-unoccupied, at saka sa in-city na lang, in-province na lang yung beneficiary po ng NHA.

asr-006748
07:18:09.720 --> 07:18:16.720
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Now, the things that kailangan natin maayos.

asr-006749
07:18:17.520 --> 07:18:24.180
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: As I mentioned, yung utilization, not only of the funds given to the SHUD,

asr-006750
07:18:24.600 --> 07:18:28.940
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: but yung utilization ng actual housing units na readily available.

asr-006751
07:18:29.740 --> 07:18:33.180
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Pangalawa, there is also a problem with collection efficiency.

asr-006752
07:18:34.260 --> 07:18:38.400
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Target was 50% collection, but actual target was 27%.

asr-006753
07:18:38.400 --> 07:18:41.280
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: This directly affects financial sustainability.

asr-006754
07:18:42.280 --> 07:18:47.400
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: If NHA cannot collect efficiently revolving housing resources, will deteriorate.

asr-006755
07:18:47.520 --> 07:18:49.520
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Mas konti ang makaka-avail.

asr-006756
07:18:49.980 --> 07:18:54.460
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: What improvements have we taken to improve collection efficiency?

asr-006757
07:18:56.900 --> 07:19:00.520
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Madam Speaker, kasi una, may mga moratorium pag may bagyo.

asr-006758
07:19:00.980 --> 07:19:05.140
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Especially ngayon na may problema tayo sa pagtaas ng crudo.

asr-006759
07:19:07.500 --> 07:19:09.520
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Kaya po yun yung problema, Madam Speaker.

asr-006760
07:19:09.840 --> 07:19:11.340
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Madam Speaker, good sponsor.

asr-006761
07:19:11.720 --> 07:19:13.780
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Yung collection efficiency, yung tinatanong ko.

asr-006762
07:19:13.780 --> 07:19:17.280
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: What steps?

asr-006763
07:19:17.520 --> 07:19:21.200
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: What steps has the agency taken to improve collection efficiency?

asr-006764
07:19:26.900 --> 07:19:31.100
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Madam Speaker, meron na po ngayon silang online payment.

asr-006765
07:19:32.420 --> 07:19:33.660
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: So, they improvised na po.

asr-006766
07:19:33.780 --> 07:19:36.120
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Yung online, dati kasi you have to sisigilin mo.

asr-006767
07:19:36.240 --> 07:19:37.900
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Ngayon may digitalization na sila.

asr-006768
07:19:38.620 --> 07:19:39.440
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Madam Speaker.

asr-006769
07:19:39.820 --> 07:19:42.340
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Madam Speaker, good sponsor.

asr-006770
07:19:42.340 --> 07:19:42.440
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Madam Speaker.

asr-006771
07:19:45.640 --> 07:19:47.340
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Well, it's a well...

asr-006772
07:19:47.520 --> 07:19:51.440
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: It's a welcome innovation that we agree with online payments.

asr-006773
07:19:51.600 --> 07:19:58.440
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: But as we all know, the problem is not kung magbabayad ka ng physically o magbabayad ka ng online.

asr-006774
07:19:58.560 --> 07:20:01.800
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: The problem really, it's really a collection problem.

asr-006775
07:20:02.020 --> 07:20:10.980
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Dahil meron talagang mga binipisaryo, ang kailangan mong pupuntahan para makulektahan mo ng pambayad eh.

asr-006776
07:20:11.160 --> 07:20:13.580
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: They will not do it voluntarily.

asr-006777
07:20:17.520 --> 07:20:21.740
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Diba, sa atin na lang eh, hindi na bahay ah, sa cellphone.

asr-006778
07:20:22.340 --> 07:20:26.140
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Diba, dati pwede ka mag-accumulate ng utang sa cellphone bill mo.

asr-006779
07:20:26.260 --> 07:20:31.940
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Kita mo ngayon, ang ginagawa ng mga provider.

asr-006780
07:20:32.460 --> 07:20:35.300
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Puputulin yung linya mo para mapilitang kang magbayad.

asr-006781
07:20:38.560 --> 07:20:41.060
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: So, NHA, ano bang kailangan nyo gawin?

asr-006782
07:20:41.060 --> 07:20:46.900
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Kasi hindi daw kayo na baka nag-i-evi, kaya hindi nagbabayad din yung mga owners.

asr-006783
07:20:47.520 --> 07:20:53.160
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: But, you know, kailangan siguro ano, i-improve na lang yung collections.

asr-006784
07:20:53.560 --> 07:20:54.940
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Yeah, that's why, good sponsor.

asr-006785
07:20:54.940 --> 07:20:59.700
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: And we'll need to make sure that intensify na lang ni NHA yung collections nila.

asr-006786
07:20:59.880 --> 07:21:09.440
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Actually, yun yung point ko, good sponsor, is what steps has the agency taken to improve yung collection efficiency

asr-006787
07:21:09.440 --> 07:21:15.260
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: given its past experience of poor collection efficiency.

asr-006788
07:21:15.260 --> 07:21:17.500
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Dahil talagang mahirap maningil eh.

asr-006789
07:21:17.520 --> 07:21:18.600
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Ano yung point ko?

asr-006790
07:21:24.200 --> 07:21:24.880
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: No.

asr-006791
07:21:34.420 --> 07:21:37.580
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Yung sagot.

asr-006792
07:21:38.280 --> 07:21:41.800
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Madam Speaker, sa totoo lang, natatawa na lang kami.

asr-006793
07:21:41.800 --> 07:21:45.060
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Hindi naman natin pwede kayo napalis yung mga tao na hindi nagbabayad.

asr-006794
07:21:45.600 --> 07:21:47.020
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: But, we can assure you,

asr-006795
07:21:47.520 --> 07:22:01.840
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Sa pag-ibig, pinabales. 97%. Dito sa NHC, hindi. But anyway, the department, the agency will try their best through third-party collection agent na lang po.

asr-006796
07:22:01.840 --> 07:22:18.740
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: As I mentioned, good speaker, good sponsor. I know we all know for a fact that collecting, especially kung hihintayin natin yung voluntary payment, it will really truly become difficult.

asr-006797
07:22:19.660 --> 07:22:31.820
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: But through the years, alam na natin that there's a collection problem. But we cannot leave it as is na hindi kami gagawa ng bagong proseso to improve yung collection.

asr-006798
07:22:31.840 --> 07:22:56.180
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: As I mentioned, the department uses the money as part of yung revolving fund so that it could be reused for other beneficiaries. Pero kung hindi talaga, kung wala talaga tayong gagawin, then we will not be able to serve a broader number of people.

asr-006799
07:23:01.840 --> 07:23:10.140
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Madam Speaker, I will move ahead.

asr-006800
07:23:11.440 --> 07:23:25.520
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Madam Speaker, they will try their best na lang to improve the manner of collection through third-party. Meron naman sila third-party collectors. Problema, hindi talaga takot ang mga tao.

asr-006801
07:23:25.520 --> 07:23:31.620
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: But again, we will call the attention of the NHA.

asr-006802
07:23:31.840 --> 07:23:32.660
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Madam Speaker.

asr-006803
07:23:34.020 --> 07:23:34.260
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Okay.

asr-006804
07:23:37.420 --> 07:23:58.180
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Ang dami ng measure, Madam Speaker, may expanded convenient payment, may paymaya, may land bank, may link bank, engaged private collection service providers, take-out mechanism of receivables with pag-iwig, implement cancellation, reward of accounts, strength and on-site collection, timely billing, distribution of demand letters, strength and regular monitoring analysis.

asr-006805
07:23:58.180 --> 07:24:00.520
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: There are the things na ginawa po ng NHA.

asr-006806
07:24:00.520 --> 07:24:00.640
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Okay.

asr-006807
07:24:01.840 --> 07:24:03.060
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: In spite, ganoon pa rin.

asr-006808
07:24:03.520 --> 07:24:10.280
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: With the indulgence of our distinguished sponsor and our distinguished colleague, we have one more minute. So please wrap up.

asr-006809
07:24:10.280 --> 07:24:28.020
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Well, with regards to housing construction, the target was 2,338. Actual accomplished was 949. That's roughly 40.6% of the target.

asr-006810
07:24:28.020 --> 07:24:30.400
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Yung mga natapos.

asr-006811
07:24:31.840 --> 07:24:38.060
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: So, what steps are we taking to improve itong ano?

asr-006812
07:24:38.120 --> 07:24:38.600
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Madam Speaker, saan po yung area na yun?

asr-006813
07:24:38.600 --> 07:24:42.220
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: So that we could reach yung construction target na kailangan.

asr-006814
07:24:42.620 --> 07:24:46.920
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Madam Speaker, yung construction target, saan po yan? Madam Speaker.

asr-006815
07:24:51.100 --> 07:24:55.840
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: I got it from yung performance data ng NHA at saka yung sinupply ng...

asr-006816
07:24:56.420 --> 07:25:00.900
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Madam Speaker, para matapos po pondo, kailangan ng NHA. Madam Speaker.

asr-006817
07:25:01.840 --> 07:25:05.760
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Para matapos, kailangan ng pondo.

asr-006818
07:25:05.820 --> 07:25:06.160
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Pondo.

asr-006819
07:25:08.080 --> 07:25:10.820
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: No, eh, di ba, private ka yung gumagawa.

asr-006820
07:25:10.820 --> 07:25:26.260
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: For example, for the balance housing, during the briefing of COA, COA required this should to reassess developer obligations way back, hanggang 2018 nga, pinareassess.

asr-006821
07:25:26.340 --> 07:25:30.980
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: According to the DOJ findings summarized in the briefing, the formula.

asr-006822
07:25:30.980 --> 07:25:31.380
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Okay.

asr-006823
07:25:31.380 --> 07:25:38.140
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Effectively reduce the required contribution to 25% of the statutory amount and permitted 15%.

asr-006824
07:25:38.140 --> 07:25:42.900
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: So, tanong ko nga, how much should have been collected by this should?

asr-006825
07:25:44.480 --> 07:25:45.460
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: By NHA or this should?

asr-006826
07:25:45.460 --> 07:25:47.800
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: And how much remains uncollected?

asr-006827
07:25:49.120 --> 07:25:51.740
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Madam Speaker, for this should po, balance housing.

asr-006828
07:25:55.120 --> 07:25:58.120
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: With the indulgence of our distinguished colleague, will that be the last question?

asr-006829
07:25:58.120 --> 07:25:59.240
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Around 60 billion, Madam Speaker.

asr-006830
07:26:01.380 --> 07:26:09.280
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Around 60 billion remains uncollected.

asr-006831
07:26:16.120 --> 07:26:21.880
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: So, what are we going to do? There's around 60 billion uncollected.

asr-006832
07:26:23.440 --> 07:26:24.720
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: So, paano natin ko connect ahin?

asr-006833
07:26:24.720 --> 07:26:26.260
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Madam Speaker, mayroong moratorium until February.

asr-006834
07:26:26.260 --> 07:26:31.220
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: So, after February, if we will not extend the moratorium, we will collect.

asr-006835
07:26:31.220 --> 07:26:31.240
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: So, paano natin ko connect ahin?

asr-006836
07:26:31.240 --> 07:26:33.920
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: We will collect, Madam Speaker.

asr-006837
07:26:35.240 --> 07:26:44.400
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: So, pero until February, nakukulektahan. Pero meron na ba? How much has already been collected?

asr-006838
07:26:45.920 --> 07:26:49.660
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Around 15, po, Madam Speaker.

asr-006839
07:26:51.440 --> 07:26:57.800
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Around 15 billion, yun ba? Or 15%? Which is which?

asr-006840
07:26:58.980 --> 07:27:00.920
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: 15 billion, Madam Speaker.

asr-006841
07:27:00.920 --> 07:27:01.180
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: 15?

asr-006842
07:27:01.180 --> 07:27:04.180
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: 15 billion was collected and there's a balance of 60 billion.

asr-006843
07:27:04.400 --> 07:27:04.880
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Of 45.

asr-006844
07:27:05.200 --> 07:27:05.780
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Of 45.

asr-006845
07:27:05.780 --> 07:27:06.420
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: 45 yung balance.

asr-006846
07:27:06.500 --> 07:27:08.380
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: And we only have until February.

asr-006847
07:27:11.220 --> 07:27:14.760
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Madam Speaker, that's moratorium. After February, makulekta na po yung 45 billion.

asr-006848
07:27:16.480 --> 07:27:20.860
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: Distinguished sponsor, can you provide in writing the details also?

asr-006849
07:27:20.860 --> 07:27:28.960
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Yes, ganun na lang, Madam Speaker. Can I be provided with the actual data collection efficiency?

asr-006850
07:27:29.660 --> 07:27:30.860
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: And with regards to...

asr-006851
07:27:31.180 --> 07:27:34.400
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Gusto yung dito sa ating...

asr-006852
07:27:34.400 --> 07:27:43.380
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: So, the distinguished sponsor is hereby directed to provide answers to the queries of the Honorable Suntay in writing.

asr-006853
07:27:44.540 --> 07:27:46.320
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Yes, Madam Speaker. We will do.

asr-006854
07:27:46.320 --> 07:27:54.220
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: And lastly, Madam Speaker, can I also have a breakdown?

asr-006855
07:27:54.920 --> 07:28:00.840
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: NHA, madaming lupa, madaming property ang NHA. In fact, dun lang sa Quezon City.

asr-006856
07:28:00.840 --> 07:28:09.560
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: There are a lot of NHA-owned properties. Most of them nga, madami ng informal settlers ang nag-o-occupy.

asr-006857
07:28:09.560 --> 07:28:10.460
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Madam Speaker, we will provide...

asr-006858
07:28:10.460 --> 07:28:16.040
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Which could be used for talagang socialized housing. Decent affordable housing for them.

asr-006859
07:28:16.360 --> 07:28:17.820
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: So, Madam Speaker...

asr-006860
07:28:17.820 --> 07:28:19.320
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: Do we get that commitment, Madam Sponsor?

asr-006861
07:28:19.320 --> 07:28:20.280
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Yes, Madam Speaker.

asr-006862
07:28:20.980 --> 07:28:23.960
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: You have the commitment, Honorable Suntay.

asr-006863
07:28:24.700 --> 07:28:26.380
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Thank you very much, Madam Speaker.

asr-006864
07:28:26.640 --> 07:28:28.120
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: Thank you very much. Majority Leader?

asr-006865
07:28:29.960 --> 07:28:30.760
Rep. Katrina Reiko Chua-Tai: Madam Speaker.

asr-006866
07:28:30.840 --> 07:28:38.900
Rep. Katrina Reiko Chua-Tai: Madam Speaker, next to interpellate the sponsor, I move to recognize Representative Edgar R. Erice from the 2nd District of Caloocan City.

asr-006867
07:28:40.220 --> 07:28:41.220
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: Si Tino.

asr-006868
07:28:50.420 --> 07:28:54.180
Rep. Katrina Reiko Chua-Tai: Madam Speaker, I move to withdraw my earlier motion.

asr-006869
07:28:54.180 --> 07:29:00.180
Rep. Katrina Reiko Chua-Tai: Madam Speaker, next to interpellate the sponsor, I move to recognize Representative Dadah Kiram Ismula from

asr-006870
07:29:00.840 --> 07:29:01.960
Rep. Katrina Reiko Chua-Tai: Akbayan Party-list.

asr-006871
07:29:02.220 --> 07:29:07.080
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: The Honorable Dadah Kiram Ismula of Akbayan Party-list is hereby recognized for her interpellation.

asr-006872
07:29:07.600 --> 07:29:08.300
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: Please proceed.

asr-006873
07:29:12.300 --> 07:29:15.560
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Assalamualaikum warahmatullahi wabarakatuhu.

asr-006874
07:29:16.640 --> 07:29:23.280
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Madam Speaker, Distinguished Sponsor, I just have a few questions for the D-SUDE family.

asr-006875
07:29:24.180 --> 07:29:30.380
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Unang katanungan ko po, mayroon po bang nakalaang pondo ang D-SUDE?

asr-006876
07:29:30.840 --> 07:29:40.420
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Sa pagsasagawa ng land survey sa mga lupang sakop ng presidential proclamation na nakalaan para sa pabahay?

asr-006877
07:29:40.420 --> 07:29:44.820
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Madam Speaker, wala po. Kaya humihingi po ngayon sa 2027 budget, Madam Speaker.

asr-006878
07:29:46.640 --> 07:29:56.320
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Actually, Madam Speaker, dahil sinabi po niyang wala pong pondo para doon, hindi ko na po itatanong yung pangalawa, pangatlo at pangapat kong katanungan.

asr-006879
07:29:56.720 --> 07:29:58.600
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Dahil nag-know na po siya.

asr-006880
07:29:59.060 --> 07:29:59.960
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: At dahil po diyan...

asr-006881
07:30:00.000 --> 07:30:06.340
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: I want to commend the good sponsor for yielding to the questions of my colleagues in the minority

asr-006882
07:30:06.340 --> 07:30:12.320
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: and I wish my colleagues in the Congress will guarantee a budget for the desude

asr-006883
07:30:12.320 --> 07:30:16.180
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: that is responsive to the needs of the Filipino people.

asr-006884
07:30:16.820 --> 07:30:23.520
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Lalong-lalo na yung budget para po sa presidential proclamation na hindi pala nalalagyan ng budget.

asr-006885
07:30:23.520 --> 07:30:31.920
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: And ang ahensya na nagtutugon sana ng pangangailangan ng ating mga mamamayan para sa pabahay,

asr-006886
07:30:32.380 --> 07:30:36.940
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: para sa mga nagkaroon ng sakuna, nagkaroon ng sunog,

asr-006887
07:30:37.320 --> 07:30:44.180
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: ay sana po malagyan po natin ng prioridad, malagyan po natin ng sapat na pondo

asr-006888
07:30:44.180 --> 07:30:49.300
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: para po matugunan ang pangangailangan ng ating mga mamamayan.

asr-006889
07:30:49.300 --> 07:30:53.460
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Since there are no other members of the minority,

asr-006890
07:30:54.460 --> 07:30:55.800
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: meron pa? Okay.

asr-006891
07:30:56.520 --> 07:31:01.620
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Wini-withdraw ko po ang sinabi ko po kanina, Madam Speaker, Madam Sponsor.

asr-006892
07:31:02.120 --> 07:31:05.000
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: At dahil po dyan, wala na po akong magiging katanungan,

asr-006893
07:31:05.900 --> 07:31:09.940
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: ipapasa ko na po kay ginaong Kongresista.

asr-006894
07:31:09.940 --> 07:31:11.340
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Maraming salamat ng ating...

asr-006895
07:31:11.340 --> 07:31:12.960
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: Thank you so much.

asr-006896
07:31:13.400 --> 07:31:16.320
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: Thank you very much, ang ating kinatawan sa Akbayan Party List.

asr-006897
07:31:16.400 --> 07:31:17.080
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: Majority Leader?

asr-006898
07:31:17.920 --> 07:31:20.780
Rep. Katrina Reiko Chua-Tai: Madam Speaker, next to interpolate the sponsor,

asr-006899
07:31:21.100 --> 07:31:23.080
Rep. Katrina Reiko Chua-Tai: I move to recognize Representative Edwin...

asr-006900
07:31:23.520 --> 07:31:26.760
Rep. Katrina Reiko Chua-Tai: Edgar R. Erice from the 2nd District of Caloocan City.

asr-006901
07:31:26.820 --> 07:31:33.460
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: My brilliant friend, the Honorable Edgar Erice of the 2nd District of Caloocan City is hereby recognized.

asr-006902
07:31:33.660 --> 07:31:34.860
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Thank you, Madam Speaker.

asr-006903
07:31:36.040 --> 07:31:37.060
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: I owe you a dinner.

asr-006904
07:31:40.720 --> 07:31:41.520
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Thank you.

asr-006905
07:31:44.220 --> 07:31:45.180
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Madam Chair,

asr-006906
07:31:46.440 --> 07:31:47.680
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Distinguished Sponsor,

asr-006907
07:31:48.460 --> 07:31:49.540
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Magandang hapon po.

asr-006908
07:31:50.500 --> 07:31:53.180
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Ang usapin ng pabahay ay hindi lamang tungkol sa...

asr-006909
07:31:53.520 --> 07:31:55.260
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: pabahay.

asr-006910
07:31:56.080 --> 07:32:01.380
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Sapagkat ang Department of Human Settlements and Urban Development

asr-006911
07:32:01.380 --> 07:32:12.000
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: ay may mahalagang gawain patungkol po sa urban development.

asr-006912
07:32:14.200 --> 07:32:16.380
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: It's also about...

asr-006913
07:32:17.240 --> 07:32:20.020
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: It's not only about housing units na naitayo.

asr-006914
07:32:20.180 --> 07:32:22.220
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: It's fundamentally about affordability,

asr-006915
07:32:23.100 --> 07:32:23.380
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: location,

asr-006916
07:32:23.520 --> 07:32:25.120
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: access to jobs,

asr-006917
07:32:25.280 --> 07:32:25.940
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: transportation,

asr-006918
07:32:26.860 --> 07:32:27.520
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: public safety,

asr-006919
07:32:28.480 --> 07:32:29.380
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: land use planning,

asr-006920
07:32:29.840 --> 07:32:31.720
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: and the long-term survival,

asr-006921
07:32:33.000 --> 07:32:36.440
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: especially of an urban center like Metro Manila,

asr-006922
07:32:37.620 --> 07:32:40.180
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: the country's principal economic center.

asr-006923
07:32:41.980 --> 07:32:47.400
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: The regional target of the Pabansang Bahay para sa Pilipino program, or 4PH,

asr-006924
07:32:47.500 --> 07:32:49.820
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: was 1 million housing units every year

asr-006925
07:32:49.820 --> 07:32:52.780
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: to address an estimated housing backlog

asr-006926
07:32:52.780 --> 07:32:53.080
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: of 1 million units.

asr-006927
07:32:53.080 --> 07:32:55.580
