07:51:17.940 --> 07:51:18.460
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Ano po yun?

asr-007300
07:51:22.560 --> 07:51:26.160
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Ito po, guidelines on how, on new town.

asr-007301
07:51:26.180 --> 07:51:38.960
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Ito po, guidelines and planned unit development, resilient urban design development guidelines, transit-oriented development, open space development guidelines, Madam Speaker.

asr-007302
07:51:39.040 --> 07:51:49.880
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Ano po yung response ng MMDA at ng mga LGUs at ano po yung degree ng pagsunod at implementasyon itong mga guidelines nito?

asr-007303
07:51:51.260 --> 07:51:54.880
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: This has been developed last year po. So, currently…

asr-007304
07:51:54.880 --> 07:51:57.980
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: At least, meron po kayong ano. Ano ba ang gawapan?

asr-007305
07:51:58.040 --> 07:52:05.300
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Para makatulong kami in terms of policy direction. Baka kung hindi sumusunod, di pasunod rin natin through legislation.

asr-007306
07:52:10.500 --> 07:52:18.600
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Madam Speaker, yung mga guidelines na binigay po ng Disud, it will be integrated po sa mga CLUP nila.

asr-007307
07:52:19.500 --> 07:52:21.040
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: And na-integrate po ba?

asr-007308
07:52:22.400 --> 07:52:24.840
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Ongoing naman po, Madam Speaker.

asr-007309
07:52:24.880 --> 07:52:27.880
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Pwede na lang po mabigyan kami ng development.

asr-007310
07:52:28.460 --> 07:52:29.760
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Yes, we can provide you po.

asr-007311
07:52:29.820 --> 07:52:38.760
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: At least po, kailangan may report tayo kung anong, how we are going to it through these guidelines, paano yung compliance ng mga local government.

asr-007312
07:52:39.700 --> 07:52:41.280
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Yes, we will provide you, Madam Speaker.

asr-007313
07:52:41.280 --> 07:52:49.540
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Especially, kasi we cannot just, ano yun, yung MMDA po, it's toothless. They have so much responsibility but they have no authority.

asr-007314
07:52:49.540 --> 07:52:54.040
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: They have no mandate from the people.

asr-007315
07:52:54.040 --> 07:52:59.860
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Unlike yung 17 independent local governments.

asr-007316
07:53:00.740 --> 07:53:08.320
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Anyway, may napansin din po ako, yung deteriorating NHA estates and vertical housing.

asr-007317
07:53:09.780 --> 07:53:22.800
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Kung wala po bang maintenance program ang NHA pagdating po sa, nag-deteriorate na po yung mga housing projects natin.

asr-007318
07:53:22.800 --> 07:53:23.820
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Especially, it's toothless.

asr-007319
07:53:23.820 --> 07:53:35.560
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Actually, in Metro Manila, lumiliit yung mga eskinita, pati po mga sidewalk, malalagyan na rin ng mga extension.

asr-007320
07:53:37.120 --> 07:53:47.180
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Yung ating, although nagpapasalamat tayo sa DSUD, dahil magkaroon tayo ng pilot project sa aking distrito para po dun sa mga spaghetti wires.

asr-007321
07:53:47.180 --> 07:53:52.240
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Pero meron po ba tayong pangkahalatang plano?

asr-007322
07:53:52.940 --> 07:53:53.660
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Para sa mga...

asr-007323
07:53:53.820 --> 07:53:58.040
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: NHA housing projects para po ma-maintain naman.

asr-007324
07:53:58.680 --> 07:54:05.720
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Kasi po, nagiging nangyayari, yung NHA project, nagiging depressed area na po.

asr-007325
07:54:07.180 --> 07:54:10.320
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Parang from slums to slums.

asr-007326
07:54:10.320 --> 07:54:22.320
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Ganun lang nangyayari kung hindi natin ma-maintain, ma-improve yung ating mga NHA housing projects at...

asr-007327
07:54:23.820 --> 07:54:32.340
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Yung kinakailangan ba ng dagdag na pondo ng NHA from the GAA para magampanan natin ito?

asr-007328
07:54:32.460 --> 07:54:41.900
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: O sapat na ba yung mga kasalukuyang collections ng NHA para ma-improve itong mga national housing projects na ito?

asr-007329
07:54:44.640 --> 07:54:46.900
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Madam Speaker, as for the...

asr-007330
07:54:47.840 --> 07:54:53.160
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Yung na-turnover na po, hindi na po under NHA.

asr-007331
07:54:53.160 --> 07:55:03.740
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: But for those na abandon, undeveloped, yung mga mid-rise po, gagawan po ng paraan,

asr-007332
07:55:04.180 --> 07:55:06.340
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: hindi redevelop po ni NHA, Madam Speaker.

asr-007333
07:55:07.860 --> 07:55:09.220
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Hindi, ano po yung gagawa ng paraan?

asr-007334
07:55:09.320 --> 07:55:17.700
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Meron pa pong policy na, policy direction para ma-maintain itong mga medium rise.

asr-007335
07:55:18.520 --> 07:55:19.160
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Madam Speaker...

asr-007336
07:55:19.160 --> 07:55:20.420
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Meron po bang ano to?

asr-007337
07:55:20.640 --> 07:55:23.020
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: For example, may annual budget pa.

asr-007338
07:55:23.160 --> 07:55:25.600
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: For maintenance ng mga medium rise.

asr-007339
07:55:27.200 --> 07:55:32.980
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Madam Speaker, for those turned over na po ng mga units, wala na po si LGU.

asr-007340
07:55:33.060 --> 07:55:35.560
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: It's with the whole one or LGU po, Madam Speaker.

asr-007341
07:55:36.860 --> 07:55:41.540
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: But for those condemned, yun po ang gagawa ng paraan ni NHA.

asr-007342
07:55:41.540 --> 07:55:48.940
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Kung na-turnover na po sa local government, yung mga projects na hindi naman po medium rise,

asr-007343
07:55:48.940 --> 07:55:50.940
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: yung regular...

asr-007344
07:55:53.160 --> 07:56:00.800
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: ng mga one-story, two-story houses, at na-turnover na po yung buong project,

asr-007345
07:56:02.100 --> 07:56:06.000
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: meron po bang memorandum of agreement with the local government?

asr-007346
07:56:06.000 --> 07:56:10.780
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: At naka-define po ba doon yung mga responsibilities ng local government?

asr-007347
07:56:12.240 --> 07:56:15.580
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Madam Speaker, as for the local government, may deed of the nation na po.

asr-007348
07:56:15.700 --> 07:56:18.720
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: So once the turnover, it's for the local government po.

asr-007349
07:56:19.880 --> 07:56:21.000
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Should make sure to maintain...

asr-007350
07:56:21.000 --> 07:56:21.180
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Pero maliwa...

asr-007351
07:56:21.180 --> 07:56:22.200
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Sa deed of the...

asr-007352
07:56:22.200 --> 07:56:23.000
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Sa...

asr-007353
07:56:23.160 --> 07:56:29.640
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Turnover po, deed of turnover, meron po bang specific na mga provisions doon na may...

asr-007354
07:56:29.640 --> 07:56:31.140
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Absolute po yan, Mr. Speaker, Madam Speaker.

asr-007355
07:56:31.140 --> 07:56:33.780
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Kung ano yung responsibilidad na ng local government?

asr-007356
07:56:34.280 --> 07:56:36.460
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Wala na po. It's absolute po yan, Madam Speaker.

asr-007357
07:56:37.060 --> 07:56:37.600
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Wala na po.

asr-007358
07:56:37.660 --> 07:56:38.380
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Yes, po.

asr-007359
07:56:38.980 --> 07:56:41.540
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: So it's no longer an NHA project?

asr-007360
07:56:42.680 --> 07:56:43.140
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Yes, po.

asr-007361
07:56:43.780 --> 07:56:44.380
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Salamat po.

asr-007362
07:56:46.060 --> 07:56:51.480
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Hindi po ba itong malaking weakness in terms of policy?

asr-007363
07:56:53.160 --> 07:57:02.300
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Papapabayaan natin yung pinaghirapan natin na tayo po ay gumastos ng malaki para dito.

asr-007364
07:57:02.720 --> 07:57:04.540
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Nag-abono ang national government.

asr-007365
07:57:05.180 --> 07:57:12.240
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Pagkatapos po pagdito turnover, papabayaan na lang natin na mag-deteriorate ito sa mga local government.

asr-007366
07:57:13.080 --> 07:57:16.980
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Kaya po, Madam Speaker, yung current na plan po, yun nga, so rental na lang.

asr-007367
07:57:17.100 --> 07:57:19.140
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Kasi yung iba kasi, binibenta din nila.

asr-007368
07:57:19.640 --> 07:57:20.260
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Yun ang problema.

asr-007369
07:57:20.260 --> 07:57:23.140
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Kaya they're more into rental housing.

asr-007370
07:57:23.160 --> 07:57:24.880
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Tingnan lang si NHA.

asr-007371
07:57:25.480 --> 07:57:33.940
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Don't you think that there must be a certain degree of responsibility sa local governments?

asr-007372
07:57:34.640 --> 07:57:46.600
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Sinisiguro ng NHA na dapat nilang gawin kapag na-earn over nila dahil ito po ay proyekto naman ng national government.

asr-007373
07:57:46.600 --> 07:57:53.140
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: At ang national government po ay nagbibigay naman ng allotment sa mga local government.

asr-007374
07:57:53.160 --> 07:57:57.320
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Pag-aralan po yan, Madam Speaker, ni NHA.

asr-007375
07:58:06.320 --> 07:58:16.540
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Sa policy po ng land use and zoning, ano po ba ang responsibilidad ng LISUD, especially for urban centers?

asr-007376
07:58:20.600 --> 07:58:23.140
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Madam Speaker, LISUD po.

asr-007377
07:58:23.160 --> 07:58:27.160
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Dito po ang nag-approve ng for highly-urbanized centers.

asr-007378
07:58:27.440 --> 07:58:35.360
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Dito po sa Metro Manila, how many NCRLGUs have current and approved comprehensive land use as of now?

asr-007379
07:58:38.980 --> 07:58:40.500
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: There, 16.

asr-007380
07:58:41.920 --> 07:58:45.600
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Except Manila and Taguig, na-approve na.

asr-007381
07:58:46.400 --> 07:58:47.040
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: So, 15.

asr-007382
07:58:48.080 --> 07:58:48.760
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: 16.

asr-007383
07:58:49.240 --> 07:58:51.660
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Except Manila and Taguig.

asr-007384
07:58:51.660 --> 07:58:53.140
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: 18 na yan, 17?

asr-007385
07:58:53.160 --> 07:58:54.160
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: 18 lang tayo eh.

asr-007386
07:58:54.160 --> 07:58:55.160
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Wala yung Pateros.

asr-007387
07:58:55.160 --> 07:58:57.160
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Sumobra kayo ng isa.

asr-007388
07:58:57.160 --> 07:58:58.160
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Pateros.

asr-007389
07:58:58.160 --> 07:59:00.160
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Ay, sinabi mo Pateros.

asr-007390
07:59:00.160 --> 07:59:02.160
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Without Pateros po.

asr-007391
07:59:02.160 --> 07:59:05.160
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: 15, municipality si Pateros.

asr-007392
07:59:05.160 --> 07:59:07.160
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Without Manila and?

asr-007393
07:59:07.160 --> 07:59:08.160
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Taguig.

asr-007394
07:59:08.160 --> 07:59:09.160
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Taguig.

asr-007395
07:59:10.160 --> 07:59:12.160
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Ay, anong Pateros? Meron.

asr-007396
07:59:15.160 --> 07:59:19.160
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Meron. Pero hindi municipality si Pateros kasi hindi siya…

asr-007397
07:59:19.160 --> 07:59:23.160
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Kung wala yung Taguig, wala yung Manila, ibig sabihin 15 lang.

asr-007398
07:59:23.160 --> 07:59:29.160
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Kasi Metro Manila is composed of 16 cities and 1 municipality. Tama.

asr-007399
07:59:29.160 --> 07:59:34.160
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: So, 15, may dalawa na wala pa.

asr-007400
07:59:34.160 --> 07:59:38.160
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Ano pong nagiging problema? Bakit wala pa?

asr-007401
07:59:40.160 --> 07:59:43.160
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: They are still updating their CLUP, Madam Speaker.

asr-007402
07:59:46.160 --> 07:59:47.160
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Pardon?

asr-007403
07:59:50.160 --> 07:59:51.160
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: They are still updating.

asr-007404
07:59:51.160 --> 07:59:54.160
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: May mga deadlines po ba yan?

asr-007405
07:59:57.160 --> 07:59:59.460
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Walang deadline but the earlier the better.

asr-007406
07:59:59.460 --> 08:00:05.300
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Madam Speaker, but they send them reminders naman. These hoods are giving them their reminders naman, Madam Speaker.

asr-007407
08:00:07.380 --> 08:00:15.080
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Ang ibig pong sabihin nun, kung wala pong zoning and land use,

asr-007408
08:00:15.920 --> 08:00:21.780
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: paano po nag-ooperate na kapag bibigay ng zoning clearances itong mga LDUs na ito?

asr-007409
08:00:25.360 --> 08:00:29.680
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Meron naman po silang previews but hindi lang updated, Madam Speaker.

asr-007410
08:00:30.000 --> 08:00:32.780
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Ah, so based on the previews.

asr-007411
08:00:32.780 --> 08:00:34.000
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Previews, CLUP.

asr-007412
08:00:34.200 --> 08:00:38.640
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: And the previews sa zoning ay approved din po?

asr-007413
08:00:39.380 --> 08:00:40.620
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Yes po, Madam Speaker.

asr-007414
08:00:40.840 --> 08:00:43.700
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: So lahat approved. Hindi lang na-update.

asr-007415
08:00:43.860 --> 08:00:44.160
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Na-update.

asr-007416
08:00:44.160 --> 08:00:45.780
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Tama po. Sige po.

asr-007417
08:00:52.620 --> 08:00:57.280
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Ano sa tingin nyo in terms of sa Metro Manila Development Authority?

asr-007418
08:00:57.280 --> 08:00:58.280
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: In terms of...

asr-007419
08:00:59.660 --> 08:00:59.980
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Ah...

asr-007420
08:00:59.980 --> 08:01:08.380
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Pagtulong para po sa programa ng housing, na ISF.

asr-007421
08:01:09.800 --> 08:01:12.260
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Don't you think that the MMDA is too weak?

asr-007422
08:01:17.160 --> 08:01:18.100
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Ah, we...

asr-007423
08:01:18.100 --> 08:01:21.160
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Ah, MD is not under po these hoods.

asr-007424
08:01:21.300 --> 08:01:27.160
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: So I think we cannot commit on that, comment on that, and commit for them also, Madam Speaker.

asr-007425
08:01:27.880 --> 08:01:28.980
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: But, again...

asr-007426
08:01:28.980 --> 08:01:29.960
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Because the Metro Manila is the only...

asr-007427
08:01:29.980 --> 08:01:38.980
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: ...coordinating body, it's under the office of the President, and of course, if you are in the...

asr-007428
08:01:40.100 --> 08:01:43.480
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Kung kayo po ay nagpa-plano ng urban development, or sa Metro...

asr-007429
08:01:43.480 --> 08:01:49.980
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Ah, wala pong relasyon ng DSUD at ang Metro Manila Development Authority in terms of urban planning sa Metro Manila?

asr-007430
08:01:50.900 --> 08:01:51.980
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Wala... Ano pong relasyon?

asr-007434
08:01:58.420 --> 08:01:59.220
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Madam

asr-007435
08:01:59.220 --> 08:02:00.200
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Speaker.

asr-007436
08:02:00.200 --> 08:02:04.280
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Sa Council nila, observer naman po si DSUD observer.

asr-007437
08:02:06.700 --> 08:02:13.900
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: With the indulgence of our distinguished colleague, may we respectfully request him to please wind up.

asr-007438
08:02:14.520 --> 08:02:29.960
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: But, of course, the Department of Human Settlements and Urban Development is requested to coordinate with the Office of the Honorable Erice for all the nitty-gritty rules and regulations that he can

asr-007439
08:02:29.980 --> 08:02:32.200
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: contribute, especially in terms of implementation.

asr-007444
08:02:32.550 --> 08:02:49.020
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Huli na lang po, Madam Speaker, ano po yung... Of course, meron po kayong proposal sa NEP at proposal sa DBCC, pero lumabas sa NEP, mas maliit po sa inyong proposal.

asr-007445
08:02:49.900 --> 08:02:56.900
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Ano po yung sa tingin nyo na pinakamahalaga na dapat na isama dito sa proposal na ito?

asr-007446
08:02:56.900 --> 08:02:59.960
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: The Department, Madam Speaker, has already submitted.

asr-007447
08:02:59.980 --> 08:03:07.220
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Especially po sa CMP po, sa planning, SHAP-C, yun po Madam Speaker.

asr-007448
08:03:08.660 --> 08:03:09.900
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Ano po yung pinakamahalaga?

asr-007449
08:03:10.540 --> 08:03:11.680
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Doon sa na-

asr-007450
08:03:11.680 --> 08:03:13.400
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: CMP po, siya SHAP-C po.

asr-007451
08:03:14.080 --> 08:03:17.140
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: SHAP-C, Committee Mortgage Program, ito po.

asr-007452
08:03:22.720 --> 08:03:24.280
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Ang dami eh, ng priority.

asr-007453
08:03:25.340 --> 08:03:28.340
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Okay, can you just give me the most important ones?

asr-007454
08:03:28.340 --> 08:03:30.680
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Yes po, resubmit the priorities.

asr-007455
08:03:31.120 --> 08:03:37.840
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Naniniwala po ko na kailangan natin pag-igihan yung urban development, especially in urban centers.

asr-007456
08:03:38.720 --> 08:03:40.380
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Kasi po huling-huli na yung Metro Manila.

asr-007457
08:03:41.080 --> 08:03:49.460
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: So, pwede po mabigyan niyo ako ng kopya at baka sakali na mapakiusapan natin na maisingit.

asr-007458
08:03:50.280 --> 08:03:54.580
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Pwede natin bawasan yung LGSF, dagdag natin sa D-SUD.

asr-007459
08:03:55.000 --> 08:03:55.580
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Salamat po.

asr-007460
08:03:55.980 --> 08:03:57.340
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Thank you so much Madam Speaker.

asr-007461
08:03:57.340 --> 08:03:57.900
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: Thank you.

asr-007462
08:03:57.900 --> 08:04:00.700
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: And maybe the Honorable Erice can also make the proper motion.

asr-007463
08:04:04.320 --> 08:04:15.420
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Madam Speaker, I move that we terminate the discussion on the Department of Human Settlement and Urban Development.

asr-007464
08:04:15.920 --> 08:04:16.740
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: Majority Leader.

asr-007465
08:04:17.300 --> 08:04:23.280
Rep. Katrina Reiko Chua-Tai: Madam Speaker, on the part of the majority, we join the minority in the motion to terminate the period of interpellation

asr-007466
08:04:23.280 --> 08:04:27.720
Rep. Katrina Reiko Chua-Tai: on the proposed budget of the Department of Human Settlements.

