Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: Esteemed colleagues in this August Chamber,

asr-007533
08:18:21.560 --> 08:18:24.480
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: I rise today to sponsor the proposed budget

asr-007534
08:18:24.480 --> 08:18:26.620
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: of the Department of Agrarian Reform

asr-007535
08:18:26.620 --> 08:18:29.080
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: for fiscal year 2027.

asr-007536
08:18:30.000 --> 08:18:36.180
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: A proposed allocation of 16,935,368,000

asr-007537
08:18:36.180 --> 08:18:39.300
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: that represents far more than fiscal allocation.

asr-007538
08:18:40.560 --> 08:18:42.560
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: It represents lives transformed,

asr-007539
08:18:43.320 --> 08:18:44.880
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: historical promises kept,

asr-007540
08:18:45.580 --> 08:18:48.040
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: and a national commitment to social justice

asr-007541
08:18:48.040 --> 08:18:51.780
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: that is now entering its decisive final phase.

asr-007542
08:18:52.880 --> 08:18:56.620
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: Agrarian Reform is not merely a government administrative program.

asr-007543
08:18:56.620 --> 08:18:59.980
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: At its heart, it is an instrument of restorative justice,

asr-007544
08:19:00.000 --> 08:19:02.080
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: and it is our collective duty to correct

asr-007545
08:19:02.080 --> 08:19:06.180
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: deep historical inequities,

asr-007546
08:19:06.180 --> 08:19:09.040
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: and empower the very hands that feed our nation,

asr-007547
08:19:09.040 --> 08:19:10.580
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: our farmers.

asr-007548
08:19:10.580 --> 08:19:13.180
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: When we secure land ownership,

asr-007549
08:19:13.180 --> 08:19:16.680
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: when we lift decades of suffocating debt,

asr-007550
08:19:16.680 --> 08:19:20.880
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: when we construct infrastructure to help our farmers,

asr-007551
08:19:20.880 --> 08:19:23.680
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: and when we deliver free legal protection,

asr-007552
08:19:23.680 --> 08:19:27.680
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: we are not simply funding economic activities,

asr-007553
08:19:27.680 --> 08:19:29.880
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: we are investing in human dignity,

asr-007554
08:19:29.880 --> 08:19:31.880
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: food security,

asr-007555
08:19:31.880 --> 08:19:36.880
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: and rural emancipation under President Ferdinand R. Marcos Jr.'s vision

asr-007556
08:19:36.880 --> 08:19:38.880
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: of a Bagong Pilipinas.

asr-007557
08:19:38.880 --> 08:19:42.880
