asr-007558
08:19:42.880 --> 08:19:45.880
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: Under the Marcos Jr. administration,

asr-007559
08:19:45.880 --> 08:19:50.880
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: from July 2022 through August 12, 2026,

asr-007560
08:19:50.880 --> 08:19:54.880
