Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: covering 556,088 hectares,

asr-007565
08:20:06.700 --> 08:20:11.560
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: and benefiting 376,738 agrarian reform beneficiaries.

asr-007566
08:20:11.560 --> 08:20:14.560
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: This reflects an extraordinary trajectory

asr-007567
08:20:14.560 --> 08:20:18.560
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: of operational acceleration.

asr-007568
08:20:18.560 --> 08:20:21.560
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: In fiscal year 2023,

asr-007569
08:20:21.560 --> 08:20:25.560
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: 69,897 titles were distributed,

asr-007570
08:20:25.560 --> 08:20:28.560
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: covering 84,044 hectares

asr-007571
08:20:28.560 --> 08:20:33.560
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: for 73,399 ARBs.

asr-007572
08:20:33.560 --> 08:20:35.560
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: In fiscal year 2024,

asr-007573
08:20:35.560 --> 08:20:40.560
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: 102,536 titles were distributed,

asr-007574
08:20:40.560 --> 08:20:44.560
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: covering 120,772 hectares

asr-007575
08:20:44.560 --> 08:20:50.560
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: for 88,310 ARBs.

asr-007576
08:20:50.560 --> 08:20:52.560
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: For fiscal year 2025,

asr-007577
08:20:52.560 --> 08:20:56.560
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: held a record of 199,838 titles distributed,

asr-007578
08:20:56.560 --> 08:21:01.560
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: covering 302,540 hectares

asr-007579
08:21:01.560 --> 08:21:05.560
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: for 176,202 ARBs.

asr-007580
08:21:05.560 --> 08:21:08.560
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: And from Jan 1 to August 12 of the current year,

asr-007581
08:21:08.560 --> 08:21:16.560
