asr-007583
08:21:16.560 --> 08:21:20.560
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: were distributed to 14,023 ARBs.

asr-007584
08:21:20.560 --> 08:21:26.560
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: Concurrently, under Republic Act No. 11953,

asr-007587
08:21:26.560 --> 08:21:29.560
