asr-007588
08:21:29.560 --> 08:21:31.560
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: DAR has reached historic milestones

asr-007589
08:21:31.560 --> 08:21:33.560
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: in freeing farmers

asr-007590
08:21:33.560 --> 08:21:36.560
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: from inherited financial burdens.

asr-007591
08:21:36.560 --> 08:21:39.560
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: As of August 12, 2026,

asr-007592
08:21:39.560 --> 08:21:42.560
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: DAR has distributed a cumulative total

asr-007593
08:21:42.560 --> 08:21:46.560
