asr-007595
08:21:49.560 --> 08:21:53.560
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: covering 901,246 hectares

asr-007597
08:21:53.560 --> 08:21:58.560
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: and emancipating 54.702 billion

asr-007598
08:21:58.560 --> 08:22:02.560
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: in unpaid principal, interest, and surcharges.

asr-007599
