asr-007665
08:23:54.560 --> 08:23:55.560
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: At this point,

asr-007666
08:23:55.560 --> 08:23:56.920
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: the Department of Agrarian

asr-007667
08:23:56.920 --> 08:23:57.420
