08:25:39.140 --> 08:25:43.260
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: So, ikilan ko na lang pa para makapag-birthday pa po kayo, sir.

asr-007709
08:25:44.400 --> 08:25:47.220
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: Yung isang tinong ko, Mr. Speaker,

asr-007710
08:25:47.220 --> 08:25:48.780
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: alam po natin lahat.

asr-007711
08:25:48.820 --> 08:25:51.000
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: At ito po ay tanong din ng maraming magkasaka.

asr-007712
08:25:51.720 --> 08:25:56.500
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: Ay nung August 11 dialogue ng maraming mga CSOs at ng DAR

asr-007713
08:25:56.500 --> 08:26:00.080
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: ay iba-iba po ang naging sagot ng mga opisyal ng DAR

asr-007714
08:26:00.080 --> 08:26:06.040
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: tungkol sa DOJ Opinion No. 16 Series of 2026.

asr-007715
08:26:06.180 --> 08:26:09.000
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: Dalawa po yung malaging pwedeng maging implikasyon niya.

asr-007716
08:26:09.400 --> 08:26:13.180
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: Una yung medyo klarong statement noon ng DOJ

asr-007717
08:26:13.180 --> 08:26:15.700
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: na wala nang Agrarian Reform, wala nang DAR.

asr-007718
08:26:15.700 --> 08:26:18.260
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: Para kaya ang tanong ko ay bakit pa tayo nandito ngayong gabi

asr-007719
08:26:18.260 --> 08:26:19.740
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: kung wala na po wala kayo.

asr-007720
08:26:20.300 --> 08:26:22.900
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: Yung pangalawa po implikasyon yan ay yun pong

asr-007721
08:26:22.900 --> 08:26:29.740
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: yung polisiya tungkol dun sa pagkoprotekta ng 5-hectare retention limit.

asr-007722
08:26:29.940 --> 08:26:33.180
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: So, at marami po ang pwedeng mag-implikasyon yan.

asr-007723
08:26:33.740 --> 08:26:39.660
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: Kasama po yan yung pagtatanong kung paano nga iseset yung remaining targets

asr-007724
08:26:39.660 --> 08:26:41.900
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: for distribution of land.

asr-007725
08:26:41.900 --> 08:26:46.640
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: Kasi hindi naman din natin sinasabi na wala na tayong natitirang lands for distribution.

asr-007726
08:26:46.880 --> 08:26:47.840
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: Siguro po ang tanong ko,

asr-007727
08:26:48.260 --> 08:26:52.420
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: una at pangkalahatan sa bahaging ito ay

asr-007728
08:26:52.420 --> 08:26:57.460
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: ano po yung klarong posisyon ng Department, Mr. Sponsor,

asr-007729
08:26:57.580 --> 08:27:00.920
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: doon sa DOJ Opinion No. 16?

asr-007730
08:27:01.380 --> 08:27:05.260
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: At ano po ang plano ng DAR para harapin po yung opinion na yan?

asr-007731
08:27:15.260 --> 08:27:17.500
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: Okay, ma'am. Maraming salamat po.

asr-007732
08:27:18.260 --> 08:27:23.260
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: So, your question was for the DOJ's...

asr-007733
08:27:24.060 --> 08:27:26.380
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: Ano pong posisyon ng DAR? Kasi tahimik po ang DAR.

asr-007734
08:27:26.500 --> 08:27:28.360
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: Iba-iba po ang opinion ng DAR tungkol dyan.

asr-007735
08:27:28.480 --> 08:27:32.260
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: DOJ Opinion po ito. Opinion ng Department of Justice.

asr-007736
08:27:32.560 --> 08:27:35.800
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: Ano pong tingin ng DAR opinion tungkol sa opinion na yan?

asr-007737
08:27:36.300 --> 08:27:37.260
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: Okay, this is not...

asr-007738
08:27:43.260 --> 08:27:47.260
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: Mahalaga lang po ang tanong dahil may kinalaman din po ito sa...

asr-007739
08:27:48.260 --> 08:27:50.840
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: Una, sa buhay mismo ng agrarian reform, no?

asr-007740
08:27:51.000 --> 08:27:54.520
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: Kung mahalaga pa bang pinag-uusapan natin ang Departamento,

asr-007741
08:27:54.680 --> 08:27:57.960
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: kung wala na po ba siya, talagang tinatapos na po ba ng DOJ

asr-007742
08:27:57.960 --> 08:28:00.900
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: ang buhay ng agrarian reform at ng DAR

asr-007743
08:28:00.900 --> 08:28:04.520
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: at ang kanyang mga gusto pang i-target na i-accomplish

asr-007744
08:28:04.520 --> 08:28:06.200
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: para sa agrarian reform program.

asr-007745
08:28:07.200 --> 08:28:07.780
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: Okay, ma'am.

asr-007746
08:28:08.480 --> 08:28:12.260
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: So, for that, ano po, the salient features of that...

asr-007747
08:28:12.260 --> 08:28:17.440
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: of this removal was the economic recovery priority.

asr-007748
08:28:18.260 --> 08:28:22.000
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: And the formally raised during the economic recovery meeting

asr-007749
08:28:22.000 --> 08:28:23.880
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: as well as the big bold reform.

asr-007750
08:28:37.760 --> 08:28:41.920
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: So, yes, we're merely following the law that the DOJ has set

asr-007751
08:28:41.920 --> 08:28:45.820
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: for the removal of the 5-hectare retention limit under the CARP.

asr-007752
08:28:45.820 --> 08:28:47.740
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: Actually, hindi po po siya law, Mr. Sponsor.

asr-007753
08:28:47.940 --> 08:28:48.240
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: Ito po.

asr-007754
08:28:48.260 --> 08:28:55.660
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: So, ang tanong ko po ay ano po ang posisyon ng DAR sa opinion ng DOJ

asr-007755
08:28:55.660 --> 08:28:59.240
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: kung isang implikasyon nito ay nangunguhulugan,

asr-007756
08:28:59.360 --> 08:29:03.580
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: ay maaaring mga hulugan na wala na ang agrarian reform

asr-007757
08:29:03.580 --> 08:29:05.640
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: kasi yun po ang sinasabi ng opinion.

asr-007758
08:29:06.340 --> 08:29:09.020
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: Yes, well, clearly, we still have land reform.

asr-007766
08:29:52.000 --> 08:29:53.620
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: So, yes, ma'am.

asr-007767
08:29:53.700 --> 08:29:59.460
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: So, there, we are reading here, it's the implements the DOJ legal opinion.

asr-007768
08:30:00.000 --> 08:30:12.060
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: No. 16-2026, dated March 9, 2026, confirming that retention limits under Republic Act No. 6657 are no longer applicable.

asr-007769
08:30:12.060 --> 08:30:23.300
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: And the request for Land Registration Authority Administrator Gerardo Pangas Sirios requested a Department of Justice opinion on Feb. 18, 2026.

asr-007770
08:30:23.300 --> 08:30:40.820
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: The issue: whether Department of Agrarian Reform land transfer clearance remains necessary for registering private agricultural land transfers after the June 30, 2014 cutoff under Republic Act No. 6657, as amended.

asr-007771
08:30:40.820 --> 08:30:53.280
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: The DOJ's ruling: the acquisition and distribution period under Republic Act No. 6657 was already extended by Republic Acts No. 8532 and

asr-007772
08:30:53.300 --> 08:30:59.540
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: 9700 and deemed June 30, 2014 as the final cutoff.

asr-007773
08:31:00.160 --> 08:31:04.900
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: The proceedings initiated before the cutoff may continue to finality.

asr-007774
08:31:05.840 --> 08:31:13.500
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: Consequently, the general provisions of Republic Act No. 6657, including the 5-hectare retention limit,

asr-007775
08:31:14.120 --> 08:31:22.300
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: inapplicable to new transactions after June 30, 2014, consistent with the doctrine that when the reason for a law ceases,

asr-007776
08:31:22.300 --> 08:31:23.300
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: the law itself.

asr-007777
08:31:23.300 --> 08:31:39.080
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: Implications, the requirement for a Department of Agrarian Reform land transfer clearance and under Administrative Order No. 04 no longer has legal basis supporting its renewal.

asr-007778
08:31:39.860 --> 08:31:49.880
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: And we streamlined the process, removed that requirement for a land transfer clearance under DAR-AO No. 04, easing administrative hurdles.

asr-007779
08:31:51.280 --> 08:31:53.160
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: Maraming salamat, Mr. Sponsor.

asr-007780
08:31:53.300 --> 08:32:02.640
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: Dal birthday ngayon ni Secretary Estella, iisipin ko na lang po na hindi pa po kayo gano'ng kaseryoso sa inyong sagot.

asr-007781
08:32:03.340 --> 08:32:11.040
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: Ang kahilingan ko na lang, Sec, siguro sa DAR, dahil matagal ko na po kayo kasama, taniniwala po ako sa inyo.

asr-007782
08:32:11.160 --> 08:32:13.820
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: In fact, sinusuportahan ko pa talaga yung budget niyo.

asr-007783
08:32:14.260 --> 08:32:22.220
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: Sana lang po ay, kung pwede, mula ngayon po hanggang sa panahon na kailangan na nating magbalik ulit sa lamesa at mag-usap,

asr-007784
08:32:23.300 --> 08:32:26.720
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: ay balikan po natin yung sagot na yan.

asr-007785
08:32:27.560 --> 08:32:33.600
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: Tingin ko hindi po natatapos sa agrarian reform, kaso yun po ang implication ng DOJ opinion.

asr-007786
08:32:33.600 --> 08:32:42.680
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: I'm sure a lot of people in the DAR are also as confused as a lot of farmers asking for clarification for this question.

asr-007787
08:32:43.340 --> 08:32:52.600
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: So, iasaan ko po na open-ended pa po yung sagot ni Mr. Sponsor at naipalawanag naman niyang mabuti ang sinasabi ng laman.

asr-007788
08:32:53.300 --> 08:32:58.560
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: Iaasahan ko lang po ay, pwede po bang mas maging bukas pa tayo sa mas marami pang konsultasyon,

asr-007789
08:32:58.720 --> 08:33:03.300
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: lalo na sa pagkaklaro, kasi ang automatic pong interpretasyon ng lahat,

asr-007790
08:33:04.040 --> 08:33:07.560
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: kahit po nung nasa dinagat ako, itinatawagan ako ng mga magkasaka,

asr-007791
08:33:07.700 --> 08:33:13.460
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: ang sabi sa akin ay, wala ng CARP, wala ng DAR, so hindi na kayo mag-budget briefing.

asr-007792
08:33:13.560 --> 08:33:16.740
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: So, marami pong confusion, Mr. Sponsor.

asr-007793
08:33:16.740 --> 08:33:23.100
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: So, I'm sure it will be very helpful for the DAR not to be very conclusive about,

asr-007794
08:33:23.300 --> 08:33:27.880
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: it says, in the opinion, but be open to a lot of consultations.

asr-007795
08:33:27.980 --> 08:33:34.160
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: It's not a, it's a very parang complicated question, legal question.

asr-007796
08:33:34.320 --> 08:33:42.480
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: So, I just recommend po na, because I also want to be able to raise this as a policy question

asr-007797
08:33:42.480 --> 08:33:45.180
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: that will have a lot of implications on the budget.

asr-007798
08:33:45.580 --> 08:33:49.000
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: Sana lang po ay maging bukas tayo sa pagtatalakay pa.

asr-007799
08:33:49.500 --> 08:33:52.080
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: Anong kahulugan ng opinion na ito?

asr-007800
08:33:53.300 --> 08:33:59.180
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: Na i-interpret siya literal, at I'm sure si Sec will agree with me,

asr-007801
08:33:59.800 --> 08:34:05.220
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: na magiging bukas pa po ang DAR sa pagtatalakay ng isyong ito sa mga magkasaka,

asr-007802
08:34:05.620 --> 08:34:09.400
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: mga ibang civil society organizations, at kahit po sa struktura ng DAR.

asr-007803
08:34:10.540 --> 08:34:15.660
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: Sige po, dalawang questions na lang po, Sec, at may kinalaman din po sa,

asr-007804
08:34:16.160 --> 08:34:21.940
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: kagustuhan ko talagang ma-emphasize po ang questions ng mamamayan sa inyo.

asr-007805
08:34:21.940 --> 08:34:23.220
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: Nung last din po na,

asr-007806
08:34:23.300 --> 08:34:30.720
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: huling malaking dialogue ng DAR, kasama ang mga maraming civil society organizations,

asr-007807
08:34:31.380 --> 08:34:33.480
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: Mr. Sponsor, Madam Speaker,

asr-007808
08:34:34.440 --> 08:34:42.360
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: doon po ay inamin mismo ng DAR na meron pa siyang 147,493.87 hectares na target

asr-007809
08:34:42.360 --> 08:34:48.760
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: na clean, cleaned, past tense, and workable target,

asr-007810
08:34:49.020 --> 08:34:52.420
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: whatever the stage of that accomplishment may be.

asr-007811
08:34:52.420 --> 08:34:52.960
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: Siguro po.

asr-007812
08:34:53.300 --> 08:34:59.820
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: Correct po ako kung tama yung pagkakaunawa ko at pagkakaunawa ng mga nakinig sa inyong dialogo.

asr-007813
08:35:00.660 --> 08:35:03.820
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: Kaya lang, dahil sa pondong na ibigay ngayon,

asr-007814
08:35:04.220 --> 08:35:10.300
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: ang kaya lang i-cover ng DAR ay 16,835 hectares.

asr-007815
08:35:11.140 --> 08:35:14.520
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: Galing din po sa CPBRD notes,

asr-007816
08:35:15.240 --> 08:35:19.100
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: binawasan pa tong target na ito ng 57.8%,

asr-007817
08:35:19.100 --> 08:35:20.920
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: I mean, referring to the budget.

asr-007818
08:35:21.420 --> 08:35:23.140
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: So, ang tanong lang po,

asr-007819
08:35:23.300 --> 08:35:24.940
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: ng mga magkasaka,

asr-007820
08:35:25.640 --> 08:35:31.060
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: kung may natitira pang 147,000 hectares,

asr-007821
08:35:31.760 --> 08:35:36.100
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: bakit wala pang 17,000 ang target nyo for next year?

asr-007822
08:35:36.820 --> 08:35:39.800
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: Siguro po, another way of responding to it also,

asr-007823
08:35:40.540 --> 08:35:46.460
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: ano na nalalang ba talaga ang total hectare age na i-cover ng DAR

asr-007824
08:35:46.460 --> 08:35:52.180
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: kung sinasabi na natin ang LTA component o ang land distribution component

asr-007825
08:35:52.180 --> 08:35:53.140
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: ay,

asr-007826
08:35:53.140 --> 08:35:55.480
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: matatapos by 2028.

asr-007827
08:35:55.480 --> 08:35:57.480
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: So, yun po ang pinakatanong po natin.

asr-007828
08:36:04.180 --> 08:36:05.300
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: Yes, ma'am.

asr-007829
08:36:06.440 --> 08:36:09.880
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: Unang-una, we are not covering it anymore

asr-007830
08:36:09.880 --> 08:36:14.340
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: kasi the period of coverage has already finished ng 2013.

asr-007831
08:36:16.520 --> 08:36:17.920
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: Thank you, Mr. Sponsor.

asr-007832
08:36:18.060 --> 08:36:22.480
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: Or are you asking kung ano yung ipamimigay pa namin ng DAR?

asr-007833
08:36:22.480 --> 08:36:25.420
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: Kanina sa speech mo rin, Mr. Sponsor,

asr-007834
08:36:25.580 --> 08:36:31.900
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: sabi mo, we hope to finish distributing and finishing the targets by 2028.

asr-007835
08:36:32.000 --> 08:36:33.480
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: What are you talking about by 2028?

asr-007836
08:36:34.520 --> 08:36:35.000
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: The target.

asr-007837
08:36:35.240 --> 08:36:36.900
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: At what are we targeting?

asr-007838
08:36:37.080 --> 08:36:42.360
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: Ito ba itumutukoy na lamang sa paglilinis ng mga parcelary mapping surveys

asr-007839
08:36:42.360 --> 08:36:44.480
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: at pamimigay ng individual titles?

asr-007840
08:36:45.560 --> 08:36:45.900
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: Yes.

asr-007841
08:36:46.540 --> 08:36:48.720
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: At ilan po ba ito?

asr-007842
08:36:48.720 --> 08:36:51.500
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: Kasi po, lagi pong laman ng dialogo yan,

asr-007843
08:36:51.500 --> 08:36:55.500
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: ng maraming mga grupong magsasaka at ng DAR.

asr-007844
08:36:56.360 --> 08:36:58.160
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: So, siguro, Mr. Sponsor,

asr-007845
08:36:58.220 --> 08:36:59.080
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: ang tanong ko po ay,

asr-007846
08:36:59.240 --> 08:37:01.040
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: what is the remaining,

asr-007847
08:37:01.780 --> 08:37:02.860
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: when I say target,

asr-007848
08:37:03.160 --> 08:37:07.460
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: I'm not necessarily referring to a particular modality.

asr-007849
08:37:07.920 --> 08:37:10.280
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: I'm asking the target of the department

asr-007850
08:37:10.280 --> 08:37:14.700
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: in its agrarian reform land program

asr-007851
08:37:14.700 --> 08:37:16.500
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: that you want to finish by 2028?

asr-007852
08:37:17.980 --> 08:37:19.500
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: At sinasabi po sa ating datos,

asr-007853
08:37:19.500 --> 08:37:21.320
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: I may, with your budget,

asr-007854
08:37:21.500 --> 08:37:26.300
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: this year, meron lang tayong kayang i-facilitate

asr-007855
08:37:26.300 --> 08:37:28.220
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: the 17,000 hectares,

asr-007856
08:37:28.380 --> 08:37:33.660
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: the 147,893 hectares.

asr-007857
08:37:34.040 --> 08:37:37.500
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: So, alin po ba yung totoo dun sa target talaga ng DAR?

asr-007858
08:37:46.760 --> 08:37:47.440
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: Yes.

asr-007859
08:37:49.400 --> 08:37:51.140
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: Okay, so, for now,

asr-007860
08:37:51.500 --> 08:37:55.100
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: Madam Chair and our Speaker,

asr-007861
08:37:55.840 --> 08:37:59.440
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: we were going to distribute all the land,

asr-007862
08:37:59.700 --> 08:38:03.780
