Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: 2025, 28 million.

asr-007921
08:42:08.460 --> 08:42:13.400
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: Now, we're down to 10.295,710.59.

asr-007922
08:42:14.080 --> 08:42:14.280
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: So...

asr-007923
08:42:15.740 --> 08:42:16.300
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: Yeah.

