asr-007962
08:45:00.000 --> 08:45:17.020
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: We are developing a concept of transitioning the Department of Agrarian Reform into another department that may be called the Department of Rural Development. This has been an initiative in a lot of countries.

asr-007963
08:45:17.020 --> 08:45:36.820
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: At medyo nahuhuli po tayo. Meron po tayong kakatapos lang debate natin kanina tungkol sa urban development. Baka ho pa na ho na para i-transition din natin ng DAR papunta sa isang Department of Rural Development framework na reach to reef ang concept.

asr-007964
08:45:36.820 --> 08:45:46.260
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: At tingin ko mauunawaan po ng mga taga-DAR. Ang sinasabi ko, I'm sure that Mr. Sponsor will also be supportive of this.

asr-007965
08:45:47.020 --> 08:46:10.040
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: Intervention at sana po ay yung pangatlong kahilingan ko, maybe the Department of Agrarian Reform bureaucracy and even the leadership can initially or host a dialogue with civil society, the DAR bureaucracy and other stakeholders to initially talk the possibility of creating a Department of Rural Development as a transition.

asr-007966
08:46:10.040 --> 08:46:16.780
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: Including support for the funds that may be necessary to accomplish what remains to be the target.

asr-007967
08:46:16.780 --> 08:46:17.860
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: until 2028.

